State-owned enterprises and advantageous private enterprises have entered the old revolutionary district of Gannan.
From September 26th to 27th, in order to deepen and expand the educational achievements of the theme of "Don't forget the original intention and remember the mission", the Central Military-civilian integration office, the National Defense Science and Industry Bureau, and the National Federation of Industry and Commerce jointly organized the research activities of "state-owned enterprises and advantageous private enterprises into the old revolutionary district of Gannan", revisited the history of the revolution, traced the red footprint, inherited the red genes, carried out the needs of relevant enterprises with Ganzhou City, and promoted the accelerated development.
Jin Zhuanglong, executive deputy director of the Central Military-civilian Integration Office, Xu Lejiang, deputy director of the Central United Front, party secretary of the All-China Federation of Industry and Commerce, executive vice chairman Xu Lejiang, director of the National Defense Science and Industry Bureau, deputy secretary of the Jiangxi Provincial Party Committee, Li Bingjun, secretary of the Ganzhou Municipal Party Committee, participated in the survey.
Participating in the research activities are China Aerospace Science and Technology Group Co., Ltd. and other eight military industrial group companies, Hunan rare earth metal materials research institute and other 10 private enterprises such as state-owned enterprises, Yanxiang Group and other 15 advantageous private enterprises.
During this period, the researchers visited the commemorative park of the departure point of the Long March of the Central Red Army, remembered the revolutionary martyrs, accepted the traditional education of the revolution, reviewed the difficult history of the Long March period of the Red Army, investigated 7 enterprises and 1 testing center in Ganzhou City on the spot, held a special symposium, reached 8 cooperation projects and signed on-site contracts.
At the symposium of the research activities, Ganzhou City introduced its unique industrial advantages and introduced high-quality projects to the participating enterprises.
On behalf of the Military Industry Group Corporation, Minkou State-owned enterprises, private enterprises, and local enterprises respectively, China Garment Industry Group Co., Ltd., China Steel Research Technology Group Co., Ltd., Xi'an Tianhe Defense Technology Co., Ltd. and Jiangxi Jinli Permanent Magnetic Technology Co., Ltd. respectively made speeches, saying that it will continue to strengthen the demand docking work between state-owned enterprises, advantageous private enterprises and Jiangxi Province and Ganzhou City, gradually broaden the field of cooperation, help industrial transformation and upgrading, and promote high-quality development.
Through this research activity, we will further understand the unique industrial development advantages of the old revolutionary district of Gannan, clarify the key tasks of the economic and social development of the old revolutionary area at this stage, strengthen the belief that state-owned and private enterprises will serve the people and entrepreneurship, and play an important role in promoting the transformation mode, structural adjustment, and people's livelihood of Gannanyuan Central Soviet District, and promoting the quality change of economic development, efficiency change, and dynamic change.
Beijing's market supervision department to carry out comprehensive law enforcement before the festival, commodity prices are basically stable
BEIJING, Sept. 27 (Reporter Du Yan) In order to strengthen pre-holiday market supervision and law enforcement, the Beijing Municipal Market Supervision Bureau inspected more than 2,000 households of various business entities on the eve of the National Day.
The inspection shows that the supply of daily necessities such as grain and oil, meat, fruits, vegetables and egg milk sold in the market is sufficient, the price of goods is basically stable, no serious violations have been found, and the market operation order is generally stable.
Today, the reporter learned from the Beijing Municipal Market Supervision Bureau that the bureau carried out "comprehensive law enforcement inspection day" activities in the city, focusing on prices, industry and commerce, quality supervision, food and medicine, commerce and other elements, all aspects of law enforcement inspection, comprehensive regulation of market operation order.
According to reports, the Beijing Municipal Market Supervision Bureau price, industry and commerce, quality supervision, food and medicine, commerce and other five law enforcement teams to work together, close cooperation, led by the heads of various law enforcement agencies, groups of randomly selected parts of the business entities for joint law enforcement inspections.
During the inspection, law enforcement officials focused on checking price behavior, advertising, food safety, measurement standards, and production safety systems.
The market supervision bureaus of each district have also organized joint law enforcement inspections, dispatched more than 1,600 law enforcement personnel, inspected more than 2,000 households of various business entities, and the inspection shows that the supply of daily necessities such as grain and oil, meat, fruits, vegetables, and egg milk sold in the market is sufficient, the commodity prices are basically stable, the operators can abide by the law, and no serious violations have been found, and the market operation order is generally stable.
The Beijing Municipal Market Supervision Bureau said that during the National Day, it will strengthen emergency duty, continue to carry out inspections and inspections of the market, quickly deal with all kinds of market supervision problems in accordance with the law, and conduct business violations reflected by the public, once verified, will be dealt with seriously in accordance with the law, and effectively safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of consumers.
Confucius Institute of the Royal Cambodian Academy of Sciences "China in My Heart" Chinese Essay Contest Announced
On the 26th, with the theme of the 70th anniversary of New China, the "China in my heart" Chinese essay contest was announced and the award ceremony was held at the Confucius Institute of the Royal Cambodian Academy of Sciences on the 26th.
Wei Siyu, a diplomat at the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia, a representative of the Cambodian-Chinese Council and president of the Jiangxi Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia, presented awards to the award-winning guests.
According to Chai Keqing, Chinese director of the Confucius Institute at the Royal Cambodian Academy of Sciences, the competition lasted for two months and was attended by Cambodian primary school students, secondary school students (including tertiary students) and university students (including social personnel).
Chinese Embassy in Cambodia Diplomat Zhong Zhanfa issued the winning certificate for Lin Weicai, winner of the first prize in the university group, and Guo Lina, winner of the first prize of the primary and secondary school groups.
Chai Keqing said that the entries according to the university group and the primary and secondary school groups are separated, inviting the judging committee of senior Chinese language experts in Cambodia, through the preliminary evaluation, review, final evaluation and other links, and finally selected the first prize of the university group, 2 second prizes, 3 third prizes, and 10 excellent awards; the primary and secondary school group's first prize, 5 second prizes, 10 third prizes, and 20 excellent awards.
Lin Weicai, winner of the first prize in the university group, said that after 15 years of learning Chinese, it has had a huge impact on himself.
Through the essay competition, it is to describe the well-being brought to Cambodia under the "Belt and Road" and the traditional friendship between China and Cambodia, hoping that the younger generation will continue to contribute to China-Cambodia friendship.
Guests and award-winning players.
Guo Lina, first prize winner of the primary and secondary school group, said that as an overseas Chinese, she has the opportunity to express the emotion of "China in my heart" and win the award through the words of his native country, and has a different excitement.
Organizers said that through the competition, not only created a positive atmosphere of China-Cambodia relations, but also attracted more and more Cambodian students to learn Chinese and study in China.
According to a report released by the International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) on the 26th, Iran has begun to use advanced centrifuges to accelerate the production of enriched uranium, further violating the nuclear agreement reached with world powers in 2015.
According to the IAEA report, advanced centrifuges at Iran's Natanz Nuclear Facility "are accumulating or ready to accumulate enriched uranium."
Since U.S. President Donald Trump withdrew from the nuclear deal in May last year and imposed sanctions on Iran, Iran is gradually violating the restrictions of the 2015 nuclear agreement with major powers.
According to the agreement, Iran can only refine uranium with first-generation IR-1 centrifuges.
Other signatories to the deal, Britain, China, France, Germany and Russia, have been trying to salvage it, but Tehran has repeatedly accused Europe of not doing enough.
According to Japan's Kyodo News Agency, on the afternoon of the 25th local time, Japanese Foreign Minister Motegi Minchong held talks with Russian Foreign Minister Lavrov in New York, United States, and confirmed that it will promote the conclusion and negotiation of a peace treaty, including the territorial issues of the northern four islands (Japan-Russia disputed islands, known as the â€œNorthern Four Islandsâ€ and â€œSouthern Kuril Islandsâ€).
This is Mogi's first consultation with Russia as the head of the negotiation of a peace treaty.
Motegi told the Russian side that it hopes to carry out practical consultations, including promoting common economic activities (in the four northern islands).
According to the Government of Japan, the talks did not take place in detail on territorial issues.
At the Japan-Russia summit in December 2018, the foreign ministers of the two countries confirmed the policy of speeding up the negotiations as the heads of the two countries.
At this meeting, the foreign ministers of the two countries welcomed the progress of consultations on common economic activities in the fields of tourism and garbage disposal.
Motegi said that it is looking forward to the implementation of the sightseeing tourism pilot business in October: "I hope to successfully implement it and promote the next step."
In addition, the talks also confirmed that Lavrov will cooperate with the G20 foreign ministers' meeting held in Nagoya in November.
Tuionetoa has been elected as Tonga’s new prime minister.
On the 27th, the Parliament of Tonga, a South Pacific island country, elected the current Minister of Finance and National Planning, Poshiva Tuionetoa, as Tonga's new prime minister, to replace former Prime Minister Akilisi Pohiva, who died of illness earlier this month.
According to the website MATANGI, Tonga's main media outlet, the Tongan Parliament is unicameral and consists of 26 parliamentarians.
In the parliamentary vote on the same day, Tuionetoa won 23 votes, defeating rival Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Infrastructure and Tourism Semisi Sika, and was successfully elected.
Tonga is a constitutional monarchy with a system of separation of executive, legislative and judicial powers.
Tuionettoa was also required to accept the king's appointment.
The next parliamentary elections in Tonga will take place in 2021.
The women's volleyball team is expected to defend the World Cup in advance!
On the 27th, in the game against the Dutch women's volleyball team, the Chinese team was pulled back by the opponent in the case of winning two games in a row, and finally ushered in nine consecutive wins by the Netherlands with 3:1.
The schedule of the World Cup is nearing the end, although the defense is expected, but in the face of the Serbian team, the Chinese women's volleyball team still can not be taken lightly.
In the first two games with the Netherlands, the performance of the Chinese women's volleyball team was as strong as usual, with 25:19, 25:16 down the two cities, until the third game, the team encountered setbacks.
The Dutch women's volleyball team strengthened the attack on the service, and the Chinese team was affected, coupled with the girl's attack, the mistakes began to increase, and finally the opponent pulled back to a city with 21:25.
After the game, Lang Ping also pointed out in an interview: "The third game, because of mistakes we sent about 8 points."
Of course, the strength of the Dutch women's volleyball team should not be underestimated, China's women's volleyball before also made difficult preparations, although losing a game, but everything is still in Lang Ping's grasp, "and the strong team to win and lose is very normal, playing five games is also very normal, so we said to the players to focus," Lang Ping said.
In the fourth game, the players actively adjusted the state, Zhang Changning in the offensive side of the fire fully open, a single game to get 8 points, for the team to win to make great achievements.
So far, only two rounds of 11 rounds of confrontation, although the Chinese women's volleyball team has touched the championship trophy, but in the game against the Dutch team did sound the alarm to the Chinese women's volleyball: the more critical moments, the more to go all out.
In another game on the 27th, the Russian and American women's volleyball teams filled five sets, and the U.S. team failed to take all three points from their opponents, so that the Chinese women's volleyball team could defend as soon as they took all three points in the game against Serbia.
All these situations are moving towards a favorable situation for the Chinese women's volleyball team.
However, although Serbia's six major players are all missing, this does not mean that they will easily send three points to the Chinese team.
Judging from the form of the current standings, the Serbian team has basically missed the medal, which means that they can be "lightly loaded" against China's women's volleyball team, put down the burden to hit the opponent, and the Chinese team is burdened with the pressure to win the championship, but the state may have ups and downs.
In addition, the replacement of the Serbian team is not the "slaughter" of the lambs, after a battle with the Dutch team, the two sides fought 5 games, the Serbian second team finally 3:2 reversed the Netherlands' all-force lineup, which shows the depth of its lineup thickness.
Before the start of the third stage of the game, Lang Ping also said that the Netherlands and Sai were not easy to deal with: "Osaka's game will be very difficult, we still have to, as always, seriously prepared."
Now the trumpet of defense has been sounded, and the game has really entered the "white-heating stage".
When it comes to strength, the Chinese women's volleyball team is above the opponent, just the last critical moment, but also depends on whether the women's volleyball girls can play the normal level and release themselves on the field.
The "2nd Macao Stem Cell Symposium" held by the University of Macau today (27) attracted more than 100 experts and scholars from the United States, Singapore, the mainland, Hong Kong and Macao, who are engaged in the research of "external stem cells" to share and discuss the latest technology and development of stem cell research with teachers and students of Macao universities.
Ge Wei, vice president of the University of Australia (research), said that stem cell research has medical value and is also one of the key scientific research projects of the University, which is a seminar to help promote Macao's research and development in the field of stem cells.
Ge Wei said that as a leading international comprehensive university on the west coast of the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area, the University is committed to building a talent training base and scientific and technological innovation center on the west coast of the Greater Bay Area to help the innovation and development of the Bay Area.
The seminar brought together research experts in stem cells at home and abroad to share the latest technologies, which will help promote the research and development of stem cells in Macao.
Deng, president of the University's School of Health Sciences, said that in recent years, the University has continuously strengthened scientific research and innovation and transformation, which has also been significantly improved in terms of the quantity and quality of papers, and has also achieved fruitful results in stem cell research.
At the meeting, a group of well-known scholars shared cutting-edge knowledge and cutting-edge technology of stem cell research.
Academician of the Chinese Academy of Sciences and dean of Yunnan Kunming University of Science and Technology Primate Transformation Medical College Ji Weizhi explained the use of 3D culture system to study monkeys and human embryos in vitro and their molecular mechanisms; the Chinese Academy of Sciences Shanghai Institute of Biochemical Cells researcher Jing Naihe, from a single cell and molecular level to explain the mouse embryo after implantation cell genealogy decision and organization of space-time changes; Pennsylvania State University professor Wang Yong to show you how to use the material hydrogel simulation stem cell micro nest to facilitate survival and transportation.
Xu Renhe, Vice President (Research) of the College of Health Sciences of the University of Australia, Chen Guokai, Assistant Dean, and Wang Chunming, an associate professor at the Greater Chinese Medical Research Institute of Australia, also introduced their newly released important results respectively.
The "2nd Macao Stem Cell Symposium" was sponsored by the Faculty of Health Sciences of the University of Macau, co-organized by the Chinese Medical Research Institute of the University of Macau and the National Key Laboratory of Chinese Quality Research of the Macao University of Science and Technology.
There are 11 academic reports in the seminar, including embryonic development and tissue generation, translational medicine, the mechanism research and application of stem cells, biological materials and applications.
There was a lively atmosphere in which participants actively discussed and shared the latest research and perspectives on relevant technologies.
Xu Renhe said that the seminar provided a platform for the exchange and cooperation of stem cell experts in the Greater Bay Area and other regions, and also provided students with valuable learning opportunities.
The awarding ceremony of national medals and national honorary titles of the People's Republic of China will be solemnly held.
With the approval of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, the awarding ceremony of the National Medal of the People's Republic of China and the national honorary title will be held at 10 a.m. in the Great Hall of the People on September 29.
General Secretary of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, President of the CPC Central Committee and Chairman of the Central Military Commission Xi Jinping will award and make an important speech to the recipients of national medals and national honorary titles of "Order of the Republic", "Order of Friendship" and national honorary titles.
With the approval of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, the awarding ceremony of the National Medal of the People's Republic of China and the national honorary title will be held at 10 a.m. in the Great Hall of the People in Beijing on September 29.
This is the "Order of the Republic".
The "Order of the Republic" is based on red and golden colors, using elements such as national emblem, five-cornered stars, the Yellow River, the Yangtze River, mountains, peonies, etc. The chapter chain adopts elements such as Chinese knots, Ruyi, orchids, and the overall use of cold pressure molding, floral mosaic, enamel and other craftsmanship, symbolizing the great contributions made to the construction and development of the Republic.
It's the "Order of Friendship".
The "Friendship Medal" takes gold and blue as the main tone, the chapter body adopts elements such as peace doves, the earth, handshakes, lotus flowers, etc. The chapter chain adopts elements such as Chinese knots, ten thousand years of youth, peony, jade, orchid grass, etc. As a whole, the use of traditional crafts such as floral mosaic and silk enamel is hand-crafted, which symbolizes the friendly unity and friendship between the Chinese people and the people of all countries.
This is the National Medal of Honor.
The national honorary title medal is based on red, gold as the main color, the chapter body adopts elements such as five stars, Tiananmen Square, peony, flag, light, etc. The chapter chain adopts elements such as Chinese knots, flowers, etc. As a whole, using cold pressure molding, floral mosaic, enamel and other craftsmanship, which symbolizes the major contributions made by the recipients of national honorary titles in various industries in various fields.
The Central Radio and Television Station and Xinhua Network will broadcast the award ceremony live, and key central news websites such as the people's network, the CCTV network, and the Chinese network, as well as new media platforms such as the People's Daily client, Xinhua News Agency client and CCTV news client, will be broadcast simultaneously.
“Over the past 70 years, NATO’s containment and defensive measures have been based on maintaining technological advantages,” Stoltenberg said in a speech at the U.S. Military Academy at West Point.
He said, but times are changing.
Stoltenberg said: "We are facing more and more fierce competition.
Therefore, we should now redouble our efforts to be sure that there will be no one beyond us."
"Some of the new technologies are not developed by NATO members, but by dictatorships," he said.
Chinese companies are working on 5G networks.
“Russia is developing an independent Internet and investing heavily in the development of next-generation weapons, such as hypersonic missiles.”
Stoltenberg said NATO's future security "depends on the ability to understand, accept and apply the latest advanced technologies."
On September 24th, "a ticket takes me to see" love disability activities was held in Changsha, and more than 100 people with disabilities from Changsha were invited to board the Orange Star Cruise to enjoy the magnificent scenery of the Xiangjiang River and jointly celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China.
Most of the more than 100 people with disabilities who participated in the event boarded the cruise ship for the first time.
56-year-old Zhao Zhengang is a remnant, because his feet are inconvenient, usually rarely go out.
He said: "Today for the first time on the cruise ship, close to enjoy the waves of the Xiangjiang, feel the pulse of Changsha's development, the mood is very excited, it is unforgettable."
Volunteers from the Fukang Social Work Service Center in Changsha and the blue sky rescue team provided nuanced services for people with disabilities.
Especially for those who have serious physical disabilities, volunteers will carry them up and down the cruise ship.
The relevant person in charge of Fukang Social Work Service Center said that in the past 70 years, with the support of the party and the government, the cause of persons with disabilities in Changsha City has continuously developed and progressed, and more and more disabled people have truly become participants, contributors and recipients of socio-economic development, and caring for and supporting the cause of persons with disabilities has gradually become the consensus of the whole society.
The Republic is about to usher in the 70th anniversary celebration, and the spotlights of the various media are shining, so that many of the images we don't usually remember, glittering - it is them, for our shining days, the silk brings heat energy and light sources.
However, if the hero walks around, it also seems as ordinary as you are like me.
Yuan Longping, devoted himself to the study of rice, breeding good seeds all over the world, so that more than a billion people do no longer have the jeopardy of hunger, unrelenting, this is usually like an old farmer who likes to walk in the field; Nan Rendong, exhausted to let China's "heavenly eyes" angry chief scientist, a person, a lifetime, a pot, only do one thing in a lifetime.
As long as they are immersed in the incomprehensible of outsiders, they will easily be happy, and they do not care about the famous profits and the wealth and glory.
Just as in Jin Yong’s novels, Shaolin Monastery is a sweeping monk, although he has a shocking martial arts, he is not blinded, and there is no joy and no sadness.
Every "sweeping monk", every pair of children's hearts, there is a share behind my own national responsibility.
The responsibility of the country is not only carried on the shoulders of heroes, but also in the hands of hundreds of millions of people.
Once, the words of a female middle school student, by netizens crazy, "when the hero passed, there are always people sitting on the side of the road clapping ... ... I don't want to become a hero, I want to be sitting on the side of the road to applaud people."
In fact, when the hero and the hero applaud, there is no contradiction.
People who applaud by the side of the road are also transmitting heat and light, and they are also luminous bodies.
Ordinary like you and me, there are always some opportunities in life, there are some moments, there is a kind of accumulation, is also shaping the appearance of heroes.
Shanghai's excellent judge Zou Bihua, shoulder the heavy responsibility of judicial reform, but at the annual meeting let the communication room teacher on the stage to tell their own stories, a year to receive and receive countless newspaper letters, from the error-free, "doing simple things well, it is not simple", Zou Bihua led the judges will give applause to the "sweeping monk"-style old message.
This is a pity between the heroes, is a hero is applausing another hero.
Sweeping monks have Shaolin Monastery Tibetan Pavilion, Yuan Longping has a vast rice experimental field, Nan Rendong has a "eye of heaven", Qin Yi has a stage, Zhou Yuchang has a pulpit ... whether to be a hero, do not rely on their own efforts, more have a better environment and a positive incentive mechanism.
For example, "China's eye", now seems to be a myth.
In the 1990s, China's scientific and technological community is still struggling to climb, and novelist Liu Cixin has not yet written "three bodies".
At that time, the "eyes" of the cattle were the one-sided caliber radio telescope in the valley of Puerto Rico Island in the United States, Arecibo, with a diameter of 350 meters, which is considered to be the best in the "unsurpassable" world.
At that time, China's radio telescope was less than one-tenth the diameter.
Nan Rendong, who enjoys world-class scientific research conditions and salaries in Japan, insisted on returning home, bringing back an almost crazy idea: to build a new generation of radio "big telescopes" in China and receive more information from outer space!
China's hundreds of years of prosperity, invest a lot of money to play with the stars?
The motherland trusts South Rendong, and the "Heaven's Eye" project opens.
It took 12 years to select the site, and it took 9 years to complete.
The 500-meter-caliber "Heavenly Eye" is opened, and China has made a "big scientific project unique in the world" without precedent.
Therefore, the "eyes of heaven" are great, the South Rendong are remarkable, there is a large, lofty republic is great.
With the trust of the country and the goodwill of the people, the South Rendong side has the opportunity to become the soul of the country.
There are young talents, white-haired heroes have passed, and there are people gently applauding on the side of the road, such a country is very beautiful and very harmonious.
Garbage classification education first into Jilin Kindergarten environmental protection concept from the doll
On the 27th, a kindergarten in Jilin City, Jilin Province, carried out garbage classification education classes to teach young children to distinguish between recyclable garbage and other categories of garbage.
It is reported that this is the first time that garbage classification has entered the local early childhood education classroom.
A few days ago, nine departments of Jilin Province jointly issued the "Jilin Province to promote prefecture-level municipal household waste classification and disposal work plan".
In 2019, on the basis of the pilot of compulsory classification of domestic waste in Changchun City, the province decided to carry out domestic waste classification work in prefecture-level cities.
The city of Jilin is one of them.
We hope that through this event, we can realize the effect of promoting the family with young children and the society driven by kindergarten, and advocate the concept of environmental protection.
Liu Lijuan, executive director of Hi Faner International Kindergarten, who held the event, said.
On the same day, the director read out the environmental protection proposal, hoping that the garbage classification should start from the children.
After the children performed the "low-carbon babe" dance, the children started a small game of garbage sorting in groups.
The instructors also issued “recyclable” and “other garbage” labels, advising children to go home and stick them to the trash and record small videos.
Liu Lijuan introduced that the kindergarten has always advocated the concept of low-carbon and green environmental protection, and regularly opened an environmental protection lecture hall.
There are also sortable garbage cans at the garbage delivery office in the park, which are marked with delivery categories.
The teacher teaches the children what is recyclable garbage 苍雁
According to preliminary statistics, the amount of municipal domestic waste generated by Jilin Province in 2018 was about 5.4652 million tons, all of which entered the domestic waste disposal site for treatment.
Among them, 3.2929 million tons of sanitary landfill, incineration of 2.0923 million tons, comprehensive utilization of the process to deal with 80,100 tons.
After years of hard work, all cities and counties in the province have the ability to deal with the harmless treatment of domestic waste.
In the "Jilin Province to promote prefecture-level municipal domestic waste classification and disposal work plan", it is explicitly required to carry out in-depth garbage classification into the campus, into teaching materials, into the classroom and other activities, through the creation of garbage sorting songs, songs, cartoons, micro videos and other works, to strengthen the interaction between students and parents, to achieve the effect of "to educate a child, affect a family, drive a community, cultivate a new generation."
According to data released by Mazda on September 27, global sales in August were 117015 units.
Sales in China fell 21% due to the inadequate delivery of new cars and the reduction of price cuts.
Japan's domestic sales decreased by 6%, and there was limited demand for the last bus before the tax increase in October.
Mazda sold 17,729 units in China in August.
August 2018 also decreased by 13% from the previous year, and sales continued to decrease.
China's main SUV "CX-4" sales decreased by 14%.
"CX-4" in 2016 has been listed for a long time, and the effect of new cars has declined.
Due to the strategy of increasing the value of the brand from a long-term perspective and reducing the price reduction, it is reported that it also has a great impact on sales.
Mazda's U.S. sales grew 7 percent year-over-year to 27,482 units, an increase after 14 months.
In August, the seller's business day was one day more than the previous year, coupled with "strengthening promotional activities such as promotional activities" (Mazda), which led to an increase in sales of SUV "CX-5".
Domestic sales in Japan fell 6 percent to 14,422 units.
According to the company, the emergency snap-up before the tax increase "is not as high as the last time (2014)."
Sales of small cars such as "Demio" have decreased.
Chirac's death is a legacy of politics.
On the 26th local time, former French President Jacques Chirac died at the age of 86.
At a time when the world is in the midst of a great change that hasn’t happened in a hundred years, many of the political legacies left by this French politician when he came to power still deserve our praise.
Chirac served as president of France for 12 years.
He inherits the spirit of de Gaullism's independent diplomacy, but also firmly supports European integration, and is the representative of the pursuit of the "European dream".
At the same time, he also vigorously advocates multipolarity and multilateralism in the world, and is a politician with a strategic vision.
For this reason, the French media commented that he was "an outstanding representative of France on the world stage".
One of Chirac’s relishing political decisions was its opposition to the U.S.-led war in Iraq.
Under his leadership, France has joined forces with Germany to withstand the pressure of the United States and is at the forefront of anti-war.
A year after the outbreak of the war, he predicted that the war in Iraq would lead to an intensification of terrorist activities and make the world more dangerous.
It turned out that Chirac’s warning was correct.
At a time when European integration is mired in wanderings and the unilateralism of the United States is becoming more and more prominent, Chirac's strategic thinking and choices about international politics and global affairs undoubtedly have strong inspirational significance.
Chirac is also a French politician who makes the Chinese feel familiar and friendly.
He is one of the advocates and creators of the "golden decade" of China-France relations, and after he was first elected as President of France in 1995, he promoted the rapid development of Sino-French relations with the strategic vision of politicians.
In 2004, China and France established a comprehensive strategic partnership, and China-France bilateral exchanges have entered a new stage.
During Chirac's administration, bilateral trade between China and France grew rapidly, and the cooperation between the two countries in various fields such as aviation, nuclear energy, and railway transportation has made breakthrough progress.
Chirac's Sino-French Cultural Year has created a completely new model of cultural exchanges in the history of China and France.
Chirac’s lifelong love for Chinese culture was particularly impressive.
It is understood that his Chinese diplomats introduced that Chirac can carry some of the poems of Li Bai and Du Fu, and can even accurately judge the historical era of Chinese bronzes.
"It doesn''t really go to Egypt without looking at the pyramids, it's not really going to China without seeing Qin Jun" - this golden sentence comes from Chirac.
In an interview with Xinhua News Agency, Chiracker said: "The West has concerns about China's political and social development, the ecological problems caused by China's economic growth, and China's political position in the world.
However, I have full confidence in China.
I believe that China is a country with a long history of civilization, and its experience is enough to help it establish ideas and values to achieve harmonious development and shoulder its responsibilities on the world stage for a long time.”
I also believe that China's rejuvenation will bring new creative vitality to world culture and enrich world culture.
The people have gone, but the political heritage and revelation that Chirac has left to the world will survive.
"The 7th China Computer Society big data academic conference" opened in Wuhan on the 27th with the theme of "numeric light valley and wisdom to enjoy the future", nearly 1,000 experts and scholars in the field of big data research, pay attention to the hot research issues of big data, and interpret the technical process of big data in the era of artificial intelligence.
Hosted by the Chinese Computer Society (CCF) and co-sponsored by the CCF Big Data Expert Committee and Huazhong University of Science and Technology, the conference organized five invited reports and 188 forum reports, and set up 33 sub-forums on thematic technology and industry, which exchanged and discussed the research results of big data basic theory, big data education, big data visualization, big data finance and science and technology.
CCF big data academic conference to strengthen engaged in the field of big data between domestic and foreign scholars between contacts and exchanges, to promote multidisciplinary cross-integration and big data industry development as the purpose, after 7 sessions, has developed into scientific research results-based communication, the most influential big data academic conference, the content of the conference extended to the basic theory, technology applications and other fields.
Members of the Legislative Council of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region signed a petition against the U.S. Hong Kong-related bill
Some members of the establishment of the Legislative Council of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region issued a joint statement on the 27th, expressing strong opposition to the adoption of the "Hong Kong Human Rights and Democracy Act 2019" by the Foreign Affairs Committee of the Senate and House of Representatives of the United States Congress.
At present, Hong Kong's rights are granted by the Basic Law of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, including maintaining the status of a free trade port and a separate customs territory, signing and implementing bilateral and multilateral agreements in different fields such as economy, finance, shipping, trade, communications, tourism, culture and sports, in the name of "Hong Kong, China" with trade, cooperation and development relations with different countries and regions around the world.
These rights are not granted by any foreign government or legislature.
Hong Kong has strictly adhered to international agreements, international rules, laws and business ethics, trade with different countries and regions, and participated in cooperation in many related fields.
According to the statement, it is not necessary for the Foreign Affairs Committee of the United States Senate and House of Representatives to pass the relevant bills, but only in response to the call of its Hong Kong agents, as a means of grossly interfering in Hong Kong's internal affairs and winning political leverage for its agents in Hong Kong.
Members of the United States deeply regretted this and strongly opposed it.
Hong Kong is an important trading partner of the United States and the source of the largest trade surplus.
Hong Kong's excellent rule of law, fair and free business environment, and an incorruptible society make it a good place for American businessmen to do business.
If the United States adopts this bill, in addition to cracking down on the interests of Hong Kong and the United States itself, it will make China-US relations worse and have no benefits, which will harm others.
Hong Kong will, as always, unswervingly implement the "one country, two systems" policy, continue to enjoy the rights granted by the Basic Law, and earnestly fulfill its obligations.
Whether in the past, present or in the future, Hong Kong will continue to make its due contribution to the international community and international trade.
According to the "European Times" reported on the 26th, the two houses of the French parliament will discuss immigration policy reform next week.
French President Emmanuel Macron recently said that France cannot "accept everyone", but at the same time, it must strive to "accept it properly".
According to the report, Macron is trying to find a compromise route on immigration affairs to slow down the upcoming debate.
Recently, Macron said in an interview during his participation in the general debate of the General Assembly in New York that he hoped to have a real "two-pronged" plan on immigration policy to find a balance between humanitarianism and efficiency.
Macron said: â€œIf France wants to be able to properly accept (immigrants), it can't accept everyone,â€ Macron said.
Macron cites four priorities of immigration policy: granting asylum status to refugees in need of protection as soon as possible; promoting the integration of migrants more efficiently; receiving and protecting all migrants entering French territory; and more efficiently resettling people who have entered France illegally and are not suitable to stay.
Whether illegal immigrants should be protected by the “state medical assistance” (AME) system is the most discussed topic in the past.
Macron said he wanted to "evaluate" the system, but did not remove it, but imposed some restrictions on it.
After Macron's remarks, the leader of the far-right "National Alliance" Le Pen tweeted that Macron's statement was "empty talk".
Rasher, a member of the right-wing Republican faction and president of the Senate, also said that immigration policies should be discussed in a way that is "defayed" but "facing reality" and indirectly criticizing Macron.
On the issue of immigration, France should “accept more and better” and criticized Macron’s efforts to “manipulate” the issue.
A year after the release of the new asylum and immigration law, it has led to differences of opinion within the ruling party, but at the same time it has not been able to appease right-wing opposition parties.
In the next 2022 general election, the topic of immigration policy will once again become the focus of attacks on the far right, and Macron needs to make a difference on this issue, but it will also run the risk of irritating those on the ruling party’s internal left.
According to reports, the lower house of France's National Assembly will debate immigration policy from September 30, and the Senate will debate from October 2.
There are signs that China's A shares are ushering in a "repurchase tide", and many listed companies have come up with "real gold and silver" to buy back the company's shares.
According to the statistics of Oriental Wealth, a financial data service provider, as of the 27th, the total amount of repurchase implementation of A-share listed companies in 2019 has exceeded 100 billion yuan (RMB, the same below), far exceeding the data of the same period in previous years, setting a new historical high in the amount of A-share share repurchase funds.
In this regard, Xu Yang, chairman of Shanghai Miao Corong Information Consulting Co., Ltd., said that the overall valuation of the A-share market this year is low, with a relatively low price to repurchase shares, which is conducive to listed companies to improve the efficiency of the use of funds, but also reflects the willingness of listed companies to actively manage the market value and abundant cash flow, which is conducive to boosting investor confidence.
In addition, the continuous improvement of the share repurchase system has also promoted listed companies to actively carry out share repurchases.
For example, at the beginning of this year, the Shanghai Stock Exchange and the Shenzhen Stock Exchange issued the implementation rules for the repurchase of shares by listed companies, providing listed companies with detailed rules and guidelines for share repurchases.
In addition, according to media statistics, since this year, listed companies that have implemented an increase in repurchase plans are mainly concentrated in the infrastructure industry, real estate industry, information technology industry and electronic equipment manufacturing industry.
In addition, from the point of view of the amount of repurchase payment, this year, there are six listed companies repurchase amount of more than 1 billion yuan.
Among them, in the first place is Yili's shares, and its repurchase amount is more than 5 billion yuan.
What impact will the repurchase of shares by listed companies have on the market?
Zhao Xijun, vice dean of the School of Finance and Finance of Renmin University of China, said in an interview with the China News Agency that on the one hand, the repurchase shows that listed companies have strong economic strength and good financial situation, and have the ability to maintain the stability of stock prices and give investors confidence; on the other hand, it also shows that listed companies and their controlling shareholders are responsible for the company, the market is responsible for and the investors.
The former is based on the company's good business performance, while the latter requires listed companies and their controlling shareholders to have high quality.
For the capital market, these are the core basic elements.
The repurchase of shares by listed companies is conducive to boosting investor confidence and supporting the stock prices of listed companies.
In addition, according to the Oriental Securities Research Report, according to the expected number of stock repurchases set by A-share listed companies since the beginning of this year, as well as the average transaction price of repurchased shares, the incremental funds brought by repurchasing shares for the A-share market this year are expected to exceed 150 billion yuan.
In the past two months, the restoration work of the large-scale murals of Tianjin Tiangong, a key national cultural protection unit, was announced on the 26th, and will be reopened to the public during the National Day this year.
"Sanctuaries of the Day" is a large-scale traditional mural that comprehensively reflects the life of Mazzu.
With the approval of the relevant departments of the state, it was painted by Cai Changkui, director of the former Tianjin Civic Museum (Tianyuan Palace), from 1991 to 1994.
It is understood that this mural was painted on the south and north palace walls of the main hall, with a total length of 32 meters and a height of 2.6 meters, divided into two parts, more than 30 stories such as giving birth, crossing the sea, and ascending into the sky, 358 characters recreating the life and deeds of Mazu.
In recent years, it has been rainy in the summer and dried in winter in Tianjin, which has led to the rupture of the murals, accounting for 60% of the entire mural area.
In order to protect and rescue the murals of Mazu's deeds, the Ancient Cultural Street Management Committee of Nankai District of Tianjin City and the Tiangong Palace launched the restoration project of murals in the Temple of the Tin Hau Palace.
The restoration project was led by Cai Changkui, and four well-known Chinese painters were invited to participate.
The restoration work is based on the principle of "repairing as old as old", and at the same time, the original murals have made adjustments to the local content, and the murals have been replenished and repaired where the murals were not perfect.
In the process of restoration, we have also made innovations and attempts in terms of colors, materials, pen and ink.
After the restoration, the style, spirituality, spirit and artistic style of the original murals were maintained.
Tianjian Palace was built in 1326, formerly known as Tianfei Palace, commonly known as the Mother's Palace, after many repairs, it is the oldest building complex in Tianjin, and it is also one of the earliest Mazu temples in China.
On September 25, Beijing Daxing International Airport was put into operation solemnly.
Beijing Daxing International Airport terminal's shape means "phoenix wings", known as the "new world seven wonders" first.
At present, Beijing Capital International Airport is already overloaded, carrying 100 million+ passengers last year, becoming the world's second airport with more than 100 million passengers in the past year after Atlanta Airport in the United States.
It is expected that by 2022, the passenger throughput of Beijing Daxing International Airport will reach 45 million passengers, accounting for 20% of international flights; by 2025, the passenger throughput will reach 72 million passengers, and the proportion of international flights is expected to reach 30%.
As a "new country", how cool is it?
Beijing Daxing International Airport is located between Daxing District of Beijing and Guangyang District of Langfang City, Hebei Province, with a straight distance of 46 kilometers, which is currently the world's largest construction of a new airport.
The ground projection area of the roof cover steel structure of its terminal has reached 180,000 square meters, with the size of 25 standard football fields.
Beijing Daxing International Airport is the world's first terminal with two arrivals and two departures - F1-F4 are international arrivals, domestic arrivals, domestic departures, and international departures.
The double-decker bridge connecting the outside of the terminal to the high-speed and the airport, respectively, corresponds to the F3 and F4 terminals - the international departure level, and the domestic departure can be on both floors.
Beijing Daxing International Airport's first flight opened the era of Beijing's "double airport".
The new airport is positioned as a large-scale international aviation hub, a new power source for the country's development, supporting the construction of Xiong'an New Area of the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei regional comprehensive transportation hub, as of now, a total of 66 airlines intend to enter Beijing Daxing International Airport, of which 20 domestic airlines, 46 Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan regions and foreign airlines, each airline's flight times have been approved.
In the winter and spring of 2019, Beijing Daxing International Airport is expected to open 116 routes, including 101 domestic routes and 15 international routes; covering 112 destinations around the world, including 97 domestic destinations and 15 international destinations.
This has formed a "double hub" airport pattern with coordinated development, moderate competition and international first-class competitiveness, which not only alleviates the operating pressure on the saturation of the capacity of the capital airport, but also can better meet the urgent need for the rapid growth of air transportation in Beijing and surrounding areas, and effectively enhance the international competitiveness of China's civil aviation industry.
In order to ensure efficiency and quality, Beijing Daxing International Airport fully considers the relationship between the geographical location, the airport and the surrounding airspace and the operating environment, the airport runway for the first time in the country to adopt the "all-round" layout, the use of the world's largest air traffic control automation system, the establishment of China's largest terminal control area, can maximize the efficiency of aviation operation.
For the first time, domestic airports of this scale have used localized baggage automatic processing and information management systems, using an innovative luggage transmission mode to improve the handling efficiency of the baggage system.
The first flight of Beijing Daxing International Airport indicates that the phoenix spread its wings.
This has created more than 40 international and domestic first, and the localization rate has reached more than 98% of the new airport, which will have a direct and indirect economic impact on the industries in the surrounding areas and inject energy into Beijing's economic development.
MCA tentatively held a general meeting in November to be lowered to the age of 16).
MCA tentatively held the Central Congress in early November to amend the party constitution to reduce the age of joining the party to 16 years old.
As the National Assembly lowered the voting age for the general election, MCA announced that it would hold the 66th Central Congress this year, and put forward proposals to amend the party constitution, including lowering the age of MCA membership, from the existing 18 to 16 years old.
MCA President Datuk Seri Wei Jiaxiang said that the Central Committee of the Central Committee of MCA was originally scheduled to hold the Central Congress on November 2 and 3 of this year, but due to the by-election of the parliamentary seat of Tanjung Piai, so the date of the conference may be changed.
He said that since the election commission would meet only on October 1st to finalize the by-election nomination day and voting day of the Tanjung Biai seat, they will meet the following day, October 2, to discuss whether to change the date of this year's Central Congress.
He also explained that the purpose of convening the Central Committee yesterday (26th) is to finalize the date of the congress and amend the party constitution, but just happened to meet Datuk Mohamad, a member of parliament of the Indigenous Unity Party, who unfortunately died, so he joined the agenda of the by-selection.
Wang Boxiang, Party Secretary of Shandong Original Shouguang County - Qiang County Fumin Akiko Heart-Xinhua.com
Wang Boxiang, Shandong Shouguang, was born in February 1943, participated in the work in 1967, and has successively served as the party secretary of the township, the county party secretary, the mayor and other positions.
In 1986, Wang Boxiang served as the party secretary of Shouguang County in Shandong Province, at that time, Shouguang was the poor county of Weifang.
In Shouguang's five years in office, Wang Boxiang focused on three things: one is to promote the industrialization of vegetables; the other is to develop Shoubei Saline Beach; the third is to lay the foundation for the turn of the industry, so that Shouguang people from now on up their pockets and raised their waistboards.
Shouguang farmers have the tradition of growing vegetables, and there are also the lessons of growing vegetables.
In the early 1980s, Shouguang farmers couldn't sell a good harvest of vegetables and rotted in the ground.
Wang Boxiang's research found that the key to catching vegetables is to do a good job in circulation.
Shouguang took the lead in establishing a wholesale vegetable market and opened the prelude to the development of a market economy.
Party members and cadres should take the lead and screw up, and all losses are carried in the county.
In 1989, with the support of Wang Boxiang, 17 party members such as Wang Leyi of Sanyuan Zhu Village set up 17 winter-warmed vegetable greenhouses, and 17 "two hundred thousand households" appeared in the village that year.
Subsequently, a promotion group was set up in the county, under the mobilization of Wang Boxiang, Wang Leyi toured in various townships; in the first year, more than 5,000 vegetable greenhouses were promoted, and then the trend of vegetable greenhouses was pushed to the whole county and even the whole country.
For thousands of years, 1.6 million acres of land in the north, in addition to saline and alkali beaches, are painted on shallow beaches.
Local people’s lives are very difficult.
Shounan has a vegetable greenhouse, what to do in the north?
Wang Boxiang organized hundreds of thousands of people to engage in the conference battle, set up camping on the alkali beach, one job is forty or fifty days.
Wang Boxiang and the county's leading cadres are eating and living on the construction site, with migrant workers like the trolley pick-up, the people see they all stretch their thumbs and admire their hearts... At that time, Shoubei developed 150,000 acres of shrimp ponds, 200,000 acres of salt fields, 600,000 acres of cotton fields, and developed a "corner pot" on a saline beach.
In July 1986, Wang Boxiang participated in the Weifang City Industrial Conference for the first time as the secretary of the county party committee.
During the meeting, issued a "Weifang City, twelve counties urban industrial economic digital comparison table", at first glance the total industrial output value, Shouguang is not bad, ranked fourth.
However, if the original salt is removed, the pure industrial output value of Shouguang is only 119 million yuan, ranking third from the bottom.
Wang Boxiang with more than 70 people's learning group, ran to the field "change of brain".
Less than a year later, the county invested 150 million yuan in 77 projects.
Since then every year to organize a "training group", to Shenzhen, Dongguan and Shanghai and other places to learn.
There is a shortage of businesses, and there is a shortage of entrepreneurs.
Wang Boxiang presided over a special meeting: in the county's public selection of factory director managers, 40 "career-minded people" stood out and were pushed into the front line of industry.
In 1991, Shouguang entered the ranks of the country's top 100 counties, and Wang Boxiang was transferred as deputy mayor of Weifang City.
He left behind more than 200,000 vegetable greenhouses, is 1.2 million acres of cotton fields, salt fields, shrimp ponds, is 4854 enterprises, is more than 100,000 "million households", is the people's recognition of the cadre team.
On September 26, local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi chaired a meeting of foreign ministers of China and African members of the Security Council at the United Nations Headquarters in New York.
Foreign Ministers of Côte d'Ivoire, Foreign Minister of Equatorial Guinea Ojono, South African Foreign Minister Pandor of South Africa and Foreign Minister Kara of Niger, Minister of Foreign Affairs of Tunisia and Foreign Minister of Tunisia Jeshnawi attended the meeting.
Wang Yi put forward four suggestions on strengthening China-Africa cooperation in the Security Council.
First of all, by uniting your strength.
The biggest challenge in the current international situation is unilateralism, the immediate consequence is that the basic norms of international relations have been challenged, and the role of the United Nations has been affected, undermining the interests of developing countries and small and medium-sized countries, including African countries.
To cope with this challenge, it is necessary for China and Africa to hold hands, shoulder-to-shoulder, so that unity can have strength.
In the Security Council, the three African countries speak with one voice, focusing not only three votes, but the entire African continent.
China and Africa stand together not only 4 votes, but will lead other countries to follow up, influence and shape the agenda of the Security Council.
Since 2018, China and African members of the Security Council have established a "3+1" coordination mechanism to make full use of this coordination mechanism.
The second is to settle disputes through consultation.
China has always advocated for political solutions to hotspot issues, and Africa has a good tradition of consultation, as well as the experience of successful mediation by African regional and subregional organizations.
Many of the complex challenges on the Council's agenda, especially in Africa, are mostly the banelines laid down by colonialism, and some are directly related to external factors.
We must make good use of Chapter VI of the Charter of the United Nations and give full play to the role of the United Nations in good offices and mediation.
Third, rely on self-reliance.
African countries and peoples are most aware of Africa's problems, and Africa has the ability and wisdom to solve its own problems.
When the Security Council deals with African hotspot issues, attention should be paid to listening and respecting Africa ' s will, should play the role of regional and subregional organizations, and should encourage and support endogenous solutions from Africa.
China is willing to strengthen coordination with the African side and firmly promote capacity-building in Africa's independent peace operations.
The fourth is to rely on the fundamentals of development.
China and the vast number of African countries are developing countries, and we must insist on putting economic and social development first and support each other's chosen development path.
China is willing to work together to build the Belt and Road Initiative with the African Union's 2063 Agenda, the United Nations 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development and the development strategies of African countries, so as to help African countries enhance their development capabilities and eliminate the root causes of conflicts.
We must jointly promote the United Nations to increase investment in Africa's development.
After the outbreak of the Ebola epidemic in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC), China has and will continue to do its best to provide human and material assistance within its capacity, and is willing to coordinate actions with African countries to mobilise the United Nations, WHO and others to increase assistance and play the role of the United Nations Stabilization Mission in the Democratic Republic of the Congo.
The neonatology department and other relays have saved small lives.
Stupidly!
The second mother had an attack in advance, and on the way to the hospital in a hurry, a 32-week premature baby could not wait to be born in her father's car.
Fortunately, obstetrics and neonatologists handled it in a timely manner, and the relay saved this small life.
Coincidentally, on the 19th, 20th and 21st, Hubei Provincial Maternal and Child Health Hospital obstetrics and neonatology received 3 premature babies born on the road for 3 consecutive days, and the other two were born in 120 emergency vehicles, all of which were preterm babies of 29 weeks.
Ms. Cheng is a second mother, September 19th at 7 a.m., she felt a little pain in her stomach, thinking that she has been pregnant for 32 weeks, and the first child is also premature, she cleaned up the items waiting for delivery, ready to take a bath and go directly to the hospital.
After 9:30, Ms. Cheng packed up and asked her husband to drive from Xudong's home to the hospital.
Unexpectedly, soon after the car left the house, the baby could not wait to be born in his father's co-driver's car.
20 minutes later, Ms. Cheng and the baby finally arrived at Hubei Province's Maternal and Child Health Hospital Obstetrics and Gynaecology Building.
The hospital security guard saw the panicked husband and wife and the little baby, and immediately notified the obstetric delivery room, deputy chief physician Zhang Huan and other four doctors and midwives Liu Yanyan rushed downstairs with the delivery bag and umbilical cord tray.
"At that time, the mother was half lying in the co-driver of the car, under the amniotic fluid and blood water, a baby boy was next to him, still connected to the umbilical cord."
Zhang Huan inquired to know that the baby was a 32-week premature baby, the parents on the road did not have time to cover the package for the child, the early autumn morning has a cool mood, he cold skin pale, there is no crying, the limbs are soft.
Liu Yanyan rushed to the co-pilot to deal with the baby's umbilical cord, Zhang Huan drilled into it from the cab, quickly opened the production bag, with the inside of the treatment towels and bags for the child to pack a few layers of warmth, and for the newborn to clean up the respiratory tract (pictured), and then hold the baby to the 12th floor of the neonatal department.
After learning the news, the neonatology doctor immediately rushed to the nurse's station to rescue this premature baby.
At that time, the baby's appearance was purple, there was suffocation and lack of oxygen, and the doctor immediately gave him a tracheal intubation, less than a minute, the baby regained a heartbeat, and the skin color gradually returned to rhythmic, and the recovery was successful.
After being admitted to the hospital, the 32-week-old baby was put on a creative ventilator, after continuous rescue, the breathing was stable, and the next day it was successfully withdrawn.
After a week of treatment, the baby's vital signs are stable, breathing is smooth, and a small amount of breastfeeding has begun.
Coincidentally, on the 19th, 20th and 21st days, the obstetrics and neonatology department of the hospital received 3 premature babies born on the road for 3 consecutive days, and the other two were born in 120 emergency vehicles, all of which were preterm babies of 29 weeks, and are currently actively treated in the neonatal department.
Sun Guoqiang, director of obstetrics of the Provincial Maternal and Child Health Hospital, said that in recent years, the province's mothers and children have received many babies born on the subway and in private cars, which may threaten the safety of the mother and son.
Director Sun reminded that as soon as the pregnant mother has abdominal pain, broken water, red and other phenomena, she should immediately come to the hospital for treatment.
If there is a basin at home or on the road, the mother should be as flat as possible, you can put a blanket on your hips, etc., to prevent the baby from hitting the ground after delivery, the child should be warmed immediately after delivery, as soon as possible close to the doctor.
Việt Nam-Singapore Aviation Technology Corporation Officially Opened
VSTEA’s establishment is one of the refinements of the Memorandum of Cooperation signed by VAECO and ST Engineering Aerospace in April 2018, marking the launch of Vietnam’s first aircraft equipment maintenance and repair associates.
Two leading aviation technology companies from Vietnam and Singapore cooperate to provide aircraft equipment maintenance and repair services to domestic and foreign airlines.
Yang Zhisheng, general manager of Vietnam Airlines, said that ST Engineering Aerospace, the company's joint partner, is the world's largest and highest-level aircraft maintenance group.
Vietnam Airlines believes that this cooperation will bring benefits to the two sides and is also the beginning of a broad future cooperation between the two sides.
Lim Serh Ghee, president of ST Engineering Aerospace, said that sharing extensive experience with ST Engineering will help joint ventures provide international-level maintenance and repair services and contribute to ensuring the flight safety of various airlines.
The birth of VSTEA will help Vietnam Airlines to join the potential in a deep and broad direction, which can tap a huge market for aircraft equipment maintenance and repair.
At the same time, we have a great opportunity to contact modern technology and train senior aviation technicians.
To better meet the sustainable development needs of Vietnam's aviation industry.
The study shows that the manufacturing industry has become the focus of attention of the world's major countries.
Xinhua News Agency, Hefei, September 27, a few days ago, the national intellectual property operation public service platform released the "Global Manufacturing Innovation Index White Paper" in Hefei, Anhui Province.
According to the white paper, the manufacturing industry has become the focus of attention of major countries around the world.
This is what the reporter learned at the "Intellectual Property Operation and Protection Forum of the 2019 World Manufacturing Conference" held in Hefei.
The forum focused on intellectual property rights to help China's manufacturing upgrading, from the policy interpretation of the macro level and the micro perspective of enterprise practice, comprehensively explore innovative measures for the operation and protection of intellectual property rights in the manufacturing field, in-depth discussion of the hot topics of intellectual property protection in the manufacturing industry, continue to improve the ability of high-quality use of intellectual property rights, and accelerate the construction of the advantages of intelligent upgrading of the manufacturing industry.
The forum invited scholars from the State Intellectual Property Office, scholars of the Chinese Academy of Sciences, as well as experts from relevant domestic and foreign industry organizations and professional research institutions to share experiences and suggestions on how to strengthen intellectual property protection and promote the use of intellectual property rights.
At the forum, the Anhui Provincial Market Supervision and Administration Bureau issued a report on the analysis and evaluation of the innovation and development of Anhui Province, according to the calculation results of the high-quality development index of patent navigation regional innovation, Anhui Province's 2018 patent navigation regional innovation and high-quality development index ranked eighth among the country's 31 provinces and cities, and the innovation factor agglomeration index ranked fourth in the country.
The forum was organized by the People's Government of Anhui Province and co-hosted by the Anhui Provincial Market Supervision Administration Bureau, the National Intellectual Property Operation Public Service Platform and the China Intellectual Property Development Alliance.
The 2019 China Net race opened today, and a number of Olympic champions participated in the opening ceremony.
Many Olympic champions participated in the opening ceremony, and the audience will sing "me and my motherland" with the youth choir.
The 2019 China Open tennis tournament will officially start today at the National Tennis Center, and the organizing committee will hold a short and grand opening ceremony before the evening's first match, and a number of Olympic champions and famous people in the sports world will gather on the diamond court, and the guests and spectators participating in the opening ceremony will sing "me and my motherland" together with the children of the junior choir.
In the next nine days, including the eleven golden weeks, Beijing will once again usher in the tennis boom, and the national tennis center will become a good place for fans on holidays.
Since its inception in 2004, the Chinese Open has gone through 15 spring and autumn, and this year is the 16th time.
And this year's total amount of online events is also a record high, reaching 11.16 million US dollars.
Among them, the women's crown game total bonus of 7.64 million US dollars, compared with Indian Wells, Miami, the last two women's singles competition is 96 signings, and the net is 60 signatures, so for the players, the network competition is more "cost-effective".
The total bonus of the men's ATP 500 is an all-time high, rising from $3.4 million last year to $3.52 million, and the number of prizes continues to lead the ATP 500 tournament, while the total bonus of the ATP 500 held in Tokyo in the same week is about $2 million.
There will be a short and grand opening before the first game scheduled for tonight’s stadium.
In addition to the leaders and some players participating in tonight's opening ceremony, there will also be ten leaders from various fields in the Chinese sports community, many of whom are Olympic champions and world champion winners.
After the opening ceremony, the first battle of the central stadium is a WTA first round event, played by China's Jinhua Peng Shuai against Russian Kaskina, and the next second game is played by U.S. rookie Sophia Kenning to challenge Muguraza, the women's women's singles champion in 2015.
"The most beautiful unmarried princess in the world" is engaged!
According to the British "Metro" news, Buckingham Palace announced on the 26th that the British Princess Beatrice and Mozzi were engaged.
It is reported that Mozi is a 34-year-old Italian billionaire, mainly engaged in real estate development work.
Beatrice will marry the real estate tycoon next year (2020).
Princess Beatrice is the eldest daughter of the granddaughter of Queen Elizabeth II, Prince Andrew, and the ex-wife Sarah Ferguson of the Duchess of York, ranked fifth in the order of heirs to the British throne, and is known as "the world's most beautiful unmarried princess".
"We are very happy to announce that Princess Beatrice and Mr. Mozzy were engaged," the Duchess of York posted photos of her daughter's engagement on social networks on the 26th, saying: "We are very happy to announce that Princess Beatrice and Mr. Mozzy are engaged."
The British side said that the two were engaged in Italy at the beginning of this month.
The engagement photo was taken by Beatrice’s sister Eugenie.
In a statement, the two said that we are very happy to share the news of the engagement.
We’re so excited to be able to embark on our journey together, and we can’t wait to get married.
We have many similar interests and ideas that will make us more stable, full of love and happiness in the years to come.
Do you get the most three points for a free throw?
On the 27th of Beijing time, the NBA Development League announced the trial of the new penalty rules, and each penalty was fired only once, and the score was determined by the foul situation.
O’Neill was a low free-thrower among NBA stars.
According to the provisions of the new regulations, a two-point shooting foul penalty can get 2 points, a three-point shooting foul can get 3 points, and a foul plus a penalty can get 1 point.
The last two minutes of regular time and overtime, follow the previous penalty rules.
Although this provision will only be piloted in the NBA development league in the new season, fans are more concerned that if it is implemented in the NBA, it will have an impact on current players.
At present, many people think that the new regulations may be good for the "bearded" Harden, and James, who is relatively less excellent, is going to suffer.
Wuhan promotes the intelligent transformation of industrial enterprises with a subsidy of up to 20 million yuan
On the 27th, the reporter learned from the series of city press conferences held by the Wuhan Municipal Government Press Office that since the beginning of this year, the city has accelerated the intelligent transformation of industry and implemented transitional subsidy measures of up to 20 million yuan.
Up to now, more than 800 industrial enterprises above the scale of intelligent transformation demand information has been collected.
Zhang Hong, deputy director of the Wuhan Municipal Bureau of Economics and Information Technology, introduced that since this year, Wuhan has launched an action plan for the intelligent transformation of industrial enterprises, providing free consulting and diagnosis services and proposing solutions for industrial enterprises above the scale of demand, and comprehensively promoting a new round of high-level enterprise technological transformation.
According to the plan, every year, a number of professional diagnostic service institutions are publicly selected in Wuhan, and through the opening of columns, questionnaires, door-to-door filling, etc., the city's above-scale industrial enterprises to carry out an intelligent transformation demand survey.
Up to now, it has collected information on the intelligent transformation needs of more than 800 regulated industrial enterprises, accounting for nearly one-third of the number of industrial enterprises above designated size in the city.
Five municipal diagnostic platforms have organized teams to enter the enterprise in batches to carry out "one-to-one" on-site evaluation and program demonstration.
At present, the city is organizing the implementation of 373 intelligent transformation projects, with a total planned investment of 29.76 billion yuan, Hongxin Communication Huazhong's first 5G intelligent production line, Motorola's national leading intelligent mobile phone production line, Wuhan Siemens transformer digital unmanned factory, aerospace science and technology industry's country's first batch satellite production line, Huisheng biological world's leading new veterinary drug intelligent production line, Oubang smart home IoT intelligent production line and a number of leading intelligent workshops and smart factories have started construction.
In addition, Wuhan has also increased financial and financial support for intelligent transformation projects.
Among them, including the implementation of intelligent transformation of industrial enterprises, according to their actual completion of investment; including equipment hardware investment, research and development soft investment, given 8%, up to 20 million yuan of transformation subsidies.
At the same time, financial institutions such as the Wuhan branch of the joint bank and Zheshang Bank actively provide personalized financial services for the intelligent transformation of industrial enterprises, and vigorously alleviate the pressure on corporate financing.
Trudeau "people set to collapse", he can still be re-elected?
This time, the "big pit" that striped Trudeau through, it was Trudeau's own dug up a little bit.
Recently, the Canadian media successively exposed a number of old photos of the current Prime Minister Trudeau, in which Trudeau disguised himself as a black person.
This is considered to be an obvious act of racial discrimination, which immediately caused an uproar in Canada.
After the incident, Trudeau repeatedly apologized to the public.
However, Canadians do not buy much.
Trudeau threw stones at his feet.
As pointed out by the political commentator Riley and others, since the rise of the "anti-blackface movement" in the United States, Trudeau and the federal Liberal Party have been high-profile accusations that opposition parties or dissidents in the party have suffered losses in this regard, and has repeatedly threatened that "whoever makes this mistake should be expelled immediately".
In simple terms, this time, Trudeau tripped out the "big pit", it is Trudeau's own a little dug out.
Trudeau is the son of former Canadian Prime Minister Pierre Trudeau, young and handsome, and had a whirlwind of “political idols” when he debuted.
Originally a "political amateur", after taking over as leader of the Federal Liberal Party, he fought an unexpectedly beautiful battle in Canada's 2015 federal legislative elections - the Federal Liberal Party has won more than half of the seats in the lower house of the Federation and won the precious right to form a separate government.
At that time, Trudeau put forward many deafening platforms and ideas, such as "ethnicity and gender equality", "ecological environmental protection" and "economic revitalization", emphasizing the elimination of corruption and "inappropriate wind" and so on.
However, in the past five years in power, he has been in power in almost all of the above-mentioned areas.
Taking the issue of "ethnicity and gender equality" aside from the "black-faced" incident, after he was "reciprocal" on a series of issues related to Aboriginal people, so that aboriginal groups and leaders moved their protest tents to the gates of Capitol Hill on the 150th anniversary of Canada's founding.
In terms of eliminating corruption, at the end of last year and the beginning of this year, Trudeau was involved in the "Lan Wanling incident".
It was exposed, to his hometown of the construction engineering company "Lan Wanling" major violations of private fraud case, to the departments and officials responsible for investigation and punishment of pressure, asked the latter to "lift your hand."
In addition, after the big incident, Trudeau was angry with the officials who disclosed the malpractice case - Wang Zhoudi mentioned above, who was the first to disclose the case and directly handled the case.
Although there are still doubts in the case itself, its suspicions are difficult to wash away.
Many observers pointed out that Trudeau's five-year-old collapse was mainly caused by his own "scaling pit", and that the biggest "pit" is no more than the "tiger head", "self-sufficient" and "broad than self-discipline, stricter than the law".
Canada's most authoritative Angus-Rade poll data shows that since 2015, the number of those supporting Trudeau has slipped from more than 60% to more than 30%, while opponents have soared from less than 30% to more than 60%.
Although the other opposition parties and their leaders have performed equally poorly, even a considerable number of voters who are still willing to vote for the Federal Libertarian Party are now dismissing the federal prime minister and the leader of the ruling party.
On October 21, the new Canadian federal legislative election is about to start, can Trudeau repeat the repertoire of a big victory five years ago?
The answer may be in one word: difficult.
Whether it is from the level of enterprise competition, consumer experience, or from the regional aviation integration, Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei development integration level, it has far-reaching impact and positive significance.
On September 25, Beijing Daxing International Airport was officially launched.
The Beijing News reporter learned from the Beijing Municipal Development and Reform Commission that the capital airport has been in an ultra-saturated operating state, and the opening of Daxing International Airport will enhance the air service capacity of the capital.
After Shanghai, Beijing has become China's second city with two airports, and Shanghai Hongqiao International Airport mainly serves domestic aviation affairs, Pudong Airport is mainly similar to international shipping aviation, the future Capital Airport and Daxing Airport will also serve the differentiated positioning of different domestic and international aviation services, providing more segmented services.
From the perspective of business development, Daxing Airport is more of a positive impact on the capital airport.
Capital Airport's passenger throughput exceeded 100 million passengers in 2018, ranking first in the country, but compared with the rapid growth of business demand, there is still a significant poor capacity, especially the large gap in the demand for international routes.
In order to better serve the needs of domestic and foreign passenger tourism, business trips, etc., to adapt to Beijing's increasingly open and international integration of urban development trends, Daxing International Airport is positioned as a large-scale international hub airport, and plans to meet the annual passenger throughput of 100 million passengers in the future and 4 million tons of cargo and mail throughput.
Therefore, the positioning of the two airports does not overlap, and they also have enough market space for different customer groups.
From the perspective of economic accounting, Daxing International Airport's navigability will obviously form a win-win effect, alleviate the tension in Beijing's aviation capacity, accelerate the growth rate of passenger and cargo throughput, and create an incremental cake for the capital's aviation dual-core operation.
From the user's point of view, with the navigation of Daxing International Airport, it is not necessary to concentrate on the travel of the capital airport in the future, but also to reduce a series of problems caused by the excessive concentration of routes, such as an increase in the maintenance time, the passenger boarding speed becomes slower, indirectly increases the retention time of aircraft and passengers at the airport, aggravates the burden of airport operation, and reduces the burden of shipping through the capital airport.
According to the media's calculation of a variety of transportation routes to large-scale international airports, such as starting from the South Fifth Ring to take the Jingkai high-speed directly to Daxing Airport high-speed, if you can go in 50 minutes, the oil money back and forth is about 40 yuan, the high-speed fee is 15 yuan; and the choice of rail transit subway Daxing Airport Line, according to the distance is limited to 20 kilometers and 30 kilometers, the fare is divided into 10 yuan, 25 yuan and 35 yuan.
In general, there are many means of transportation to Daxing Airport, and the cost and time are also within a more reasonable range.
From the perspective of trend development: Daxing Airport is positioned as the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei transportation hub, so it is slightly farther away from Beijing, but it has strengthened the radiation to Hebei and Tianjin, facilitating more people's travel, which is of great significance to stimulating the economic development of Hebei and Tianjin.
In the future, Hebei and Tianjin passengers can enjoy more international air route services provided by Daxing International Airport, which can be seen from the traffic planning of Daxing Airport.
Daxing Airport's supporting transportation facilities are very perfect, in addition to the new airport line directly to Daxing Airport in Beijing, there are also a number of highways connecting Daxing Airport and surrounding areas.
Just as passengers from Dongguan, Foshan, Qingyuan and other cities can go to Guangzhou Baiyun Airport through highways such as Guangfo and Guangshen, residents of Langfang and Xiong'an New Area around Beijing will also benefit from Daxing Airport and obtain convenient and efficient aviation services.
It can be seen that Daxing International Airport's navigability not only adds a few runways and a few aircraft, whether it is from the level of enterprise competition, consumer experience, or from the regional aviation integration, Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei development and integration level, it has a far-reaching impact and positive significance, not only related to the long-term layout and development of Beijing's shipping industry, but also provides diversified choices for the travel of the majority of residents of Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei.
Therefore, for the navigation of Daxing Airport, we must not only calculate the small account of the individual in the economy, but also the big account of the overall development.
On the 27th, the index rose 1.46% - Xinhua.com
Xinhua News Agency, Shenzhen, September 27 (Reporter Zhao Ruishi) 27 small and medium-sized board index opened high, and finally reported 6077.23 points, up 87.55 points from the previous trading day, an increase of 1.46%.
On the same day, the transaction amount of small and medium-sized boards was 108 billion yuan, a decrease of 31.9 billion yuan from the previous trading day.
Among the stocks traded on the same day, 668 stocks closed and rose, and 15 stocks such as Honggao Creative rose and stopped; 222 stocks closed and fell, and 4 stocks such as Shunwei shares fell and stopped; 40 stocks such as Weixing shares closed.
The 2019 Vietnam Forum on Economic and Social Issues was held in Hue Province
The deputy director of the Economic Committee of the National Assembly of Vietnam, Nguyen Dekian, said that at the beginning of this year, Vietnam's economic and social development showed many new improvements and continued to maintain the growth trend.
The forum focused on prominent economic and social problems in the first few months of 2019 and proposed measures for economic and social development in late 2019 and 2020.
At the forum, the participants exchanged in-depth views and views on the economic development situation in 2019 and the impact of some free trade agreements, some prominent issues of Vietnam's economy in 2019, prominent problems in Vietnam's social culture in 2019, and forecasts and suggestions for Vietnam's economic and social development in 2020.
Delegates generally believe that in the first few months of 2019, global economic growth has slowed, risks and challenges have increased.
Trade frictions between major economies have caused global trade and investment to shrink further.
The International Monetary Fund (IMF) believes that despite the uncertainty of the global economy, 70% of the world's economies have fallen into a state of growth stagnation, Vietnam's economic development has still achieved many gratifying achievements, stable macroeconomic operation, inflation has been effectively controlled, and the consumer price index increased by an average of 2.64% in the first half of 2019, the lowest increase in nearly three years.
In the first half of 2019, GDP increased by 6.76%, which is lower than 7.05% in the same period last year, but compared with the level of the same period in 2011-2017, the growth rate is still at a higher level.
When making a forecast of Vietnam's economic development trend in 2019-2020, Deng Deying, deputy director of Vietnam's national economic and social forecasting center, said that in the context of world economic turmoil, Vietnam's economy has shown a high growth momentum in 2019.
It is expected that by 2020, Vietnam's macro economy will continue to remain basically stable, the implementation of various free trade agreements will promote trade development, economic restructuring and improvement of the business environment will be further strengthened, due to the impact of trade frictions, Vietnam's foreign export activities will show a downward trend.
Therefore, it is necessary to strengthen the monitoring and forecasting early warning mechanism, take the initiative to find trade remedy measures for Vietnam's export goods, find opportunities to expand new export markets, and create convenience for foreign exports of various commodities such as agricultural and aquatic products.
At the same time, the inflation rate is kept at a reasonable level to promote the development of auxiliary industries and support the development of high-tech agriculture, organic agriculture and ecological agriculture.
Liu Zhijie, director of the Consular Office of the Chinese Embassy in Siem Reap in Siem Reap, held a reception in Siem Reap on the 26th to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China.
Liu Zhijie said that in the 70 years since the founding of New China, China has actively participated in international affairs, contributed more China's wisdom to improving global economic governance and promoting global common development, made important contributions to world peace and development, and brought tangible benefits to Cambodia's economic development and people's well-being.
As the world's second largest economy, China's contribution to world economic growth is more than 30%, especially China's "Belt and Road" initiative, China's local provinces and cities and Siem Reap and the provinces in the region continue to deepen cooperation.
He said that this year is the beginning of 61 years of China-Cambodia diplomatic relations, and the two countries have fraternal friendship, and China-Cambodia mutually beneficial cooperation will become the driving force of local economic and social development.
The Governor of Siem Reap highly praised the great achievements made by New China in the past 70 years, and congratulated on the achievements of friendly cooperation between China and Cambodia.
Disaiha expects the two sides to continue to work together to promote China-Cambodia friendship and cooperation, strengthen mutual trust and mutual benefit, and continuously improve people's living standards.
Siem Reap province and Chinese provinces and cities of friendly exchanges are remarkable, so far with China's 28 provinces and cities to conclude friendly city relations, large-scale cultural performance projects "Angkor Smile" and "Angkor Dynasty" landing, Siem Reap-Guangxi Agricultural Demonstration Park, Siem Reap New International Airport Project, Siem Reap Province government officials special training courses, Siem Reap students to China to study scholarships, rural clinics, to modify urban roads, cabaracts.
Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense of Cambodia Ken Wensong, Chairman of the Council of Siem Reap Province Weng Heng, governors of the five provinces, Siem Reap branch of the Cambodian-Chinese Council, volunteer teachers, Siem Reap branch of the Chinese Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia, representatives of Chinese-funded enterprises and representatives of foreign leaders in Siem Reap attended the reception.
In Yunqi town to witness a decade of digital China "cloud up" - Xinhua
If you take the 2009 local website forum as the starting point, the 2019 Yunqi Conference held in Hangzhou from 25 to 27 has gone through a full decade.
From the concept of "cloud fog" to the practice of "up the cloud", big data and cloud computing have become one of the core technologies supporting China's economic development, social management and public services in the past 10 years.
In the Zhengtai new energy photovoltaic cell workshop located in Haining, Zhejiang Province, there are more new "colleagues" loaded with Aliyun artificial intelligence next to quality inspectors.
It is 24 hours, the recognition speed is more than twice that of labor, and the quality inspection accuracy rate is stable at more than 95%.
According to the person in charge of the company, the "quality inspector" with the camera has learned more than 40,000 blemish samples, and with the cloud computing power behind it, it can quickly convert infrared images into binary languages, and there will be blemissed battery cells.
This enterprise is only a microcosm of today's cloud computing to help the transformation of the manufacturing industry.
In 2018, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology issued the "Guidelines for Promoting the Implementation of Enterprises on the Cloud (2018-2020)", proposing that by 2020, we will strive to achieve a significant increase in the awareness and enthusiasm of enterprises on the cloud, and significantly improve the proportion and application depth.
Wang Jian, founder of Alibaba Cloud, said that today, data-centric cloud computing has paved the way for the digital economy with data as a key factor.
At the same time, in the past 10 years, the scale of China's cloud computing industry has also continued to expand.
According to the "White Paper on the Development of Cloud Computing (2019)" released by the China Academy of Information and Communications Technology in July this year, the overall market size of China's cloud computing reached 96.28 billion yuan in 2018, an increase of 39.2% compared with 2017.
In addition to becoming the key technology supporting the transformation of the industry and the development of the digital economy, the "cloud" that can't be seen and touched has also unknowingly changed urban management and social life.
At this year's Yunqi Conference, the "urban brain" unveiled for three consecutive years is still attracting attention.
At present, the urban brain has become the center of urban management from the traffic management tool, and the relevant cooperation applications have expanded to 23 cities around the world.
Through camera perception, artificial intelligence algorithms, the city brain through strong computing power, so that "first stop after payment", "the number of visits real-time perception", "tourism line design" and other new city management service functions can be realized.
In the field of government services, with "one cloud" docking "one thing", the "hands-on office" and "hands-on work" collaborative promotion, cloud computing for both ends of the supply of government services to bring convenience.
At present, Zhejiang has built a unified public data platform for the whole province through public affairs.
As of September 11, this platform has covered more than 57 million permanent residents and more than 15 million legal entities in the province, bringing together 19.08 billion pieces of data in 3066 categories.
On average, the data transferred and shared by the government departments of Zhejiang Province has reached 12 million times per month, and the flow of data on the "cloud" may mean that the masses do less errands.
Be careful with plastic tea bags!
According to the "Central News Agency" reported that a new Canadian study recently found that a package of plastic tea bags may release billions or even tens of billions of plastic particles, significantly higher than a person's estimated intake of microplastics throughout the year, but so far there is no evidence that ingesting plastic particles poses a threat to humans.
According to reports, researchers at the University of Magill in Canada found that dipping plastic tea bags into a cup of almost boiling hot water (95 degrees Celsius), tea bags will release about 11.6 billion plastic particles and 3.1 billion smaller nanoplastic particles into cups.
This amount is significantly higher than the estimated amount of microplastics a person consumes throughout the year.
According to the research released earlier in 2019, the average person eats at least 50,000 plastic particles every year while inhaling the same amount of microplastics.
It is reported that the study was published in the Journal of Environmental Science and Technology, and the researchers tested four different types of plastic commercial tea bags in Montreal stores and cafes, opened the tea bags, soaked the tea bags into almost boiling water for 5 minutes, and then analyzed them with electron microscopes and spectrometers.
According to this study, they found that a single tea bag released more than 11.6 billion plastic particles, which are "several series higher than the plastic load on other previous foods."
According to the report, most tea bags are made of natural fibers, but many of them are made from natural fibers.
Some brands of tea bags are no longer made of paper and use plastics, and these plastic tea bags are the subjects of the researchers' tests.
Microplastics are tiny fragments of plastic, and the researchers defined that these microplastics range in size from 100 nanometers to 5 millimeters and are mainly produced by the decomposition of plastic waste.
Researchers have found traces of microplastics in air, soils, rivers and the deepest trenches around the world, including tap water, bottled water, seafood and beers.
For the first time in October 2018, researchers found microplastics in human stool samples in several countries in different regions around the world.
To test the potential toxicity of tea bags releasing microplastics, the Canadian research team put water fleas into contaminated water and found that microplastics can affect the behavior of these fleas and cause them to develop deformities.
According to the World Health Organization (WHO), there is no evidence so far that ingesting microplastics poses a threat to humans.
However, the WHO said more research was needed to fully understand how these plastics spread into the environment and how they affected humans.
The researchers hypothesized that the reasons why these tea bags release a large number of plastic particles may be that these plastic tea bags come into contact with boiling water, and that toxic substances may be decomposed or exuded even when "edible grade" plastics are heated to more than 40 degrees Celsius.
António Guterres said that the climate emergency is the biggest threat to the survival of small island countries.
There, a natural disaster erodes the development gains of a generation.
This is illustrated by the situation in Babuda, Dominica and the Bahamas, which have been hit by hurricanes so far this year.
About a quarter of small island developing States live at an altitude of 5 metres or less.
Relocations can have serious implications for their societies and ways of life, and can even raise issues of sovereignty and national identity.
At this Monday’s Climate Action Summit, small island nations are working together to become carbon-neutral and 100 percent renewable by 2030, allowing them to once again lead the world in the right direction.
“The climate crisis is piling up new injustices on top of old injustices.
Although the contribution of small island developing States to global warming was small, they paid the highest price.
Because these countries are in middle-income status, many countries are also caught up in a cycle of disasters and accelerated and unsustainable debts.
The world must take action, and it is time to make major decisions and invest heavily in small island developing States.”
Today's high-level meeting adopted a political declaration calling for assistance to small island developing States to manage disaster risks, investing in climate-resilient infrastructures and ways to transition to renewable energy, and urging international agencies to assist small island developing States, in particular heavily indebted middle-income countries, in accessing funding.
Small island developing States are at the forefront of the protection and conservation of Earth's lifeline, the ocean.
The latest special report released this week by the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change confirms that the oceans are already suffering from the “engaging” severe consequences of the climate crisis.
By the middle of this century, extreme sea level rise may occur in many regions every year.
The report warns that some island nations are likely to become uninhabitable without investing heavily in adaptation.
Contamination, overfishing and acidification have caused huge losses.
In the past 150 years, the world has lost half of all living corals, and in the past 40 years, plastic pollution has increased tenfold.
The demand for industry, shipping, mining and tourism is leading to a reduction in resources, including the maintenance of fisheries for many island communities.
Small island States are also facing high costs for transportation, energy and infrastructure.
They are heavily reliant on some external markets, subjecting them to price fluctuations.
Some States are also grappling with the security implications of illicit trafficking in persons, weapons and drugs.
Guterres said: "By solving a problem in the most challenging environment, this problem can be solved anywhere.
The efforts of small island developing States to achieve the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development will provide us with the tools, lessons learned and examples available to the world.”
He stressed that small island developing States were special cases of sustainable development.
They require the long-term attention and investment of the entire international community.
India’s finance ministry said the financial system was liquid.
India's Finance Minister Sitharaman said on the 26th that the current liquidity of the financial system is sufficient, driven by holiday consumer demand, India's economic growth is expected to recover in the second half of this fiscal year.
Sitharaman made the remarks after a meeting with representatives of Indian private banks, non-banking financial institutions, housing banks and other institutions.
Sitharaman didn’t say what’s relevant.
Previously, some Indian media and overseas media blamed the continued slowdown of India's current round of economy on the tight liquidity of non-banking financial institutions.
Sitharaman cited the decline in car sales as an example, negating that tight liquidity is the main reason for the decline in sales.
Sitharaman pointed out that the decline in automobile sales was mainly caused by cyclical factors.
Sitharaman expects India's economic growth to recover in the second half of the fiscal year, driven by holiday spending.
India’s annual shopping season begins in September and runs until the end of the year.
The market expects that shopping consumption will greatly promote India's economic growth.
The Jiangxi Provincial Department of Education recently issued a notice that it is strictly prohibited for primary and secondary schools in the province to make up for illegal classes during the National Day holiday, and will organize personnel to randomly carry out unannounced visits.
In the "Notice on Prohibiting the Prohibition of National Day Holiday Violations", the Jiangxi Provincial Department of Education stressed that primary and secondary schools in various places should resolutely do this during the National Day: all students should not organize collective remedial classes or new classes, will not hold subject training courses, special classes, Orsay classes, interest classes, improve classes, etc., and all schools and school buildings should not be rented to other educational institutions to hold various training courses.
At the same time, it is strictly prohibited for working primary and secondary school teachers to organize, recommend and induce students to participate in illegal remedial classes inside and outside schools, and it is strictly prohibited for working primary and secondary school teachers to participate in off-campus training institutions or organized by other teachers, parents, parents' committees, etc.
The notice makes it clear that for the verified illegal remedial behavior of primary and secondary schools, the local education administrative department will increase the deduction points in the high-quality development education assessment of the county-level government in that year; for teachers who participate in illegal remedial classes, they will be dealt with seriously according to the relevant provisions of teachers and teachers.
Support the production of pigs to ensure the supply of the market
Sui Loyalty Requires the Implementation of Various Measures from Six Aspects
The province's promotion of pig production guarantee market supply teleconference was held today, on the implementation of the policies and measures of the central and provincial committees and provincial governments to support pig production to ensure market supply.
Sui loyalty requires the implementation of various measures for pig production from six aspects.
To grasp the "vegetable basket" mayor responsible for the implementation of the system, this year's province's clear 45 million pigs have been decomposed into various cities and states, included in the assessment of the responsibility system.
We will do a good job in the implementation of various policies and measures, and earnestly solve the "last mile" problem of policy implementation.
We should do a good job in the implementation of breeding sow production, earnestly implement the subsidy policy for breeding sows, encourage pig breeding enterprises to expand the breeding scale of breeding pigs, and systematically select excellent sows from the commodity pig group.
We should do a good job in the implementation of investment attraction, and take the well-known large-scale breeding enterprises that have not yet entered our province as the top priority of attracting investment.
We should do a good job in the implementation of the market circulation system, accelerate the construction of pig cold chain logistics facilities, and comprehensively promote the transformation from "pig adjustment" to "meat adjustment".
To grasp the implementation of the modern epidemic prevention system, all localities should be equipped with grass-roots epidemic prevention and quarantine personnel who are compatible with the scale of breeding and work tasks, and build the first line of defense for epidemic prevention and control.
Sui loyalty requires that all efforts should be made to ensure the supply of the meat market, to ensure that there is no large-scale shortage and a large-scale cut-off supply, and to ensure the stable supply of the pork market on major holidays.
The meeting also deployed work on the continued prevention and control of the African swine fever epidemic, the prohibition and withdrawal of arrests in the important waters of the river basin, and the acquisition of late rice in the whole province.
Talk about the feelings of the motherland, the national soul of the big white rabbit and other representatives of the old name of Shanghai for college students to take party classes
"Me and my motherland" on-campus punching points so that college students "happiness Shu".
Celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, Shanghai soap, Shao Wansheng, big white rabbits, four well-known Shanghai old brands gathered at the East China East University of Technology's "art party class" on the 27th, and four representatives of Shanghai's old brands with an average history of more than 90 years, Qiqi told more than 200 young students about the motherland and national soul of the old brand.
The product display exhibition of the old brand on the spot.
The love story in the class made the students lament that they did not expect that the product display of the old brand was carefully arranged outside the classroom, and there were "me and my motherland" on-campus punching points for college students.
As an old-fashioned brand, big white rabbit milk candy in recent years actively seek change, take the initiative, adhere to innovation and cross-border.
The big white rabbit, born in 1959, coincides with its 60th birthday this year.
Shao Wansheng has also set his sights on young consumer groups.
Wang Weijie, secretary and deputy general manager of the party branch of Shanghai Shao Wansheng Food Co., Ltd., mentioned the scene of "eating abalone in the spring, eating bad fish in the summer, eating drunken shrimp in the autumn breeze, and the winter cloud of drunk crab", reflecting people's continuous innovation in "eating".
The company has also further tapped the brand culture from the aspects of taste innovation and comic packaging design to adapt to the inheritance of the younger generation of consumer groups.
The old-fashioned representatives talked about the road of innovation at the "art party class".
Yu Jie, manager of Shanghai freshly got ribble cake catering Co., Ltd., also believes that "all innovation is inseparable from a solid foundation, and every innovation of the old brand is a thick and thin process.
Everyone’s heart is hiding their expectations of the old.
Taking the product as the center, the small and beautiful era should start."
As one of the first batch of "old Chinese brands" in China, Shanghai seafood also quickly adapts to market trends, visually upgrades the brand, introduces professional operation teams, and achieves a substantial increase in turnover.
"The old brand can not only be seen in these traditional channels such as supermarkets, but now the old brand will also actively participate in new retail and various activities."
All our changes, and ultimately to achieve such a goal, is so that consumers can see, hear, and finally be able to buy."
Ouyang Yiling, deputy general manager of Shanghai Soap (Group) Co., Ltd., said.
In the future, Shanghai soap will also adhere to high-end development, with broad prospects for system development and satisfactory energy-saving and environmental protection products for users, adhering to the road of high-tech content and high economic efficiency.
Through this art class, the students have gained a lot.
The old brand accompanies my growth and carries the good memories and emotions of my childhood.
Song Yingyuan's classmates sighed.
The representative of the old brand in Shanghai told more than 200 young students about the motherland and national soul of the old brand.
Chow Xiaoting students said that how to explore the brand culture, so that high-quality traditional culture passed down from generation to generation, endless, is we as design students, need to think about and explore the problem.
Relying on Ding Wei's "Shanghai Image" project and Professor Ni Jun's "Old Brand Integrated Brand Innovation Studio", this party class hopes to deeply explore the cultural potential and modern commercial value of the old brand, make good use of the competitiveness and influence of Shanghai's old brands, enhance the cultural radiance concentration of Shanghai's old brands, and realize the industrial effect of "1+1>2" in the form of "design + culture" and show Shanghai culture from a new perspective.
It is reported that the "art party class" will also continue to invite everyone in cultural history, painting masters, pottery masters, non-heritage masters, masters of architecture, landscape masters as lecturers, through them telling the inheritance of Chinese culture innovation and adherence, highlighting the characteristics of the times, further strengthen the ideals and beliefs of college students, cultivate the patriotic feelings of college students, use works to speak, let the works speak, innovate the form of the party class, do the theme of the party class, enhance the ideological, theoretical and affinity of the party class.
Shinzo Abe recorded a video wishing the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China, and also said a sentence in Chinese
On the 26th local time, Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe congratulated the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China by video.
Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe: Good evening everyone, I'm Shinzo Abe.
On the occasion of the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, I would like to extend my warm congratulations on behalf of the
At the G20 Osaka Summit held in June, in order to successfully cooperate with the summit, Japan and China demonstrated the strong will of the G20 to the world through the Declaration of the G20 Osaka Summit.
In addition, at the Japan-China summit talks and dinner before the summit, the two sides agreed that President Xi Jinping will pay a state visit to Japan next spring, and at the same time, they are determined to open up a new era between Japan and China.
Japan and China jointly shoulder great responsibilities for peace and prosperity in Asia and the world.
I firmly believe that the two countries will work together to deal with the issues facing the region and the world, contribute together to the international community, and will contribute to building a new model of future relations between the two countries.
In conclusion, I wish that Japan-China relations are flourishing, and I wish my friends a thriving career.
"Overage migrant workers on some construction sites are estimated to account for more than half.
Where are you looking for young workers now?
There is no way to use so many "old people" on the site."
Recently, there are a lot of over-age migrant workers (more than the retirement age) on the construction site, Zou Kui, who has been working as an engineering contractor in the construction industry for many years, lamented.
In recent times, the university where the author is located has carried out rain and sewage diversion projects, and there have been many migrant workers on the campus, and if you pay attention to observation, you will find that there are many over-age migrant workers.
Over-age migrant workers go out to work is not "idless", but because "can't be idle", with "have to be so" helplessness and hardship - whether it is to save money to solve their own pension and medical problems, or to help their children, are driving these old people who were supposed to be â€œidly downâ€ to continue their hard work.
The "old dependence" of over-age migrant workers is not as easy as we think.
Raising children, supporting the elderly, reading for children, helping children to build buildings to buy cars, helping children to start a family, raising grandchildren from generation to generation, when these migrant workers have completed the "life task", the money bag has been hollowed out and even a lot of debt, most of them lack of wealth accumulation.
In order not to drag down the children but also in order to save more wealth for themselves, many migrant workers insist on "doing until they can't do it."
Many of the "post-80s", "post-90s" and even the "post-00s" new generation of migrant workers are not willing to engage in difficult conditions, high labor intensity of secondary industries or low-end services, resulting in a structural "labor shortage", these unattractive jobs, to provide opportunities for over-age migrant workers.
Due to the lack of a skill, the physical function and ability to work have declined, and many over-age migrant workers are doing work with high intensity, low income, high risk and less protection.
The ability to do a day is a day, can earn a little more is a point, "can't be idle" behind the survival dilemma of overage migrant workers, can not be ignored and ignored.
Solving the problems of unpaid wages and asking wages, improving labor protection, reducing safety risks, increasing labor income, and improving the survival of over-age migrant workers, in addition to their "self-salvation", it is also inseparable from the institutional protection of the public sector and humanistic care.
Some scholars have pointed out that it is unlikely that over-age migrant workers will rely on returning home to solve problems such as their old-age care and medical treatment, and they must support their families through other methods.
Reading the helplessness and strength of over-age migrant workers who "can't be idle" will help us better understand the love and pain of overage migrant workers.
Seeing the backs of over-age migrant workers, hearing their sighs, trying to find ways to get back to the countryside, they really achieve "old dependence", the public sector, the market and society need to share responsibilities in benign interactions, and need to work together.
Chemezov said that Russia will not export such a system in the next five years, because "the supply of its own army must be supplied first, and the export production will not be carried out later."
This approach is fully consistent with international practice.
Major producers of weapons and military equipment have always ensured their own defence needs first, before processing export orders.
Earlier, General Yuri Grekhov, deputy commander-in-chief of the Russian Air Force, said that the development of the system was about to be completed.
The S-500 system was developed by "Diamond-Antai" space-based defense.
It’s a new generation of air defense systems that uses the workings used to destroy ballistics and aerodynamic targets.
The S-500's primary role is to intercept medium-range ballistic missiles, which can intercept missiles with a range of less than 3,500 kilometers.
In addition, according to some sources, the S-500 can also destroy hypersonic cruise missiles as well as aircraft, almost all types of unmanned aircraft, hypersonic missiles more than five times the speed of sound, and even targets located in near space.
This weapon can also be integrated with other air defense systems into a unified network, especially the S-400 system, which is very important from a defense point of view.
Sergey Chemezov paid special attention to the S-400.
He said that the system is currently in great demand in the world, but the Russian army also needs it, including in the Arctic region.
The S-400 air defense system enters the Arctic air defense regiment.
According to the news on September 15th, the conversion of the S-400 anti-aircraft missile system by the Arctic Air Defense Mission on New Island has been completed.
This is not Russia’s militarization in the Arctic.
According to the Russian Defense Ministry, this is entirely part of the process of the transition to a more advanced defense tool in the strategic direction of the north.
"With the transition to the new S-400 air defense system, the controllable airspace of the Arctic region has increased significantly," said the Russian Northern Fleet's press service.
It’s very important that, according to military assessments, the system’s use in the Far North and Arctic regions has been successful.
Anti-aircraft regiment officers trained for the new system and prepared to enter combat duty.
Previously, it was equipped with the S-300 long-range air defense system, which is still part of it.
When it comes to air defense systems, they must have weapons that can destroy a variety of aerial targets, whether they are targets flying at high speeds in the outer height layers, or "missing fish" who are close to protected facilities.
According to public sources, the S-400 Triumph system, developed by the “Golden Diamond-Antai” space defense, is designed to attack strategic and tactical aircraft, ballistic missiles, hypersonic targets, and other aerial attack weapons.
The weapon can attack aerodynamic targets within a range of 400 kilometers and shoot down ballistic targets flying at a distance of 4.8 kilometers per second at a distance of 60 kilometers.
Russia has never concealed its ability to deploy additional air defenses in the far north to ensure the security of its airspace along the Northern Sea Route.
Not long ago, the first batch of 12 "Tor (Tor)-M2DT" anti-aircraft missile systems was delivered to the Russian Arctic, which was enough to form an anti-aircraft battalion to strengthen air defense systems in the Arctic.
At that time, the Russian Ministry of Defense said that in the future, the "Toll" force in the Arctic will be expanded to a complete brigade-level system.
Coupled with the newly deployed S-400 long-range system on the New Island and Kola peninsulas, as well as the “Pantsir-SA” short-range system deployed in the far north, these advanced anti-aircraft weapons strongly defend Russia’s polar skies.
It will be very difficult for enemy aircraft, helicopters and drone missiles to break through this defense.
According to the Russian government's ideas, the flagship store will become a platform for Russian manufacturers to place goods, avoiding the complicated and long process of opening their own stores.
As the operator of the Russian goods store, the Russian company focuses on selling Russian goods in China.
Russian products in Tmall (Tmall), Jingdong (JD), 1688, Pinduoduo (Pinduoduo), Hand Q (ShouQ), multi-functional instant messaging software WeChat (Wechat) and other China's largest trading platforms all have online stores, and have their own online platform Edupino.com and Russian commodity retail chain stores.
The Russian export center will work together with Russian products to develop store marketing strategies and participation standards, and screen virtual shelves on the shelves of product enterprises.
The store is scheduled to open by the end of this year and list the products of at least 10 Russian manufacturers.
According to the data of the Russian Export Center, China's e-commerce platform has a total of 1 billion visits per month.
At the same time, food exports to China have been showing steady growth since 2014, surpassing $1 billion in 2018.
At present, Alibaba Group will also set up a pilot store within the framework of the global import strategy to sell goods from New Zealand, Malaysia and Singapore.
According to Alexei Kozhevnikov, the new store will display the goods of enterprises with sales of at least 500 million rubles.
To be honest, my expectations are higher, and my sales of 500 million rubles are not enough.
We all know that the attitude of Chinese consumers towards Russian goods is quite positive, and China's goods are regarded as high-quality and green environmental protection products."
Kozhevnikov said that the competition for Chinese consumers with strong purchasing power is fierce and increasing.
“Our goal is ambitious to launch 500 businesses through this store in three years,” he said.
At the same time, the platform will also list the products of enterprises in the Russian Far East.
Vyacheslav Cheglov, a professor of trade policy fundamentals at Plekhanov Economic University in Russia, said: "This is a political project that represents the image of both sides, because Russia's export centers are state-owned rather than private institutions."
"I don't see a lot of very competitive Russian goods in the market."
He believes that the project is likely not to actually be implemented, but it will help strengthen bilateral relations.
Andrey Slepnev, president of the Russian Export Center, said during the Eastern Economic Forum that the product information of more than 170 Russian companies has been published on Alibaba.com, the largest international wholesale online platform, and can be purchased in China or in other countries.
In addition, there is a model of cooperation with Alibaba Group, that is, a training program for Russian companies by experts from Taobao University, and its first seminar has been held in July this year.
In November this year, the Russian export center at the second China International Import Expo in Shanghai will also serve as an organizer for Russian enterprises to participate in industry exhibitions and commercial projects.
A large-scale exhibition will be held in the 1,000-square-meter exhibition hall, which will also serve as the center for holding commercial project activities, agreement signing ceremonies, promotion meetings and talks with representatives of Chinese companies.
At present, about 50 applications have been received from Russian agricultural enterprises.
“In addition to the agricultural booth, we are bound to hold a business meeting, that is, to arrange direct contacts between entrepreneurs.”
“This is another direction of our efforts, with the aim of supporting businesses and ensuring dozens of dedicated meetings.”
In addition, there will also be master classes, cooking competitions and Russian famous chefs cooking at the "Exploration of Russian Food Shanghai Station" project.
After the death of Mohd Adi, a deathler, took the next step after the coroner's death on Friday, waiting for the full report and instructions from the Attorney General's Office.
The National Police Criminal Investigative Service, Datuk Khüzer, issued a statement on Friday that according to the coroner panel's ruling, the police will wait for further instructions from the Attorney General's Office.
In his statement, he stressed that the police have never terminated the investigation into Mohd's murder, and the investigation is still ongoing.
On the other hand, Selangor Police Superintendent Noajan said police would wait for a full report on the contents of the ruling before taking action.
He responded when asked about the matter on Friday morning after attending the handover ceremony of the authority of the deputy superintendent of Xuezhou police headquarters.
He said that the police investigated the case according to the relevant reports.
He added that the police would also scrutinize the progress of the investigation and decide whether to call people who had been recorded for questioning again.
The reporter learned from the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Landscaping that in order to welcome the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China, Beijing has recently taken Chang'an Street and its routes as the main axis to comprehensively enhance the landscape of landscaping and create a peaceful and festive atmosphere.
At present, all 12 three-dimensional flower beds along Chang'an Street have been completed, and the city's 20 million pots of flowers are dressed up in the capital, dressed up to meet the arrival of the National Day.
Over the past few days, 12 colorful and diverse three-dimensional flowerbed landscapes along Chang'an Street have attracted many public tourists to watch and take photos.
The theme of these flower beds is clear, from the "magnificent 70 years" in the northwestern corner of Jianguomen, to the "Beautiful Tomorrow" in the northeast corner of the rejuvenation gate, which has made brilliant achievements in various fields in the 70 years since the founding of New China, showing the happy life of the people.
According to the relevant person in charge of the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Landscaping, this year's green environment layout makes full use of its own innovative achievements and integrates new varieties and new technologies at home and abroad.
There are more than 230 varieties in the overall application, including 16 self-cultivated varieties, 18 new varieties of green resistance, and 11 kinds of native plants.
China's self-cultivation of the "cold", "Xiu autumn candy", "brown autumn and colorful" three chrysanthemum varieties have been applied for the first time.
In order to welcome the National Day, Beijing has also recently carried out a comprehensive rectification of the city's landscaping landscape environment, with a total of more than 12,000 trees, 230,000 flower shrubs, and 2.3 million square meters of lawns.
At the same time, in the city's ring road, Chang'an Street extension line, Xiangshan memorial site, the new airport around and important tourist attractions and other important areas, there are 200 themed flower beds, the amount of planted flowers up to 20 million pots (plants), the placement of flower pillar piles of 10,000, the combination of 5000 sets of containers, hanging 15,000 flower boxes, so that the capital's green environmental landscape has been fully upgraded.
China Releases "China and the United Nations" and reports on issues such as climate change and sustainable development - Xinhua
UNITED NATIONS, Sept. 26 (Xinhua) -- On September 26, the Chinese delegation attending the 74th session of the United Nations General Assembly released four documents, including "China and the United Nations - China's Position Document of the 74th Session of the United Nations General Assembly", "United Nations Climate Action Summit: China's Position and Action", "China's Progress Report on Implementing the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development (2019)", and "Report on Earth Big Data Supporting the Sustainable Development Goals".
"China and the United Nations - The 74th Session of the United Nations General Assembly's Chinese Position Paper summarizes the achievements and development of cooperation between China and the United Nations in various fields in the past 70 years since the founding of the People's Republic of China, especially since the 18th
It is pointed out that the promotion of building a community with a shared future for mankind proposed by Chinese President Xi Jinping has become the banner of the diplomacy of major countries with Chinese characteristics.
Under the guidance of Xi Jinping's diplomatic thinking, China participates in international affairs with a more positive and promising attitude, making greater contributions to world peace and development and shouldering more responsibilities.
China has always been a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development and a defender of the international order.
From ten aspects, the document introduces China's important contribution to the three pillars of United Nations peace, development and human rights.
Reaffrivating China's firm support and practice of multilateralism and supporting the United Nations to play a central role in international affairs; pointing out that China's development resonates with the development of the world, and the two promote each other, emphasizing that in the face of the great changes that the world has not seen in a hundred years, an ever-evolving China will contribute more and more positive energy to the world.
The "United Nations Climate Action Summit: China's position and actions" is closely related to the nine action areas of the United Nations Climate Action Summit, and introduces China's policy proposition on international cooperation on climate change and China's achievements in combating climate change.
As the world's largest developing country, China regards combating climate change as an inherent requirement for its own sustainable development and the responsibility of building a community with a shared future for mankind, and will continue to overcome the many difficulties and challenges facing its own development, firmly safeguard multilateralism, implement international commitments, and make every effort to promote the full and effective implementation of the Paris Agreement.
China's progress report on the implementation of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development (2019) is China's second progress report since the release of the implementation progress report in 2017.
The report comprehensively reviews China's measures, progress, challenges and next steps in the implementation of the 2030 Agenda, and demonstrates China's determination and achievements to implement the new development concept and achieve high-quality development.
The reports include cases such as accurate poverty alleviation, innovation leading development, the construction of ecological civilization, rural revitalization, and the joint construction of the “Belt and Road”, which will provide useful reference for other countries to implement the 2030 Agenda.
The "Earth Big Data Supports Sustainable Development Goals Report" shows China's exploration and practice of supporting the implementation and policy decision-making of the 2030 Agenda using Earth Big Data, reveals the application value and prospects of relevant technologies and methods for monitoring and evaluating the sustainable development goals, and provides a new perspective and new support for the international community to fill the data and methodological gaps and accelerate the implementation of the 2030 Agenda.
The 20th anniversary series of activities of the Alumni Association of the Macao Institute of Technology - Liu Huazhi and Leung Ziheng Art Exhibition will be grandly opened at 6 p.m. on September 29, 2019 at the Huayuan Building Exhibition Gallery of the Macao Institute of Technology.
People from all walks of life are welcome for guidance.
Well-known designers Liu Huazhi, Liang Ziheng both graduated from the Department of General Design of the Macao Institute of Technology, and then co-founded the design company in 2013, after five years of hard work, the company's outstanding achievements, more than 200 awards in the world, the design business all over the world, the business spanned more than 10 countries and 25 cities, successfully pushed the team design to the international, prestigious.
It is at the invitation of the Macao Polytechnic Alumni Association to exhibit their ingenious design works, as well as sharing their entrepreneurial miles.
In addition to sharing entrepreneurial experience on the same day, there will also be exchanges on Macao's design and development.
The exhibition dates from September 29 to October 10, 2019, and is open from 9 a.m. to 11 p.m. on holidays.
For enquiries, you can contact the Alumni Association at 85993119.
Lao collectives and individuals were awarded the National Medal and Badge of Vietnam
According to Vietnamese President Nguyen Phu Trong’s decision on the awarding of the Independence Medal on September 21, Vietnam awarded the Independence Medal to 12 collectives and 13 individuals from various organs of the Lao National Assembly, various organs of the National Assembly and the Secretariat of the National Assembly, in recognition of their positive contribution to consolidating and strengthening the special solidarity between the various organs of the National Assembly of the two countries.
Vietnamese President Nguyen Phu Trong also issued a decision on the awarding of the Order of Friendship and the Badge of Friendship.
Pursuant to that decision, the Vietnamese state decided to award 21 friendship medals and 17 friendship badges to four groups and 34 individuals of the Lao National Assembly, the various organs of the National Assembly and the Secretariat of the National Assembly, in recognition of their positive contribution to the consolidation and strengthening of the special solidarity relationship between the various organs of the National Assembly of the two countries.
Speaking at the awarding ceremony, Ms. Nguyễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễễṻễễễng Ngễễṻ��ễễễễễễễỡn stressed that the inextricable relationship between the two peoples has been formed from a long historical process, and the good traditional friendship, consistent and selfless relations between the two peoples between Vietnam and Laos
Ms. Nguyễễễễễễễễễễễỻ Nộễn stressed that under the complex and ever-changing situation of the world situation, Vietnam's great friendship, special friendship and all-round
Ms. Nguyễễn stressed that the award of the Vietnamese Party and State Medal and Badge to all the collective and former senior leading cadres of the Lao National Assembly is the great contribution of the Vietnamese Party, country and people to the comrades, and hopes that comrades will continue to work hard to make more contributions to strengthening the great friendship, special solidarity and comprehensive cooperation between Vietnam and Laos.
Ms. Nguyễễn stressed that the Party and State of Vietnam will continue to maintain close cooperation with the Party and State of Laos, inherit and give full play to the results of the cooperation achieved by the two sides, and actively consolidate and promote the great friendship, special solidarity and comprehensive cooperation between the two countries.
The collectives and individuals of the Lao National Assembly, which have been awarded the Order of Independence, the Order of Friendship and the Badge of Friendship, have expressed their gratitude to the Vietnamese state for their honorary awards, and affirmed that this is not only an honor for them, but also an honor for the Lao National Assembly.
E-cigarettes in the United States have lost 12 lives and related lung damage has reached 805 cases.
According to the "Central News Agency" reported that on the 26th local time, U.S. health officials said that 12 people in the United States have died of e-cigarette-related diseases, and there are 805 cases of lung damage related to e-cigarettes.
According to reports, the U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention reported that these numbers have not yet been identified as specific substances that cause related diseases.
However, most patients have reported the use of e-cigarette products containing tetrahydrocannabinol, which are the main compounds in cannabis that affect the mental state.
It is reported that the surge in lung cases is related to the purchase of contaminated electronic smogifiers on the black market.
According to the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, the 12 deaths occurred in 10 states from California to Florida, and 805 related confirmed and suspected cases were reported by 46 states and the U.S. Virgin Islands.
In the past three weeks, India and Massachusetts in the United States have banned the sale of e-cigarettes, while New York and Michigan have banned flavored e-cigarettes.
According to the report, the Trump administration intends to ban all flavored e-cigarette products other than tobacco in October.
When will the next bus arrive?
"Internet + smart station cards" let you know in your heart.
On the 27th, Nanjing Intelligent Transportation and Gaode Map announced that the country's first batch of "Internet + intelligent station cards" officially landed in Nanjing, when 54 bus electronic screens will be lit, which will comprehensively upgrade Nanjing's information service level, improve the efficiency of public transport services and the happiness of people's travel.
In the past, the anxious scene of waiting for the car was staged at the bus station almost every day.
The bus running time is difficult to predict, along the bus road conditions and vehicle locations are difficult to know, bus travel pain points need to be solved urgently, especially in some large cities, commuting routes are long, morning and evening commuting peak time traffic conditions are complex, resulting in the bus punctuality rate has been difficult to guarantee.
To this end, Nanjing Intelligent Transportation and Gaode Map explored the new direction of "Internet + traffic" convenience services, and launched the first batch of "Internet + intelligent station cards" as an intelligent service project in the country.
It is reported that the country's first batch of "Internet + intelligent station card" landed in Nanjing, the integration of Gaode big data and Gaode's vehicle is expected to travel time ETA algorithm, and relying on the upgrade of bus electronic station and mobile Internet, traffic big data, to achieve "bus intelligent station card + electronic map" dual-end release of bus routes, bus is expected to station time and other capabilities.
Through the "Internet + intelligent station", Nanjing citizens can not only easily obtain the expected station time of the bus, understand the real-time location of the bus and there are several stations away from the current station, but also intuitively grasp the bus road conditions along the way through the three colors of red, orange and green, so that the real-time situation of the bus lines through the station can be seen at a glance.
Thanks to the "Internet + intelligent station card", the science and technology is warm on the line, Nanjing citizens have realized convenient and efficient bus travel methods such as "inquiring the location of the bus before going out, mastering the station time before going out, and understanding the arrival time when taking the bus".
According to the real-time bus information of "Internet + intelligent station card", choose the most suitable travel route for yourself, and at the same time, you can also do a good job of psychological expectations and reduce the anxiety of waiting for cars, so as to make travel more convenient and calm.
More than 30 high-quality cultural relics of the Summer Palace were exhibited for the first time - Xinhua.com
The reporter learned from the Beijing Summer Palace Management Office that a total of 99 sets of cultural relics were exhibited, of which more than 30 cultural relics were exhibited to the public for the first time, showing the rich collection of court cultural relics of the Summer Palace and its traditional prosperity culture.
It is reported that the exhibition is divided into four exhibition areas: Ruiyu Jijin, Fu Shushou, Qi Gong, and Fulai, and exhibits many types of cultural relics such as jade bronze, ancient books and calligraphy, miscellaneous, porcelain enamel to the audience, and the shape of the exhibits and patterns are reflected in the theme of "Fushou".
Yan Lijia, deputy director of the cultural relics department of the Summer Palace Management Department, introduced that there are many high-level cultural relics in this cultural relics exhibition, many cultural objects, and a large number of exhibits.
Nearly 30% of the cultural relics participating in the exhibition are state-level cultural relics and second-level cultural relics, and the age of cultural relics has spanned from the Shang Dynasty to the Qing Guangxu period.
For the display of the Shang Dynasty is more than 3,000 years ago, for the exhibition of "the oldest" one of the bronze cultural relics; green jade lying cattle size, weight of nearly 80 pounds, is made up of a whole piece of green jade carvings, the preservation of good, very rare; mountain stone characters wooden bells, "Nanjing Jin Painting Book", "Nanjing Jin Book" is also the first exhibition to the public high-quality cultural relics.
Qin Lei, deputy director of the Beijing Summer Palace Management Department, said that this cultural exhibition upholds the spirit of allowing cultural relics to "live up", relying on the idea of "Fukuyama Shouhai" of the Summer Palace, taking the cultural relics of "Fushou" as the carrier, so that tourists can learn about the profound prosperity culture of Summer Palace through the exhibition, carry forward and inherit Chinese traditional culture, and convey the good wishes of blessing.
It is reported that the cultural relics exhibition will continue until January 30, 2020.
Xinhua Times Review: Unswervingly Walk our own path
The white paper "China and the World in the New Era" released on the 27th answers: In the past 70 years, China's development has been successful, and the fundamental reason is that under the leadership of the Communist Party of China, the Chinese people have found the correct development path of socialism with Chinese characteristics and continue unswervingly along this path.
China's approach to its own development path is the choice of history and the choice of the people.
Since modern times, in an environment of accumulated poverty and weakness, internal and external troubles, generations of benevolent people are looking forward and succeeding in search of the road of national salvation and national salvation.
However, "the constitutional monarchy, the restoration of the imperial system, the parliamentary system, the multi-party system, and the presidential system have all thought and tried, and the results will not work."
It was not until the Communist Party of China, with the new China, that the Chinese people gradually opened up a path of socialism with Chinese characteristics in practice.
The road that China has taken is the path of the happiness of the Chinese people, the road to the rejuvenation of the Chinese nation, and the same path for the common development of China and other countries around the world.
It is precisely because on the right path that China can handle its own affairs, become the world's second largest economy, and contribute the most to global economic growth, and continue to benefit the world with its own development.
As pointed out in the white paper, China's development path, in line with China's national conditions, to meet the requirements of the times, will be more and more with the times to show bright development prospects.
Looking back, the Chinese people know how easy it is to find the right path; looking around the world, the Chinese people cherish this correct path more.
The Chinese people know the truth of Nanxuan North, and understand that it is not necessarily suitable for others, and only it is the best that is suitable for them.
It is with this kind of self-confidence and strategic determination on this path that China has created a remarkable miracle.
In the tortuous process of human progress, the "final conclusion of history" has been famous.
Today, the success of the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics proclaims the end of the "ultimate conclusion of history", the collapse of "China's collapse theory", and the failure of "socialist failure theory".
China's success has boosted the confidence of developing countries to realize the prosperity and strength of their countries, expanded the ways for developing countries to move towards modernization, and provided experience and reference for those countries and peoples in the world who both hope to accelerate development and maintain their own independence, and take the road in line with their own national conditions.
The world is rich.
China has always respected the right of all countries to choose a development path appropriate to their own national conditions.
China does not "import" the foreign model, nor "exports" the Chinese model, but will unswervingly follow its own path, achieve its own continuous development, and strengthen exchanges with other countries in governance, so as to make due contributions to the joint realization of good governance and good governance.
At the Fair Work Commission, it was found that the owner of a Foodworks supermarket fired a 66-year-old female worker via text message because he preferred to hire employees from Asian-American backgrounds, and the boss's practice was slammed as "shameful."
The committee says the manner in which Ms. Gail Ayton’s boss, who has worked at the Wagga Wagga store for more than 20 years, is “extremely unfair” and may have violated anti-discrimination laws.
Ms Ayton told the committee that Mr. Wang had taken over the store in 2016, and that he had always "wanted to fire me" because she wasn't Chinese.
In this case, Peter Sams, deputy chairman of the committee, conducted a search on the Internet and found that "Mr. Wang has published some job advertisements on various Chinese employment forums in Australia in the past".
Among the job requirements listed for these positions, one of them said "Preferred Asian Lady" and the other said "Preferred Asian Employee".
The third post said that he was "more inclined to people overseas (sic)".
Mr. Wang fired Ms. Ayton via text message in April of this year, which he later said was due to her absence from work and the alleged lack of a small amount of cash in the cash register from $5.10 to $30.
However, Mr. Sams said that Mr. Wang ' s reasons for dismissing Ms. Ayton were weak and there was a lack of evidence.
In the past three years, she has only been absent from one shift, and the "missing amount" totals a few dollars.
He said Ms Ayton's dismissal was "actually unrelated to her behavior or performance".
“In my opinion, supported by evidentiary support from Mr. Wang’s job advertisements, the real motivation for her dismissal is that he is more willing to hire employees with Asian backgrounds,” he said.
Pursuant to section 772(f) of the Fair Work Act, Mr. Wang's actions ostensibly constitute a violation of anti-discrimination laws and/or dismissal of the applicant are unlawful."
Mr Sams said it would be inappropriate for him to consider reinstating her post in view of Mr Wang's "horrendous" treatment of Ms. Ayton.
He should consider paying compensation to Ms. Ayton, who is a temporary worker with a salary of $26 per hour.
In light of a possible violation of anti-discrimination and labour relations legislation, Sams said he would refer his rulings and documents to the head of the committee to consider whether Mr. Wang’s actions should be turned over to other agencies to investigate possible violations of state or federal laws.
He stated that Mr. Wang had not given Ms. Ayton any chance of responding to the reasons for her alleged dismissal.
"I believe that the defence should have resorted to an incorrigible unjust and biased procedure to dismiss the applicant, and Mr. Wang 'waited' for this opportunity, which he believed would 'prove' that it was justified to terminate the applicant's employment," he said.
“He’s wrong . . . who should be in complete disregard of any natural and fair treatment given to her when he dismisses the applicant, and it’s shocking that he’s being impertinent and grossly unfair perfunctory.”
Mr. Sams said that while Foodworks is a small business, “it’s important to be honest that no decent employer will lay off employees in a way that is grossly unfair and perfunctoryly acknowledged in this case.”
“It’s a shame, and it’s extremely unfair,” he said.
Canton Railway against the National Day Golden Week passenger flow daily increase of 175 passenger trains - Sino-Singapore network
GUANGZHOU, Sept. 27 (Xu Jing) reporter learned from Guangzhou Railway Group on the 27th that in order to meet the passenger travel needs of the National Day Golden Week, Canton Railway Group will successively increase the number of popular trains, and the total number of passenger trains will be increased to 175 per day during the holiday period.
Guangzhou Railway Group will take a number of measures to do a good job of passenger service during the peak of passenger flow.
Guangzhou South Railway Station has optimized the transformation of the three-story security inspection channel, adding 12 new security inspection channels, and after the new transformation, there are a total of 44 security lanes in the three-level waiting room. In addition, in order to unimpede the flow of passengers into the station, Guangzhou South Station has added 19 self-service real-name system verification equipment, a total of 71.
In order to alleviate the detention and congestion of vehicles in the north and south roads of South Railway Station, Guangzhou South Railway Station will open 3 new parking lots and add 1,000 new parking spaces to ease the pressure of poor traffic around the South Railway Station.
Shenzhen North Railway Station will open a "high-speed rail-subway" inspection-free green channel.
From October 6th to 7th, when the passenger flow reaches the peak period, the A2 exit of Shenzhen North Station will be connected with the subway, and there will be an inspection-free channel to provide convenient travel for passengers arriving during peak hours.
In addition, the East-West Square will normally set up the U-color love expressway, which will serve passengers and special key passengers who arrive at the station 15 minutes before driving.
On the eve of the National Day Golden Week, the Guangjiu passenger section carries out full-time business training to ensure that all members of the flight attendants learn to master business knowledge, improve the quality of service, and ensure that train attendants have a good spirit and more professional standards of business quality, and play a good role in each travel work and provide better services for passengers.
6 people deny that they are involved in the sale of pseudo-Maka newspaper paper
Six men suspected of falsifying and selling Chinese passports, newspaper papers and identity cards, including an assistant director of the State-named Registration Bureau and a Datuk-level businessman, passed the case on Thursday, and the magistrate approved allegations of anti-trafficking and anti-traffic immigration, which was transferred to the high court for trial.
Among them, Li Zhenhua, a defense lawyer who originally represented Datuk Chinese defendant Li Zhenhua, who was also a member of parliament in Sunset Cave District, applied to the judge to withdraw from representing the trial, that is, he would no longer become the representative lawyer of the defendant and was approved in court.
He said that he had attracted criticism of political opponents on behalf of the defendant himself, and that his action party had also been implicated.
He stressed that he was not afraid of any threat, but did not want to be used by irresponsible units to stigmatize the Pakatan Harapan government or other Pakatan Harapan leaders, so this decision was made after careful consideration.
He also said that there is no conflict of interest between representing the defendant and being a member of Congress, and he is not legally prohibited from representing any of the defendants, so far, the defendant Li Zhenhua has not yet been convicted.
The six defendants were charged in court on 12 September this year, in the face of a number of anti-trafficking and anti-trafficking immigration Act section 26E, as well as the Penal Code section 466 (falsification of documents), all denied guilt and did not obtain the court approval of bail pending trial.
On Thursday, two district judges, Nosaha, and Mazlan, after statements from both sides of the prosecution, approved the prosecution's application to transfer the charges of the anti-trafficking and anti-trafficking immigration decrees involving the six defendants to the high court, and the charges of falsification of documents will be heard in court on October 3, waiting for the prosecution to hand over the documents to the defense.
The earlier six defendants were arrested under the National Security Offences (Special Measures) Act 2012 (SOSMA), so the judge did not grant bail.
Walking with the motherland - a team of the People's Armed Police
Jin Qiu, on the parade training ground, the average height of 1.83 meters of officers and soldiers composed of armed police forces, training is busy.
Shiny thorns, unique olive greens and bright red epaulets together form a beautiful landscape.
A few days ago, the reporter walked into this team and felt the determination of armed police officers and soldiers to always be loyal guardians of the party and the people, as well as their "honor first" feelings and pursuits.
â€œThe dream illuminates the glorious life and writes the legend of immortality in the new eraâ€¦â€¦ â€œThis is the team songâ€ created by the team officers and soldiersâ€ â€œWalk with the mother
In the team, this song is the motto of every team member.
With a height of 1.92 meters, Qi Xiaoguang is particularly conspicuous in standing in the square team.
As the flag bearer of the flag guard of the original armed police, he has a deeper understanding of honor.
The honor of the military comes from hard training.
As Qi Xiaoguang, the standard bearer, training has always had high standards and strict requirements.
He tied the sandbag to practice, stuck with the second table to practice the pace, blindfolded to practice striding, against the strong wind to practice stability.
In his "Flag career", there is a picture that is always unforgettable.
At a flag-raising ceremony, the heavy rain poured down, and none of the tourists who came to watch the flag-raising ceremony left.
At the moment when the national flag was raised, Qi Xiaoguang deeply felt the glory represented by this five-star red flag on his shoulders.
In 2019, Qi Xiaoguang was selected as the benchmark soldier.
The standards for the action of the base soldier and the flag bearer are different.
Qi Xiaoguang introduced that although there are only more than 20 steps in the progress of the flag bearer and the benchmark soldiers, more efforts must be made in training.
The benchmark soldier is the first place in the first platoon, which directly determines the neatness of the team.
After the parade focused on training, he repeatedly kicked his legs every day and practiced some kicking hard skills.
In the demonstration demonstration, his precise stride and speed won the applause of officers and soldiers.
In the team, almost every officer and soldier has the same experience as Qi Xiaoguang.
The father of the warrior Zhu Xuxuan participated in the 50th anniversary military parade of the National Day 20 years ago.
In order to follow his father's footsteps and become a member of the team, he suffered setbacks again and again, but he was never discouraged.
He said: "To be able to walk through Tiananmen Square like my father, to accept the party and the people's review is the glory of my life, I am willing to eat and suffer," he said.
Walk into the team's honorary room, "the capital's maintenance of the elite teacher" 8 characters into the eyes.
Wang Qian, political commissar of the party team, said that all the members of the team came from the Beijing Armed Police Corps - this is a unit with a glorious tradition, which has undertaken major tasks such as the founding ceremony, successive National Day celebrations, the security of successive party congresses and the capital's counter-terrorism and stability maintenance, cultivating a large number of British model collectives and individuals such as "flag guardians" and "Defensive Heroes Squadron", and more than 50 units and individuals have been awarded honorary titles by the State Council, the Central Military Commission and the Armed Police Force.
Meeting of foreign experts to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China
The reception of foreign experts celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China was held in the Great Hall of the People on the evening of the 27th, and the Standing Committee of the Political Bureau of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and Vice Premier of the State Council Han Zheng attended and delivered
On behalf of the Chinese government and on behalf of President Xi Jinping, Mr. Han expressed sincere gratitude and sincere greetings to all foreign experts and international friends who are concerned about, supporting and participating in China's reform, opening up and modernization.
Han Zheng said that since the founding of New China, especially more than 40 years of reform and opening up, the Communist Party of China has united and led the people of all ethnic groups across the country to work hard, successfully walked out of a path of socialism with Chinese characteristics, and ushered in a great leap from standing up and getting rich to getting stronger.
Since the 18th National Congress of the Communist Party of China, the Party Central Committee, with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, has comprehensively promoted the overall layout of the "five in one", coordinated the promotion of the "four comprehensive" strategic layout, promoted the historical achievements of the party and the state, and achieved historical changes, and socialism with Chinese characteristics has entered a new era.
The development achievements of New China in the past 70 years are the result of the unremitting efforts of the people of all ethnic groups in China, and it also condenses the hard work of foreign experts.
In the past 70 years, a large number of foreign experts have come to China to join the Chinese people in the cause of modernization and made indelible contributions, which the Chinese people will never forget.
Han Zheng pointed out that China's development has stood at a new historical starting point, and the Chinese people are working tirelessly to build a well-off society in an all-round way, seize the great victory of socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era, and realize the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
China will adhere to "development is the first priority, talent is the first resource, innovation is the first driving force", vigorously implement the innovation-driven development strategy, and promote high-quality economic development.
People are the most innovative and dynamic factors, and China will accelerate the cultivation of a large number of strategic scientific and technological talents, scientific and technological leading talents, young scientific and technological talents and high-level innovation teams at an international level.
Han Zheng said that China's cause is a cause supported by the people of the world, a cause of opening up and learning to the world, and a cause of cooperation with all countries in the world.
China will be more open and inclusive, humbly learning from the peoples of the world, and firmly implementing a more active, more open and more effective talent introduction policy.
We sincerely welcome more and more foreign experts to China for innovation and entrepreneurship, and we welcome talents from all over the world to participate in China's modernization construction, and make greater contributions to promoting the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind and making greater contributions to world peace and development and the cause of human progress.
Liu He, Yang Jiechi, Chen Xi, Zhang Chunxian, Xiao Jie and Wangang attended the reception.
The reception was hosted by Wang Zhigang, Minister of Science and Technology.
The reception was attended by old foreign experts who worked in China for a long time, representatives of foreign experts working in China and spouses, responsible comrades of the relevant departments of the central and state organs and Beijing, a total of about 1,800 people.
China's railway is the most deep shaft drilling into the end.
Xinhua News Agency, Kunming, September 27 (Reporter Ding Yiquan) According to the China Railway Tunnel Bureau Group Co., Ltd., China's first long railway tunnel - Da (Li) Rui (Li) Railway Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel No. 1 shaft main well successfully dug into the end on the 27th, well depth 762.59 meters broke the domestic railway shaft record.
In tunnel construction, the shaft can play a role in improving tunnel ventilation, improving efficiency, and ensuring construction safety.
Song Tao, chief engineer of the silo work area of the Dahui Project Department of the China Railway Tunnel Bureau, said: "After the successful excavation of the main well of the No. 1 shaft of the Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel, it will help to promote the construction of the construction of the bottom of the well, open a number of working surfaces for the later construction, and speed up the construction of the entire Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel."
Song Tao introduced, Gaoligong mountain tunnel No. 1 shaft construction using the drilling method, equipped wiping well frame, chiseling steady car, chiseling wiping metal template, FJD-6A type umbrella drill, center rotary rock machine and other large-scale professional machinery, the formation of mechanized excavation system, chopping system, suspension system, winch lifting system and other mechanized water lines, the realization of eye-opening, bursting, out of the system, etc.
It is understood that the Darui Railway, from Dali to Ruili in the west, has a total length of about 331 kilometers and a design speed of 140 kilometers per hour, which is an important part of the China-Myanmar international railway channel.
Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel has a total length of 34.538 kilometers, which is China's first railway tunnel.
The TV series "Fox Hunting" on the spot to reproduce the first-line investigation of the police style
Multinational fugitive investigation drama "fox hunting" recently in the Tianjin airport scene, Wang Kai, Wang Gou and other actors at the scene to escort the fugitive economic suspects to return home and other important scenes, the filming process was supported by China Southern Airlines.
At the airport, the "fox hunting" crew filmed the key drama that can best show the law enforcement results of "Operation Fox Hunting" - the members of the fox hunting team chased the fugitives back home, detained the plane, signed the arrest warrant and so on.
The crew captured many sets of shots such as tarmacs, customs border checks, aircraft cabins, and doors, and recreated China's first-line reconnaissance police and fox hunting heroes flying in many countries, arresting fugitive criminals and professional style.
In order to successfully complete the shooting, "Fox Hunting" creative team carried out a lot of preliminary preparations, repeatedly confirmed each implementation details, to ensure that the most true and most direct attention to people's visual effects.
It is reported that the drama will also be filmed in many places abroad.
Vietnam should seize the opportunity for the development of artificial intelligence.
The four criteria used to evaluate and rank cities in the face of the AI wave preparation level include prospects, realization capabilities, asset base and development direction.
Singapore ranked first, followed by countries such as the United Kingdom, the United States, France, Sweden, the Netherlands, Germany and Australia.
Oliver Wyman's organization expert Timosin Pevanne said in an interview with reporters: "I think it is very meaningful to review and evaluate cities such as Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City in Vietnam.
In general, I believe that Vietnam's future is very bright in the context of high growth rate, strong economic development path and rapid development of the talent base.
I think Vietnam is on the right path and doing well.
It’s important for Vietnam to know how to take advantage of the opportunities presented by the Fourth Industrial Revolution to drive more economic growth.”
Artificial intelligence is completely changing people’s jobs, communications and lifestyles.
It brings greater efficiency, but it also creates the threat of exacerbating social, economic, and technological inequalities.
However, according to a global study organized by Oliver Wyman, there is only any city in the world that is ready for the breakthrough brought about by the era of artificial intelligence.
The Secretary-General is pleased to celebrate the 70th anniversary of China’s founding here and congratulates the Chinese government and people for their impressive achievements over the past 70 years.
“Every time I visit China, I’m shocked by the pace of its change and progress,” Guterres said.
You have created one of the world's most dynamic economies and lifted more than 850 million people out of poverty â€“ the largest poverty alleviation achievement in history."
In terms of its vision for achieving the Millennium Development Goals (MDGs), he said, China has witnessed transformative results: declining infant and maternal mortality, improved nutrition, declining stunted populations and halving fewer people without access to safe drinking water and sanitation.
At the same time, China has one of the best education systems in the world, attracting international students from all over the world.
Celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China photo exhibition opened today at the United Nations
Guterres said that this year is also the 40th anniversary of the United Nations in China.
Over the past 40 years, China has been a key player in the work of the United Nations and has become a pillar of international cooperation and multilateralism.
After promoting the implementation of the Millennium Development Goals, China is actively implementing the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development.
As the second largest contributor to the United Nations regular budget and the peacekeeping budget, China has always been a partner in ensuring that the activities of the United Nations remain stable.
