There is the story of national unity, and China's policy of regional ethnic autonomy has made great achievements, whether it is Xinjiang in the north and south of Tianshan, or Tibet in the snowy plateau.
The economy is developing rapidly, the society is peaceful and stable, and the people live in peace and prosperity.
