As Chinese President Xi Jinping has said, the green and green mountains are Jinshan Yinshan.
After continuous efforts, China has embarked on the road of green development.
China pursues a peaceful foreign policy, actively establishes diplomatic relations with all countries in the world, plays a role in solving hotspot issues and becomes the backbone of world peace.
In the face of the great changes that have not occurred in the world in a hundred years, China has actively safeguarded the international system with the United Nations as the core.
After 70 years, China is youthful, vigorous and prosperous, no matter how the international situation changes, we will adhere to our original intention.
Wang Yi Meets with Malawi's Foreign Minister Casella
On the 26th local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi met with Malawi's Foreign Minister Casella on the sidelines of the United Nations General Assembly in New York.
Wang Yi expressed that in the 12 years since the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Malaysia, bilateral relations has developed steadily, and exchanges and cooperation in various fields have progressed steadily.
Last year, President Xi Jinping invited President Mutarika to attend the Beijing Summit of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation, and the two heads of state held a fruitful meeting, leading China-Marse relations to a new level.
China is willing to work with the Malaysian side to continue to implement the important consensus of the two heads of state and the outcomes of the Beijing Summit of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation, so as to promote the further development of practical cooperation between the two countries.
China is willing to strengthen communication and coordination with Malaysia in international affairs and safeguard the common interests of the two sides and the overall situation of China-Africa relations.
Casella said that China is a true friend of Malawi and African countries, and China's development has benefited the people of Malawi.
Malaysia adheres to the one-China policy and is grateful for China's support and assistance to Malawi.
The Malaysian side looks forward to the further development of Malaysia-China relations and welcomes more Chinese enterprises to invest in Malaysia.
About 800 million National Day travel reflects China's tourism supply and demand
About 800 million people will travel in the upcoming "Eleven" Golden Week!
The big data of a number of tourism platforms shows that China's tourism consumption market has two prosperous supply and demand.
Ctrip's National Day tourism report predicts that with reference to National Day tourism statistics in previous years, it is expected that the number of domestic tourists will be close to 800 million during the National Day holiday this year; in addition, there will be more than 7.5 million outbound tourism.
At present, there are tourists from more than 500 cities through the platform to book group tours, free travel, customized tourism, local play and other products, involving 100 countries and regions.
According to the estimates of the China Tourism Research Institute, last year's National Day holiday received a total of 726 million domestic tourists, an increase of 9.43%.
This year's National Day holiday not only the number of tourists will reach a new high, consumption upgrade will also become the "main theme" of National Day holiday travel.
According to the Ctrip report, during the National Day holiday, domestic inter-provincial tourism spent more than 3,000 yuan, an increase from the same period last year, which is due to the fact that tourists generally choose to experience better products, such as high-scoring brand hotels, no shopping tours, exquisite small groups, special car guides and so on.
Donkey mother travel network booking data shows a similar trend, the domestic long-term use of comfortable models, less than ten people "private group" is more popular than in previous years.
Spring and autumn tourism data show that its consumers prefer heavy experience, heavy service, heavy differentiation of "slow".
Flying pig data shows that China's fourth-tier and below cities tourist bookings rose the fastest, year-on-year growth rate reached 30%, reflecting the consumption upgrade of more domestic residents in more regions.
Personalization is a major feature of this year's "Eleven" Golden Week tourism.
Ctrip data show that the National Day holiday car rental self-driving travel orders are expected to increase by nearly 60% year-on-year, and the short-distance self-driving tour that explores the surrounding niche lines continues to be popular; the number of registrations of private groups has increased by as much as 155% year-on-year.
Sharing joy has become the main purpose of people's travel and leisure.
Ctrip data show that 28% of National Day holiday tourists are parent-child groups, 25% are couples traveling, and 23% are co-workers and friends traveling together.
In addition, in terms of the age of tourists, "post-80s" and "post-90s" accounted for more than 50% of the total number of tourists.
It is worth noting that, unlike in the past, Golden Week outbound travel growth is more rapid, this year's domestic travel market performance is more "eye-catching".
Flying pig data show that the number of people booking domestic travel routes on the National Day holiday this year increased by 42% year-on-year, exceeding the growth rate of outbound travel.
According to the analysis of the industry, at the same time of strong demand, all over the country to promote the reform of the tourism supply side, to provide tourists with a more rich "welcome feast".
For example, the General Administration of Sports and the Ministry of Culture and Tourism recently jointly released the "2019 11 Golden Week Sports Tourism Boutique Line"; the 2019 Shanghai Tourism Festival is being held to launch 7 sections of 100 cultural and tourism activities to attract Chinese and foreign tourists to participate; close to the Golden Week, Henan, Zhejiang, Hunan, Shandong and other provinces have introduced scenic spot ticket price reduction or free measures.
Ctrip booking data show that the country has a unique natural scenery or cultural characteristics of the destination of the most "fire", Chongqing, Wuhan, Hangzhou, Xi'an, Chengdu, Guangzhou, Beijing, Shanghai, Nanjing, Tianjin will be the most popular domestic tourist destination city.
China's first live theatrical film "At This Moment - Celebrating the 70th Birthday of New China" will be broadcast simultaneously in 70 theaters in more than 10 provinces across the country on October 1.
Through the 4K ultra-high-definition signal, the Central Radio and Television Station will broadcast the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China on the big screen.
The person in charge of the Central Radio and Television Station was introduced in Beijing on the 27th that on the National Day, the station will build more than 100 seats, and more than 200 pick-up equipment will be set up along Chang'an Street and the commanding heights of the festivities, using lens language and simultaneous sound to realize the whole process for the first time.
China is expected to become Australia's largest beef export market.
An animal protein analyst at Rabobank said China faced a severe pork shortage after the outbreak of African swine fever, which is expected to become Australia's largest beef export market.
After the outbreak, Chinese consumers were moving from edible pork to other animal proteins, causing authorities to destroy many herds, and in the past year, the number of pigs in China has halved, and pork prices have almost doubled.
China produces and consumes two-thirds of the world’s pork.
Chenjun Pan, a senior animal protein analyst at Rabobank China, said demand for other meats, including beef, has increased, with China, the world's largest importer of animal protein, currently importing 27% of the world's pork and 24% of the world's beef imports.
In the first half of this year, China's beef imports from Australia increased by 65%, surpassing the United States and Japan to become Australia's largest beef export market.
Yesterday, the Chinese government said that it would release more pork from emergency reserves before celebrating the 70th anniversary of the Chinese Communist Party’s rule.
White paper: China has always put its own development in the coordinate system of human development.
According to the white paper, China has always placed its own development in the coordinate system of human development, and has always closely linked its own destiny to the fate of the peoples of the world.
According to the white paper, China promotes world peace and development with its own development.
As the world's largest developing country, China's unswervingly follow its own path, focus on running its own affairs, making the country richer and stronger and the people happier, and injecting stability and certainty into a complex and ever-changing world is itself the greatest contribution to world peace and development.
China in the new era will continue to unswervingly follow the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics under the guidance of Xi Jinping's socialist ideology with Chinese characteristics in the new era.
China has always taken economic construction as the center as the priority of developing countries, unswervingly taking the road of high-quality development, implementing the new development concept of innovation, coordination, green, openness and sharing, accelerating the construction of a modern economic system, and better meeting the people's growing needs for a better life.
Allowing ordinary people to live a good life has always been the biggest goal of China's development.
China's army has always been a staunch defender of world peace.
The white paper pointed out that China adheres to win-win cooperation and common development.
"The Chinese people not only want to live a good life, but also hope that the people of other countries will have a good life."
China adheres to development and innovation, growth linkage and integration of interests, promotes the high-quality development of the "Belt and Road", and promotes global poverty reduction and development.
According to the white paper, China firmly upholds and promotes economic globalization.
China is an active participant in economic globalization and a strong supporter.
China is willing to work with the international community to take the initiative and strengthen guidance to make the process of economic globalization more dynamic, more inclusive and more sustainable.
China will implement a more proactive opening-up strategy, create a more comprehensive, deeper and more diverse pattern of opening-up, achieve broader mutual benefit and win-win results, and safeguard and promote economic globalization with practical actions.
China firmly opposes unilateralism and protectionism, and the door to opening up to the outside world will open wider, accelerate regional economic integration, and continue to promote the internationalization of the RMB.
The white paper pointed out that China firmly supports multilateralism and upholds international fairness and justice.
As always, China will firmly uphold the international system with the United Nations as the core, firmly uphold the international order with the purposes and principles of the Charter of the United Nations as the core, work with other countries to adhere to multilateralism and oppose unilateralism.
Safeguarding fairness and justice is China's basic guideline for dealing with international issues.
China respects the development path and social system independently chosen by the people of all countries, respects the sovereignty and territorial integrity of all countries, and opposes the interference of external forces in the internal affairs of other countries.
China will never impose its will on others, and it will never allow anyone to impose their will on the Chinese people.
According to the white paper, China actively participates in leading the reform and construction of the global governance system.
As a responsible major country, China has always adhered to the balance of rights and obligations, not only seeing China's development requirements for the world, but also seeing the expectations of the international community for China and actively participating in the reform and construction of the global governance system.
China actively supports the reform of the United Nations, promotes the United Nations to better adapt to the new requirements of global governance in terms of ideas, institutional settings and operating models, better fulfills the responsibilities assigned by the Charter of the United Nations, and plays a greater role in maintaining world peace and promoting common development.
China has actively promoted the innovative development of global governance concepts, summarized the successful practices and experiences of national governance in a timely manner, actively explored the positive ways of doing things in Chinese culture and the resonance of governance concepts with today's times, and strived to contribute China's wisdom, China's solutions and China's strength to improving global governance.
Wang Yi: To help Africa achieve peace and security, China has never been absent.
On September 26, local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi attended the Security Council's "African peace and security" public meeting at the United Nations Headquarters in New York.
Wang Yi said in his speech that China and Africa are good friends, good brothers and good partners.
To help Africa maintain peace and security, China has never been absent.
At this very moment, more than 2,000 Chinese peacekeepers are guarding peace in five United Nations mission areas in Africa.
The Chinese Navy has been escorting in the Gulf of Aden and Somali waters for more than 10 years, and has completed more than 1,200 batches of more than 6,700 ship escort missions.
Wang Yi said that we support Africa in strengthening its capacity for peace and security.
The China-United Nations Peace and Development Fund, announced by President Xi Jinping in September 2015, will focus on supporting African peacekeeping, counter-terrorism and achieving sustainable development, and has so far carried out 34 Africa-related projects, becoming a new platform for trilateral cooperation between China, Africa and the United Nations.
On the road to achieving peaceful development in Africa, China will continue to stand firmly with Africa and work side by side.
The world's oldest barber died at the age of 108, and his hair was cut for 96 years.
Anthony Mancinelli, the world's oldest hairdresser certified by New York in the United States, is 108 years old when he has never retired to cut his hair every day, but on the 19th, Mancinelli passed away due to complications of jaw cancer and bids farewell to his 96-year-old haircut.
According to "CNN" reported that Mansinelli immigrated to the United States at the age of 8, not long in a barber shop to help clean the floor, at the age of 12 began to pick up scissors to serve guests, so as to reduce the economic pressure of the family.
Mancinelli was in elementary school at the time, but he did not graduate.
Mancinelli's son Robert revealed that his father loves his job, and people from all over the world like him, but although his father has always been healthy, he was diagnosed with cancer in February this year, and finally couldn't get to work due to physical factors six weeks before he died, but this is not retired, because he plans to wait for himself to get better.
Robert, 82, said he now has to find a new barber after his father's death, because he's always asked his father's help to cut his hair.
During the year, the repurchase scale of listed companies exceeded 100 billion yuan - Xinhua
In order to stabilize the company's stock price and maintain the company's image, listed companies have begun to repurchase shares frequently in the past two years, hoping to pass on the information of the company's undervaluation to the market through targeted repurchases and collective bidding transactions, so as to stabilize stock prices and enhance investor confidence.
According to Oriental Wealth Choice data, the funds used by listed companies to repurchase shares in 2017 were 7.9 billion yuan, which soared to 51 billion yuan in 2018, and since 2019, the total amount of repurchase implementation of A-share listed companies has exceeded 100 billion yuan, setting a new high in the amount of A-share repurchase funds, and far exceeding the previous year.
Judging from the purpose of repurchasing, the company's repurchase of shares seems to be the same as that of major shareholders, but there are great differences in the implementation of the main body, the source of funds, the use of repurchase, and the equity of the stock
Xu Yang, chairman of Shanghai Miao Corong Information Consulting Co., Ltd., said in an interview with the "Securities Daily" reporter that in November 2018, the "Opinions on Supporting Listed Companies to Repurchase Shares" was revised in response to the existing system such as the narrow scope of share repurchases, the complexity of decision-making procedures, and the incomplete inventory system.
In January this year, the Shanghai Stock Exchange and the Shenzhen Stock Exchange officially released the "Implementation Rules for Repurchasing Shares by Listed Companies", which broadened the source of repurchase funds of listed companies, appropriately simplified implementation procedures, guided and improved governance arrangements, and encouraged all kinds of listed companies to implement equity incentives or employee shareholding plans.
After the introduction of opinions, listed companies carried out the operation of share repurchase, with more applicable circumstances, the repurchase process is simpler, and the enthusiasm for share repurchase is even greater.
Repurchasing shares in a relatively low position is also conducive to listed companies to improve the efficiency of the use of funds, thereby increasing the level of earnings per share, increasing the return on net assets, and reducing the pressure on the company's profit indicators.
Compared with the increase of large shareholders, listed companies have a greater significance of repurchasing shares, which also reflects the willingness of listed companies to actively manage their market value and abundant cash flow.
Xu Yang believes that the undervaluation of the stock price is the main factor of the repurchase of listed companies, the company's stock price has not been able to reflect the company's future development prospects, so this kind of company is worthy of the attention of investors, but can not blindly invest, need to pay attention to the financial reports of such listed companies and the specific business situation.
Listed companies with large-scale repurchase behavior at least show the company's development confidence and financial strength.
The enthusiasm for repurchases of A-share listed companies is gradually heating up, which also normalizes repurchase behavior, and the data shows that nearly 1,000 listed companies have implemented share repurchases this year, and leading companies in various industries have become the main force in the repurchase market.
China Ping An recently disclosed the progress of repurchase said that through centralized bidding transactions, the company has repurchased 57.59 million A shares, accounting for 0.315% of the company's total share capital, a total of 5 billion yuan (excluding transaction fees), the repurchase of shares will all be used for employee shareholding plans, including but not limited to the long-term service plans that have been reviewed and adopted by the company's shareholders meeting.
Yili shares have paid 5.792 billion yuan for share repurchase, and recently adjusted the purpose of repurchasing shares, from the original plan "repurchase shares will all be used as a source of later implementation of equity incentives" to "accumulative repurchase of 183 million shares, of which 152 million shares for the implementation of equity incentives of stock sources, the remaining 30.49 million shares will be used to cancel to reduce registered capital".
Yili said that the cancellation of some repurchased shares is conducive to further improving the level of earnings per share and effectively improving the return on investment of the company's shareholders.
TCL Group issued a repurchase progress announcement on September 25, showing that TCL Group has repurchased 3.59% of the company's shares at a total cost of 1.65 billion yuan.
TCL Group's board office told the "Securities Daily" reporter that the repurchase of shares will be used for employee stock ownership plans, equity incentives or corporate bonds that can be converted into stocks issued by listed companies.
TCL Group adheres to the established business strategy, continuously improves competitiveness and sustains healthy development.
Based on the confidence in the company's future development and the maintenance of investors' interests, combined with the performance of the company's shares in the secondary market over the past year, and taking into account factors such as the company's operation and financial situation, the company plans to use its own funds, self-financing and other financing methods to repurchase the company's shares.
Yang Delong, chief economist of Qianhai Open Source Fund, said that on the one hand, the operation of listed companies to buy back shares can reduce the number of shares circulating in the market, increase the earnings per share of listed companies, which is an important benefit to the stock price in the secondary market; in addition, listed companies are willing to take the initiative to pull out real gold and silver and repurchase shares from the stock market, which greatly boosts market confidence.
The repurchase of domestic listed companies has gradually increased in recent years, especially high-performing stocks, which is a very good way to boost investors' confidence through share repurchase, and it is also a practice worthy of recognition and encouragement.
Hunan Provincial Party Committee Standing Committee, Changsha Municipal Party Committee Secretary Hu Henghua and construction machinery manufacturing Xiangjun four leaders - Zhan Chunxin, Liang Zhengen, He Tsinghua, Liu Feixiang, around the "Changsha from construction machinery to intelligent manufacturing" set a "small goal" - three or five years to build the world's leading level of construction machinery industry cluster.
To build the world's leading engineering machinery industry cluster in Changsha, in today's trendy words, is to create the "strongest surface".
As an inland provincial capital city, Changsha shouts out this powerful words, where does it come from?
It depends on the power of domineering side leaks.
Participating in the dialogue of the four construction machinery Xiang enterprises, each of them, covering the sky, underground, the sea, the land of the whole field: Shanhe intelligent light aircraft, Zhongzhong's concrete conveying pump, Sany Heavy Industry's all-ground cranes, iron construction and heavy engineering tunnel shield machine, its "hard strength" can be described as the world's only, proud.
Once upon a time, China basically had no say in the field of construction machinery manufacturing.
Chinese enterprises "bring in" and "going out" two-wheel drive, taking advantage of the "Belt and Road" initiative, acquisitions, mergers, factories and other measures, jumped to become the global construction machinery industry leader.
Among them, Sany Heavy Industry, ZOMIC, Iron Construction Heavy Industry, Shanhe Intelligent and other construction machinery leading enterprises, its output value, market share, sales and other major economic indicators, has been significantly ahead of similar enterprises.
It’s driven by the moment when the camera is moving.
Construction machinery Xiangjun "four King Kong", is the leader of Changsha construction machinery industry cluster, but also the head of the global construction machinery industry enterprises.
In the world's industry, who lives and lives well is the hard way to speak.
In the early years, the global construction machinery industry suffered cold winter, many internationally renowned construction machinery manufacturing enterprises have fallen down, but Changsha's construction machinery manufacturing enterprises will be "cat winter" as "winter swimming", self-pressure, self-breaking, through the transformation of industrial structure, from manufacturing to intelligent transformation, not only survived the past, but also stronger bones.
It depends on the wisdom of the stars of the moon.
The development of advantageous industries requires not only enterprises to be proactive, but also the government's positive actions.
The reason why Changsha has the reputation of "the capital of construction machinery" is that it brings together the whole industrial chain from upstream to downstream, creates many related industrial clusters, and greatly reduces the cost of enterprise research and development, manufacturing and sales by optimizing the business environment, improving supporting services, and simplifying the approval process.
Good business ecology, so that construction machinery manufacturing enterprises come and go.
History has pushed Changsha to the foreground to build the leading level of global construction machinery.
Whether it is the government, or enterprises, and even the relevant industry, university and research enterprises and other links, should seize the opportunity, follow the trend, set goals, continue to work hard, and contribute to the construction and manufacturing of a strong country.
Wang Yi presided over a meeting of foreign ministers of China and African members of the Security Council.
Wang Yi expressed that China and African countries are good brothers and good partners.
Whether in the past, now or in the future, China stands firmly with its African brothers.
We advocate the holding of this foreign ministers' meeting as a concrete measure to implement the important consensus reached by President Xi Jinping and African leaders at the Beijing Summit of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation in September last year, in order to strengthen the solidarity and cooperation between China and African countries in the Security Council, and to promote the international community to better support Africa in achieving peace and development.
Wang Yi expressed that Africa is China's most important and trusted partner.
As a permanent member, China's vote in the Security Council has always belonged to the vast number of developing countries, including African countries.
In the face of the new situation, China is willing to work with African countries in the Security Council to strengthen unity and cooperation and safeguard common interests.
The two sides should rely on unity and strength, rely on consultation to resolve disputes, rely on self-reliance and self-improvement, and rely on development to rule fundamentally.
The foreign ministers of the participating African member states thanked China for its initiative to hold this meeting and congratulated New China on the 70th anniversary of its founding.
Africa-China relations are based on equality and mutual respect, and Africa and China have always been each other's most reliable and reliable partners.
The African side appreciates China's important and positive role in African affairs as a permanent member of the Security Council, which has effectively promoted a just and reasonable settlement of African issues and made great efforts and contributions to safeguarding Africa's interests and promoting Africa's peace and security.
At present, Africa is facing the threat of terrorism and extremism, and only by addressing security issues can Africa truly achieve long-term peaceful development.
We look forward to further coordinating positions with China in the Security Council and strengthening solidarity and cooperation.
Wang Yi expressed that today's meeting reached an important consensus.
We all support upholding multilateralism, strengthening the authority and role of the United Nations, upholding the purposes and principles of the UN Charter, and opposing unilateralism and bullying; we all agree to strengthen mutual support and cooperation between China and Africa in the affairs of the United Nations and the Security Council, and safeguard the common interests of China and Africa and the vast number of developing countries; we all support African countries to solve African problems in an African way and ask the United Nations to provide financial support for Africa's independent peace operations.
Gansu Qingyang: The lake sleeve comes to "get rid of poverty".
The autumn of September renders the Loess Plateau.
In the Yimin breeding professional co-operative, 58-year-old villager Shavili filled the grooves in the sheep fold with the last shovel grass, guarded at the edge of the trough, and watched the white lake sheep chewing.
â€œEat well, when the autumn and winter are full, you can sell for a good price.â€
Xavily said that he feeds the sheep with "special nutritious meals" every day, regularly cleaning, sterilization and disinfection, and carefully serves and does not dare to neglect.
Xavili raised sheep for more than 20 years, until he came to the co-operative to work, he knew how extensive sheep was in the past.
Xavili is a resident of Xia Yuchi Village, Qingcheng County, Qingyang City, Gansu Province.
His left and right neighbors are sheep farmers, but adhere to the traditional free-range approach, the quality of the sheep is poor, and the amount is small.
In June this year, under the guidance of the government, 140 poor people in the village joined the cooperative, and everything began to change.
Xavili spent the whole day studying farming, because his heart was always holding on.
The shareholders are all poor households, and they trust the sheep to the co-operatives, and whether they can pay dividends and sell prices at the end of the year, they can all count on him.
Fortunately, under the guidance of technicians, he slowly learned to engage in epidemic prevention, mastered scientific feeding, and became one of the few breeding "good styles" in the village.
Yimin breeding professional cooperative is a standardized cooperative, a total of 16 sheets, breeding nearly 1,400 lake sheep.
Zou Tao, the head of the cooperative, said that there are many doorways inside and out of the standardized shed.
â€œThe wool is thick, it is easy to breed bacteria, the lake sheep canâ€TMt stay in a sweltering and wet place, and the shed must be built in a three-sided ring trench, and it has to be equipped with a fan to ventilate and dissipate heat.â€
Zou Tao said that in order to prevent the epidemic, it is also necessary to regularly disinfect the sheep shed spray, giving the sheep three to four anti-epidemic injections in the first quarter.
In addition to living well, "little fat sheep" also have to eat grass mixed with silage corn, wheatgrass, alfalfa, etc., and have a wide enough "playground" to stretch the bones.
The cooperative adopts the method of trusteeship to guide local farmers to put good seed lake sheep here, unify breeding, management and sales, and achieve good breeding, scientificization, standardization and intensive farming.
At present, 140 poor households with sheep have a dividend of more than 6,000 yuan per household per year, and 4 poverty alleviation targets are working in cooperatives.
From â€œfull mountain grazingâ€ to â€œPrecise feedingâ€, from â€œlocal matingâ€ to â€œartificial inseminationâ€, from â€œlooking at the body type, touching the bellyâ€ to â€œdoing B superâ€... In Qingyang, Gansu, sheep farming is not only a change in the way of feeding, â€
Zou Tao said that if the market price is weak, the local leading enterprise Gansu Zhongsheng Agriculture and Animal Husbandry Development Co., Ltd. will be acquired with a market protection price of 27 yuan per kilogram to help farmers disperse market risks.
Xu Jianfeng, general adviser of Gansu Zhongsheng Agricultural and Animal Husbandry Development Co., Ltd., said that by providing loan guarantees for poor households, sheep supply, order farming, quotation acquisition, unified processing and sales and other services, enterprises have driven more and more poor households to read "sheep".
In Qingyang, at least 8,200 poor families have achieved stable income growth through forage breeding, good seed breeding, large-scale breeding, slaughter segmentation, and market sales.
Qingyang City is located in the northern agricultural and animal husbandry staggered belt, with abundant forage resources.
At present, there are 913 large-scale farms and cooperatives in the city, with more than 5 million muttons raised, and two processing production lines of 1.3 million muttons have been built, and the flock is becoming the "leader" of poverty alleviation in the local industry.
The French finance minister said he would cut taxes by more than 10 billion euros next year and called on Germany to follow up.
PARIS, Sept 26 (Reuters) - French Finance Minister Bruno Le Maire said on Thursday that France would cut taxes by more than 10 billion euros ($10.9 billion) next year, while Germany should keep pace with France’s fiscal stimulus to revive a sluggish economy.
Introducing France’s 2020 budget, Le Maire said the ECB’s latest monetary easing initiative has created an opportunity to increase investment for the governments of member countries that have the capacity to undertake.
The European Central Bank cut interest rates to record lows on Sept. 12 and plans to restart bond purchases to drive down borrowing costs, hoping to galvanize economic recovery and push up inflation.
â€œLow interest rates won't make Europe prosperous again, and monetary policy measures are necessary, but not enough,â€ Le Maire told reporters.
â€œGermany needs to invest, it needs it now, the sooner the better. Don't wait until the situation gets worse before you act,â€ he added.
He has made this appeal to Germany on several occasions.
France has already implemented tax cuts of more than 10 billion euros this year, a big boost to France’s economic growth.
While the global economy has lost momentum, the German economy, which is dependent on exports, is bearing the brunt.
Le Maire pointed out that the tax burden on French families will be reduced by 9.3 billion euros next year, including 5 billion euros in income tax relief.
In addition, with the gradual implementation of the corporate tax rate will be reduced from 33.3% to 25% during the five-year period, the corporate tax burden will be reduced by nearly 1 billion euros.
General Secretary Xi Jinping recently made important instructions for the protection of martyr memorial facilities, emphasizing that it is necessary to strengthen the planning, construction, repair and management and maintenance of Martyrs' cemeteries.
In order to thoroughly implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important instructions and strive to promote the protection and management of martyr memorial facilities, the General Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, the General Office of the State Council, and the General Office of the Central Military Commission recently issued the "Overall Work Plan for the Construction and Maintenance of Martyrs' Memorial Facilities."
The "work plan" is a programmatic document for the protection and management of martyr memorial facilities, clarifying the goals and tasks of the protection and management work of martyr memorial facilities, proposing to plan and build the martyrs memorial facilities, improve the red education base system for carrying forward the spirit of Yinglie; repair and protect the Martyrs' memorial facilities, and create a strong social atmosphere that honors and honors the martyrs and remembers the merits; manages and maintains the martyr memorial facilities, and forms a standardized and complete organizational security management system.
The "work plan" is clear, it is necessary to strengthen the repair and protection of martyr memorial facilities, in accordance with the principle of overall arrangement and long-term focus, effectively strengthen the repair and protection of martyr memorial facilities, focus on improving the leadership system mechanism, improve the policy and regulation system; organize the implementation of quality improvement and renovation projects, improve facilities and equipment, and strengthen service capabilities; optimize the exhibition content, innovate the display method, and improve the overall efficiency.
The "Work Plan" emphasizes that it is necessary to improve the institutional system and organizational guarantee, strengthen organizational leadership, establish a working mechanism led by the Ministry of Veterans Affairs, relevant units to take the initiative to cooperate, and widely participate in the society; focus on the implementation of the protection of heroes and martyrs, improve the system of laws and regulations, and continue to promote the institutionalization, standardization and professionalization of the planning and construction of martyr memorial facilities; strengthen team building, introduce volunteer services, and encourage veterans, martyr families, experts, scholars and young students to actively participate in the interpretation of martyr memorial facilities.
Study: U.S. National Healthy Eating Index Grows Slightly, but Remains Challenging
Recently, a new study in the United States shows that in the past 16 years, the U.S. government's healthy eating index has increased moderately, from 56 to 58.
But in the case of a full score of 100 points, it is not worth celebrating.
U.S. citizens still face “significant challenges” in their diets.
One of the study’s authors, Dr. Zhang Fangfang, a nutrition researcher at Tufts University in Massachusetts, said that Americans still consume too many foods that may cause diseases such as heart disease, diabetes, and obesity, which are the most common diseases in the United States.
The study was published in the Journal of the American Medical Association on the 24th.
The study is based on findings from the U.S. government’s health survey of 44,000 adults conducted between 1999 and 2016.
“Despite considerable improvements, significant dietary challenges remain,” the authors wrote.
These challenges include allowing U.S. nationals to reduce their intake of snacks, hot dogs, fat cows, butter and other foods that contain saturated fats.
The study found that people's intake of these unhealthy fats increased from 11.5% to 12% in their daily diet, exceeding the recommended upper limit of 10%.
The biggest improvement in the U.S. national diet is that the intake of sugar dropped from 16% to about 14%, but the intake is still too high.
According to officials, the intake of added sugars in the daily diet should be less than 10%.
For the reasons for the reduction of sugar intake, the researchers believe that it is related to the reduction in people's consumption of sweet sodas, but Zhang Fangfang stressed that sugars are often added to foods that are not even sweet, such as yogurt and ketchup.
U.S. adults experienced a small increase in intake of fruits, nuts, oats, and other whole grains.
However, data from 2016 shows that these foods still account for less than 5% of their daily diet.
Although people's intake of salt is slightly reduced, and the reduction in drinking juices leads to low-quality carbohydrate intake, Zhang said that they still account for up to 42% of daily calories, many of which come from refined white bread and other refined grains.
The study is based on personal health surveys every two years that remind adults of what they’ve eaten in the past 24 hours.
These health surveys have asked this question twice every few days since 2003.
Dietary guidelines issued by the government for U.S. residents recommend that people adopt a â€œhealthy eating modelâ€ in order to reduce the likelihood of developing chronic diseases.
According to the guidelines, people should consume more nutrient-dense foods such as vegetables, fruits, whole grains, low-fat dairy products, as well as seafood, lean meat, poultry meat, eggs, and seed foods that can provide protein.
During the survey period, the number of people living with diabetes in the U.S. population nearly doubled to more than 7 per cent, and the rate of obesity also increased over many years during the survey – about 70 percent of U.S. adults are now overweight or obese.
In addition, heart disease is still the leading cause of death among American citizens.
The European Union promotes a strategic partnership with Asia
Members of the Politburo of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of Vietnam, the Secretary of the Central Secretariat and the Minister of Economic Affairs of the Central Committee Nguyen Van Ping led the delegation to attend the forum.
Based on the close cooperation between the EU and partners in the Asia-Pacific region, the theme of the forum is "Transaction between the EU and Asia: building bridges for a sustainable future".
The forum was held one year after the implementation of the docking strategy on the two continents of the European Union.
Jean-Claude Juncker, President of the European Commission, said that strengthening the connection is part of the above-mentioned proposition, because it brings benefits to the peoples and economies concerned.
The above-mentioned relations have helped to bring stability and prosperity to all relevant parties.
At the same time, he believes that the EU wants to convey a message about increasing participation and consolidating the mutually beneficial relationship between Europe and Asia.
Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe is a special guest of the forum and will deliver an important speech at the plenary session.
The country's first joint-stock bank wealth management subsidiary was established with science and technology to enable asset management business
On the 26th, Everbright Bank's wholly-owned subsidiary Everbright Wealth Management Co., Ltd. was officially established in Qingdao, which is the first joint-stock bank wealth management subsidiary established in China.
Experts said that asset management is an important area for the development of financial technology, and the establishment of financial management subsidiaries by banks is conducive to the use of scientific and technological means to enhance the asset management business.
In April this year, Everbright Bank and China Merchants Bank respectively announced that they had been approved by the China Banking and Insurance Regulatory Commission to build financial subsidiaries.
On September 24, Everbright Bank announced that Everbright Financial Management had been officially allowed to open.
In just two days, Everbright Bank led many joint-stock banks and took the lead in establishing Everbright Wealth Management in Qingdao.
Li Xiaopeng, chairman of Everbright Group, said that Everbright Group will accelerate the pace of innovation, using modern scientific and technological thinking and means, relying on big data, the Internet of Things, and cloud computing to improve the coverage rate, utilization rate and penetration of financial capital, and improve the customer's sense of gain, happiness and security.
By 2021, we will establish and improve the â€œfour beams and eight pillarsâ€ of China's financial technology development, further enhance the scientific and technological application capabilities of the financial industry, realize the deep integration and coordinated development of finance and science and technology, and significantly enhance the people's satisfaction with digitized, networked and intelligent financial products and services.
Zhang Xuyang, chairman of Everbright Wealth Management, introduced that the asset management platform of Everbright Wealth Management will use intelligent investment, intelligent investment research, big data and other technologies to help Everbright's financial management to better judge the macroeconomic situation.
In the future, new technologies such as blockchain will also be applied to grasp the direction and trend from traditional assets to alternative assets to digital alternative assets.
Dong Ximing, special researcher of the National Finance and Development Laboratory, said that in the face of a new competition situation in the asset management industry, financial technology companies and asset management institutions will jointly explore new growth paths with asset management technology.
Financial technology enables the asset management industry, which is not only the need for the transformation and development of financial technology itself, but also injects new vitality and vitality into the development of asset management business.
At the beginning of this year, Jingdong Digital Technology launched a new asset management technology system to improve the product development and risk control capabilities of asset management with the help of technology and digital means.
The new system starts from the four major capabilities of product design, sales transactions, asset management and risk assessment to improve the overall intelligent operation level of the asset management industry.
Experts believe that asset management science and technology, while improving customer service capabilities and innovating and enriching products, can also enhance risk prevention capabilities and improve asset management management efficiency.
Zhang Xuyang said that in the past, it was easy to identify customers' risk preferences through questionnaires, but now the use of artificial intelligence for user portraits helps to better locate customers and launch corresponding products according to customer's investment preferences, which helps to resolve risks.
"E-commerce, space-time data and other alternative big data can help us better identify a region, an industry's activity, prosperity."
Zhang Xuyang said that while resolving risks, big data technology will also help improve risk control capabilities.
The deepest record of China's railway tunnel shaft has been refreshed
September 27 (Zhang Weiming Zhou Jingbo) after more than 1,200 days of day and night construction, in the construction of Da (Li) Rui (Li) Railway Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel No. 1 shaft completed excavation on the 27th, the well reached 762.59 meters below the ground, breaking the deepest record of China's railway tunnel shaft, and this record was created in the case of a large amount of water.
The 34.5-kilometer-long Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel is located in Yunnan, and the tunnel crosses the Gaoligongshan Mountains on the west coast of the Nu River, which is the longest single-hole tunnel on the two lines in Asia.
The tunnel passes through 19 fracture zones with a maximum depth of 1,155 meters, because it covers almost all the bad geology and major risks that may be encountered in the construction of the tunnel, and the Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel is known as the "geological museum" of tunnel construction.
The shaft is the most important auxiliary tunnel of the Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel, and the important task of increasing the working surface to achieve "long-tunnel short fight" and the ventilation of railway operations in the later period.
No. 1 shaft successfully excavated to the bottom of the well, marking Gaoligong mountain tunnel officially into the level of tunnel construction, waiting for the bottom of the well yard excavation and equipment replacement, underground can add 4 operating surfaces, speed up the tunnel excavation speed.
â€œThe shaft is all in the granite strata, because there are more cracks in the granite strata, can't stop the water, from the top to the bottom non-stop, basically how deep the water pressure of the well is how large.â€
Shi Jingzhao, chief engineer of the railway project department of China Railway Tunnel Bureau, told reporters that during the construction of the shaft, there have been many dangers such as sudden surging water and collapse, and the construction side has invited experts to take the pulse on the spot and conduct more than 20 research and treatment plans.
"When the maximum amount of water in the shaft, more than 300 cubic meters per hour, more than 700 meters deep at the bottom of the well, the water pressure is equivalent to 700 meters deep under the seabed."
"If you don't drain in time, you're going to flood the well 10 meters in an hour, we're going to spend almost 85 percent of our time on water and 15 per cent on digging."
In order to overcome the geological problems such as longitudinal development, sudden mud surge water, and granite, tunnel construction adopts systematic water management measures combined with "exploration, injection and excavation" to reduce construction risks.
After many improvements, the No. 1 shaft construction has formed mechanized assembly lines such as excavating systems, lifting systems, suspension systems, and winch lifting systems, which have realized full-process mechanization operations such as eye-catching, blasting, chopping, template installation, and concrete pouring, speeding up the construction progress.
In the end, after more than 1,200 days of day and night construction, the shaft successfully completed the excavation of 762.59 meters.
With a total length of 330 kilometers, the Darui Railway is an important part of the China-Myanmar international channel and an important transportation infrastructure for the implementation of the "Belt and Road" construction.
After the completion of the opening of traffic, the driving time from Dali to Ruili will be shortened from 6 hours on the current highway to 2 hours, which will greatly improve the transportation pattern in the Dianxi region and promote economic and trade cooperation and personnel-friendly exchanges between China and Southeast Asian countries.
Lin Zhengyue: As a Chinese people, she is proud of his country's achievements.
The Hong Kong press celebrates its 70th anniversary.
“The Hong Kong Press Celebrates the 70th Anniversary of the Founding of the People’s Republic of China” was held in Hong Kong on the 27th
The Chief Executive of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, Carrie Lam, said in her speech at the reception that the country's achievements in the past 70 years are obvious to the world, and we, as Chinese people, are proud.
Carrie Lam, Deputy Director of the Liaison Office of the Central Government in Hong Kong, Lu Xining, Deputy Commissioner of the Hong Kong Special Commission of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs Song Ru'an, Deputy Political Commissar of the People's Liberation Army in Hong Kong, Chen Yading, Chairman of the Executive Committee of the Hong Kong Press Celebrating the National Day Preparatory Committee Jiang Zhezhong attended the reception and served as the main guests.
In her speech, Carrie Lam pointed out that in the past 70 years, China has worked hard, although it has faced many difficulties and challenges, but they have overcome and surpassed them one by one, and the achievements of the world are obvious to all, and we as Chinese people are proud.
After Hong Kong's return to the motherland, it has been closely linked with the mainland, working together to make progress and share fruitful results.
It is believed that under the premise of "one country, two systems", Hong Kong can continue to play its advantages in the future, grasp the opportunities of the "Belt and Road" and the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area, and seek a better future for Hong Kong.
She also said that in the past few months, Hong Kong's social controversies have continued, and everyone in Hong Kong has been affected, and journalists have faced different challenges.
At this critical moment, we hope that friends in the press will continue to meet the difficulties, uphold professionalism, make fair and balanced news reports for the society, and do their part for Hong Kong's future to return to rational communication and dialogue.
In his speech, Jiang pointed out that the glorious history of New China is also the course of Hong Kong's development with the motherland, common progress, blood ties, honor and humiliation.
In particular, since Hong Kong's return to the motherland, the central government has unswervingly implemented the principles of "one country, two systems", "Hong Kong people rule Hong Kong" and a high degree of autonomy. Hong Kong and the mainland have worked together to help each other and jointly create a miracle of mutual benefit and win-win results and economic take-off.
To this end, the Hong Kong press gathered together to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
He said that in the past three months, there have been a series of violent activities in Hong Kong that have blatantly violated laws and undermined social stability, and some media have published distorted and false reports, which have played a role in promoting violent activities.
He called on the media to stir up the clear and create a good atmosphere for the whole people to resist violence and uphold the rule of law.
Professional media people should abide by the professional norms of journalism, use real reports and responsible speech to guide the public to consciously and violence, and safeguard the fairness and majesty of the law.
About 500 people from all walks of life such as the Hong Kong press attended the reception and raised a toast together with the main guests to send blessings for the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
The reporter learned from the Propaganda Department of the Xining Municipal Party Committee that Xining City will implement the "Regulations on the Promotion of civilized behavior in Xining City" on October 1, focusing on 15 kinds of uncivilized behaviors such as pedestrians who do not follow the traffic lights to indicate traffic lights and throw objects from the building to the outside, make a list of key governance, and set up corresponding punishments.
Wang Shengbin, vice minister of Propaganda of Xining Municipal Party Committee and director of the Municipal Civilization Office, introduced that since Xining City won the title of national civilized city in 2017, the level of civic civilization literacy and morality have been significantly improved.
However, uncivilized behaviors such as pedestrians crossing the road, running red lights, and non-motor vehicles do not follow the traffic lights; high-altitude parabolic objects and car window parabolic objects; smoking in public places, walking dogs in public places, and allowing uncivilized behaviors such as urination to the ground are still very prominent, and it is easy to rebound and needs to be solved as soon as possible.
Combined with Xining's reality, from public places, public order, public facilities, public environmental sanitation, civilized travel, civilized tourism, civilized Internet access, the construction of civilized campuses, the promotion of civilized family construction, the implementation of official duties, the commemoration of heroes and martyrs, medical services and other aspects, the civilized code of conduct for individuals and units put forward more comprehensive and high-standard requirements, so that the whole society can understand "what can be done", "advocate what" and "prohibited what".
"The introduction of regulations to eliminate blind spots and misunderstandings in the field of civilized behavior cognition, and comprehensive norms on citizens' behavior, home ownership, dining, travel, education, tourism, Internet access, green life, marriage and funeral sacrificial sweep, etc., which will provide a strong guarantee of the rule of law for the creation of mass spiritual civilization in Xining City."
Xining Municipal People's Congress Standing Committee of the Secretary-General Qiu Weijun said.
Tonight, Beijing Metro Line 1, Line 2 and Line 7 will be delayed in operation - Sino-Singapore Network
Beijing News (Reporter Pei Jianfei) Today (September 27) afternoon, the Beijing Metro Company issued a notice that from September 27 to October 7th, Line 1, Line 2 and Line 7 will be adjusted to extend the operation date of the last bus.
During the delay period, the operation time of Metro Line 1 and 2 will continue until the early morning of the next day, with an average of 10 minutes.
Line 1 west to the east to extend the operating time of 61 minutes, east to west to extend the operation time of 64 minutes, along the station's last train departure time is after 00:30 the next day; Line 2 inner ring extended operation of 81 minutes, the outer ring extended the operation of 95 minutes, along the station of the last train departure time are after the next day 0:20, the front door station the next day 00:50 to open the last train.
The departure time of the last train of the Beijing West Station (in the direction of the coking plant station) was extended from 23:15 to 00:15 the next day, and the departure time of the last train of the coking factory station (in the direction of Beijing West Railway Station) was extended from 22:25 to 23:25.
British tourist's car keys fall into the lake, and the whole family is trapped in France for five days
Recently, a couple in Wales, England, took their two children on vacation in France, and accidentally dropped the car key into the lake, and the whole family was forced to wait five days to get the new keys formulated by the car manufacturer.
The couple then left France with their children.
According to reports, on September 16, local time, when the British family visited a lake in France, her daughter accidentally knocked over a leather bag, and the car keys inside fell into the lake.
But it took a few hours and they couldn’t find the key.
All of their belongings and cash were locked in their cars.
Although British tourists bought insurance before departure, insurers refused to help on the grounds that the vehicle was not in danger of being stolen.
They had to hire a trailer to pull the car to a repair shop and re-order the keys from the automaker.
A few days later, British tourists finally got the key, and the couple left France with their children.
Their planned journey was cancelled due to the loss of the car keys.
Saudi Arabia Officially Opens Tourist Visas to 49 Countries, including China
From now on, Saudi Arabia has officially opened tourist visas to 49 countries, including China, with a total visa fee of 440 Saudi riyals (about 836 yuan).
Tourists are required to prepare a copy of health insurance covering Saudi Arabia, as well as providing an address within Saudi Arabia.
Tourists can apply for visa-on-arrival at the airport after landing, or apply for an e-signature via visa.visitsaudi.com.
Among them, the electronic signature is a multiple entry for one year, and tourists can be allowed to stay for up to 90 days.
For ordinary tourists, Saudi Arabia is the most mysterious country, because this country never issues tourist visas.
In recent years, Saudi Arabia, under the leadership of Deputy Crown Prince Muhammad bin Salman, has promoted the Vision 2030 plan, which aims to reduce the country’s long-term dependence on oil, and the opening up of tourism and the development of tourism are an important part.
The Deputy Prime Minister of Belarus, Igor Lyashenko, paid a working visit to Hing An Province of Vietnam.
During the meeting, Xing'an Provincial Party Secretary Du Jinshi highlighted the remarkable achievements of Belarus in industrial production and the investment of Belarusian enterprises in Xing'an Province.
The completion of MAZ ASIA's automobile production and installation plant is an important development step in the cooperation between enterprises of the two countries, which will help promote the cooperative relations between Xing'an Province and even between Vietnam and Belarus.
Secretary of Xing'an Provincial Party Committee Du Jinshi said that Xing'an Province has always created convenient conditions for Belarusian enterprises investing in the province, and hoped that Belarus will take more effective measures in the future to encourage Belarusian enterprises to invest in Xing'an Province and Vietnam, and to assist in the training and transfer of industrial production technology for workers in the province.
Deputy Prime Minister Igor Lyashenko expressed his gratitude to the province for its recent facilitation of production and business activities for Belarusian enterprises.
It is hoped that the province will continue to provide convenient conditions for Belarusian enterprises.
At the end of the meeting, Deputy Prime Minister Igor Liyashenko attended the completion ceremony of MAZ ASIA's automobile production and installation plant.
In the field of low-risk food production permits and other areas to inform the commitment system, the representative office of foreign enterprises to decentralization to the free trade zone
On the 27th, the Shanghai Municipal Market Supervision Bureau signed a working memorandum with the government of Pudong New Area, introducing 20 market supervision reform measures, some of which are the first pilots in the country.
According to reports, the notification commitment refers to when the administrative organ handles the relevant licensing registration matters, the conditions and requirements stipulated in the laws and regulations are notified to the applicant in writing.
After the applicant has signed the commitment, the administrative organ can deal with it directly.
According to the memorandum, the Shanghai market supervision department will support the Pudong New Area and the Shanghai Pilot Free Trade Zone to register the enterprise name, handle the pilot notification commitment system in three areas such as simple technology and low-risk food production licenses, and the type approval of some measuring instruments, so as to make the access of enterprises more convenient.
On the 27th, Shanghai Shao Wansheng Food Co., Ltd. obtained the "food production license" on the spot by informing the commitment, and became the first enterprise to enjoy the pilot dividend.
The person in charge of the enterprise said that the food license can also be certified on the spot, but also adopted the "receipt" approach, that is, to allow the enterprise in accordance with the deadline agreed to inform the commitment to submit part of the materials, "really feel the convenience of reform."
The Shanghai market supervision department said that the implementation of the notification commitment system for food production licenses is the first pilot in the country.
After the reform, the approval link was compressed from the previous "registration, acceptance, on-site verification, sample inspection, material review, approval and certification" 6 links to "registration, acceptance, approval and certification", and the completion time was shortened from 20 working days before the reform to on-the-spot.
Taking into account the characteristics of Pudong's high degree of economic extroversion, the Shanghai market supervision department delegated the registration authority of the permanent representative offices of foreign (regional) enterprises to the Shanghai Free Trade Zone, so as to make it easier for enterprises to handle it nearby.
According to the statistics, the decentralization involves a total of 1,592 permanent representative offices in the Shanghai Free Trade Zone, of which 99 have been handled in accordance with the new regulations.
"Eleven" long holiday consumption small survey: the choice of more diversified tourism occupies the first place.
The National Day holiday is approaching, and people's holiday plans are gradually finalized.
"Securities Daily" reporter recently launched a small survey in the circle of friends for the "eleven" holiday arrangements, received nearly 20 pieces of feedback shows that although everyone's plans are different, but "tourism + consumption" has become the key words of the "eleven" holiday.
Specifically, in the feedback obtained by the "Securities Daily" reporter, more than half of them chose tourism.
Mr. Liu, who lives in Tianjin, said, â€œDuring the â€œElevenâ€ period, he plans to take his family to play in Shanghai, Disney is the first stop, and then go to the surrounding cities to turn around); Ms. Li's family in Beijing chooses to travel to Taiwan in China, "a family of three departs on September 28 and plans a ten-day trip around the island"; Miss Ma of Chongqing plans an outbound trip, the destination is Singapore.
The "2019 National Day Golden Week Resident Travel and Travel Trend Report" jointly released by Yilong and the same tour recently shows that this year's National Day Golden Week's travel and travel in three subdivision areas of consumption upgrading trend is obvious.
The penetration rate of aircraft and high-speed rail travel has steadily increased, and the proportion of star hotels and personalized non-standard accommodation demand has increased.
On September 23, the "2019 National Day Tourism Consumption Trend Report" released by Meituan Group showed that tourism consumption continued to be strong, and showed a diversified and upgraded trend of "eating, living and playing".
More young people travel favoring high-quality and distinctive experiences, and the popularity of cultural tourism and night tourism continues to rise.
In addition to tourism, all kinds of consumer demand have also been released during the "Eleven" period.
Mr. Wang, who lives in Chengdu, told the "Securities Daily" reporter, "This year's '11' main plan is to buy a car."
The staff of a 4S store of an automobile brand in Beijing told the "Securities Daily" reporter that in general, September and October of each year are known as the golden period of automobile sales.
There will be many activities in the store during the "eleven" period, such as raffles, to the store to reduce and so on.
In addition, many brands have recently launched new models, and it is expected that the boost effect of new products on sales will be more obvious.
Under the trend of consumption upgrading, people pay more attention to meeting the needs at the spiritual level, and the proportion of service consumption such as culture and education continues to increase.
"Since the birth of the child, culture and education consumption have become the majority of household consumption.
This year's "11" is full, to go to the "play card" planetarium, children's theater, about a few families went to the elk museum over the weekend to set up tent camping, but also arranged a number of audition and experience classes.
Some insiders said that in theory, the evolution path of residents' consumption upgrading is the evolution from survival-oriented consumption to development-oriented consumption and enjoyment-oriented consumption, of which a considerable part of enjoyment consumption is the category of service consumption.
With the continuous development of China's economy and society and the rising income level of residents, people pay more and more attention to the spiritual level of consumer demand, tourism, travel is a very good way.
In particular, catching up with the "11th" National Day holiday, the time is more abundant, and people are more willing to travel and consume, which can not only meet the consumption needs of the spiritual level, but also the embodiment of the upgrading of residents' consumption.
In the afternoon, it began to be lonely, and did not want to go out, and did not adjust the state where the children were not around.
Let's start with the spirit and say to the dog Nana: "My mother took you out of the house."
Write down a few things to go out to do, the character characteristics of type A blood are getting stronger and stronger, and they all feel very awkward.
Take suits, buy nutrients, pay, buy sashimi, Nana's small snacks.
That’s the reason for going out.
On the phone, I had just paid a great loss to my sister's love, or even the excuse to buy small snacks was gone.
He smiled a few times, saying that the child came to the phone and hung up.
Nana jumped on the assistant's seat on the familiar road, lying down honestly, she knew that she was smoozy, scared and uneasy, and was not willing to accompany me.
My husband, Boo, came back early.
She even praised the salard salad of the sad berries, and then went to the bedroom to lie in the bed to watch TV.
Looking at the blades on the wall, it was just 7 o'clock, and the sunset of the sunrise country was early, and it was already dark.
The circle of friends is inventing the moon, it turns out that today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.
Wash a string of grapes sent by friends, leave half for Boao, and the rest are placed in small flower bowls, and go out to look at the moon.
Sitting with Nana on the ground, I ate the grapes, and she ate the skins, and I vomited the seeds of the grapes far away.
The moon is hiding in the clouds, so that when the clouds are walking, the moon suddenly reappears, and there is some dazzling darkness.
There are a variety of poems in the mind about the next month, but I only clearly like this sentence: every three or five days reunion / full of jade fences / a round in the sky to hold out / people look up.
Perhaps we have given too many emotions to the moon, for now I come, in fact, that God's return to God, Caesar's return to Caesar is the best.
The moon returns to the moon, and the emotions belong to yourself.
After eating the grapes, this group of cold moon shackles.
Nana had a slight snoring at his feet, got up, and laid Nana's little blanket on the edge of her little house, on which Nana lay cheerfully.
Open the door and shout: Is the bath water boiling?
From the window of the bathroom, you can't see the moon, you can only feel the moon color, turn off the lights in the bathroom and pull off the glass.
I didn’t eat mooncakes, I didn’t drink.
Expo 2020 in Dubai has released its mascot.
The release ceremony of the mascot of Expo 2020 Dubai was held in Dubai, United Arab Emirates on the 26th.
The mascot consists of six cartoon images, including two Emirati children, three flying robots, and an Emirati tree.
The press conference introduced the information of six mascots to the audience by playing a short video.
The nine-year-old Rashid and 8-year-old girl Ratifa are brothers and sisters, representing the people of the United Arab Emirates.
Three robots correspond to the three sub-themes of this Expo, the blue robot represents "liquidity", the green robot represents "sustainability", and the yellow robot represents "opportunity".
An old herding bean tree is named "Salama" and is the "old grandmother" of the five "little guys", which symbolizes the ancestors who guard this land.
Ahmed, chairman of the Dubai World's Fair's High Commission, said the mascot can strengthen the emotional connection between large-scale events and participants. â€œIt is believed that the mascot of Expo Dubai will convey the traditional spirit of telling the story, show the creativity of local talents, and express our ambitions and expectations.â€
The launch ceremony was attended by the Vice President and Prime Minister of the United Arab Emirates, Sheikh Mohammed of Dubai, Crown Prince Hamdan of Dubai, the Minister of State for International Cooperation of the United Arab Emirates, and the Director of the Dubai World Expo Bureau, Lime Hashemi, attended the launch ceremony.
The Dubai Expo will be held in Dubai from October 20, 2020 to April 10, 2021, with the theme “Communicating Ideas, Creating the Future”.
This will be the first time the Expo will be held in the Middle East.
Starting next year, Chinese students can apply for German undergraduates with college entrance examination results.
Recently, Germany is responsible for the evaluation and certification of foreign academic qualifications Anabin database announced on the official website: starting in 2020, China's high school graduates can directly apply for German university with college entrance examination results, and do not need to enroll in domestic universities first.
Prior to this, Chinese high school graduates who wanted to apply to German universities needed to study for one semester (211,985 universities) or three semesters (general undergraduates), and passed the APS review or TestAS exam.
The release of the new regulations may save at least six months for Chinese students who are willing to study in Germany.
It is reported that the new regulations will come into force in the second half of 2019.
Applicants need to: complete 12 years of regular compulsory education, obtain a high school diploma; participate in the college entrance examination, college entrance examination, and college entrance examination score of 70% or more (if the total score of 750 points, you need to reach more than 525 points), and including two language results and one mathematics or natural science performance and other requirements.
In addition, the requirements of specific professions for college entrance examination results are not the same.
For example, to apply for medicine, oral medicine, veterinary medicine, pharmacy and other majors, college entrance examination scores need to reach a full score of 80%, and college entrance examination subjects must include mathematics, physics, chemistry, biology in at least two, or to participate in integration; to apply for legal majors, college entrance examination scores need to reach a full score of 80%, and college entrance examination subjects must include foreign languages, history, at least two in geography, or to participate.
According to incomplete statistics, many countries, including Germany, the United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, etc., have recognized China's college entrance examination results.
Taking the United Kingdom as an example, universities such as the University of Cambridge, the University of Birmingham and the University of Leicester have all accepted Chinese students to apply to study with college entrance examination results.
The military "robot dog" went to the performance class of the Cirque du Soleil: consider being included in the performance line-up.
The U.S. U.S. military funded the research and development for the battlefield of the "robot dog", now may be on the circus stage!
Cirque du Soleil recently said that it is working with Boston Dynamics, which is developing robots, to discuss the feasibility of applying robots to circus performances.
According to foreign media reports, Boston Power Technology announced on the 24th "four-legged robot Spot" promotional video, the content shows that Spot is an agile mobile robot, which can bear 14 kilograms, and has the maneuverability, 360-degree obstacle avoidance function, navigation, remote control and autonomy that is highly adapted to off-road terrain.
In particular, Spot has a proprietary software platform developed only specifically for Spot, and users can set up Spot robot functions on their own through various applications.
Boston Dynamics first announced the idea of robotic dogs in 1992, which caused a stir, but it still hasn't really been put into commercial use yet.
However, Boston Power Technology pointed out that at present, Spot has entered the mass production stage, and most of the orderers are based on construction and energy companies.
In addition, Cirque du Soleil is currently in contact with Boston Dynamics Technology, and Cirque du Soleil said that this project is still in the conceptual stage and is evaluating the potential of Spot's use in the performance scene.
The Information Office of the State Council released the white paper "China and the World in the New Era"
On the occasion of the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, the Information Office of the State Council issued a white paper on "China and the World
Xu Lin, vice minister of the Central Propaganda Department and director of the Information Office of the State Council, said that the white paper systematically introduced China's development achievements, development path and development trends around the issues such as "where China comes from and where it goes", "what kind of world China is promoting", and "developing China's development achievements, development path, and development trends", so as to enhance the international community's understanding and understanding of China's development.
In the past 70 years, under the leadership of the Communist Party of China, China has undergone tremendous changes, creating an unprecedented development miracle in human history, especially since the 18th National Congress of the Communist Party of China, China's development has made historic achievements and undergone historic changes.
Through a large amount of data and facts, the white paper introduces the great achievements, major significance and world contributions of China's development in the past 70 years.
The white paper pointed out that China has completed the development of developed countries for hundreds of years in several decades, ranking second in the world in terms of total economy, and nearly 1.4 billion people have got rid of material shortages, generally reached the level of moderate prosperity, and enjoyed unprecedented dignity and rights.
In the past 70 years, the Chinese people have started from scratch, self-reliance, and worked hard to create a new world; in the past 70 years, China has developed in the interaction with the world, embraced the world, studied the world and contributed to the world; in the past 70 years, while achieving self-development, China has contributed to world peace and injected impetus into the common development of all countries.
In the past 70 years, China's development has been successful, and the fundamental reason is that under the leadership of the Communist Party of China, the Chinese people have found the correct development path of socialism with Chinese characteristics and continued unswervingly along this path.
The white paper emphasizes that the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics is a path established from the perspective of its own national conditions, a road that puts the interests of the people first, a path of reform and innovation, a path of seeking common development in opening up, and a road based on the rule of law in an all-round way.
China's development path, in line with China's national conditions, to adapt to the requirements of the times, will be more and more with the times to show more and more bright development prospects.
In response to the international community's concerns about China's development, the white paper emphasizes that realizing the prosperity and strength of the country, the revitalization of the nation and the happiness of the people is not only the dream of the Chinese people, but also the common dream of the people of all
The white paper pointed out that China is the world's main stabilizer and power source of economic growth, all-round opening up creates more opportunities for the development of all countries, China provides more public goods for the international community, China's development provides experience and reference for other developing countries, and China will never take the path of "national hegemony".
Faced with the question of "what happened to the world and what will happen to mankind", the white paper pointed out that today's world is undergoing a great change that has not occurred in a hundred years, and human society is both full of hope and full of challenges.
China proposes to build a community with a shared future for mankind, open up a new path of win-win cooperation and shared development, and provide new options for human development.
The white paper calls on all countries to unite, build a new type of international relations, promote a new type of economic globalization, safeguard the international system with the United Nations as the core, promote exchanges and mutual learning among civilizations, jointly promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind, and build a better world.
With China's increasing development, the international community is generally concerned about how China can get along with the world.
The white paper pointed out that China's development is inseparable from the world, and the peaceful development, prosperity and stability of the world cannot be separated from China.
China has always put its own development in the coordinate system of human development, adhered to win-win cooperation and common development, adhered to the maintenance and promotion of economic globalization, actively developed global partnerships, firmly supported multilateralism, safeguarded international fairness and justice, promoted the high-quality development of the "Belt and Road", actively participated in leading the reform and construction of the global governance system, and was always a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development, and a defender of the international order.
At present, China's development has entered a new era.
The white paper pointed out that in China in the new era, the determination to take the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics will not change, the determination to learn from each other and win-win cooperation with other countries will not change, and the determination to walk hand in hand with the world will not change.
At the end of the white paper, it is pointed out that in today's world, the future and destiny of all countries have never been more closely linked.
"China and the world in the new era" white paper, composed of forewords, text and closing words, the full text of more than 29,000 words.
The white paper was published in eight languages such as China, England, France, Russia, Germany, West, Afghanistan and Japan, and was published by the People's Publishing House and the Foreign Language Press respectively, and was distributed in Xinhua bookstores across the country.
Is the MCA going to the by-elections for the National Assembly seat in Tanjung Biai, Johor Oblast?
MCA President Datuk Seri Wei Jiaxiang: "Consideration of the Supreme Council of the BN!"
Tanjong Biai's by-election is imminent, and whether the MCA of the Barisan Nasional's member party is playing against this traditional seat is of great concern.
However, after the meeting of the MAC Central Committee, it was announced that it would be handed over to the Supreme Council of the Barisan Nasional to decide whether the MCA traditional seat would continue to be handed over to the MCA or replaced by other members of the party.
Wei Jiaxiang told the media after chairing the meeting of the MCA Central Committee on Thursday afternoon that any by-selection will be carried out in accordance with the standard operating procedures (SOP), i.e. it will need to pass the meeting of the Supreme Council of the Barisan Nasional before it can be finalized.
He said that since the election commission will not meet until next Monday to finalize the by-selection for Tanjung Biai, the meeting of the BN Supreme Council is expected to take place in early October.
"Yesterday (26th) morning, I also met BN Chairman Datuk Seri Ahmad Zahid, and we all agreed that this seat must be regained from Pakatan Harapan."
"We finalized a meeting of BN leaders in early October, and the leaders of the Barisan Nasional three parties will determine which member party will play."
Asked whether MCA would adhere to this traditional seat to the BN Supreme Council, Wei Jiaxiang reiterated that he, as MCA's president, must act in accordance with standard operating procedures, so any decisions must be agreed upon.
â€œIn any by-election, there are political parties, there are some parties who think they should come out, which is a common thing.â€
“What’s most important is what kind of organization and political union do we come from?”
"This is a big test for our formation of political alliances for many years, and we believe that Barisan Nasional has come all the way with some valuable values."
"In the process, maybe someone will say something, it's not surprising."
"However, once the BN Supreme Council has made a decision, everyone must make every effort to prepare for the war, which is the most valuable."
In any case, Wei Jiaxiang said that MCA will make all-out efforts to prepare for the upcoming Tanjong Biai by-election on three levels, that is, the district meeting, the state committee and the central government.
"The district will be led by Datuk Seri Huang, chairman of the (Tanjung Biai) District Council; the State Board will be led by Datuk Lin Peixing, Chairman of the Joint Committee of the Johor State Board; and the Central Committee will be personally deployed by Datuk Mahanshun, Chief of Administration, and Datuk Shengwen, General Secretary."
On Saturday (21st), Datuk Mohd Fari, a member of parliament for the Indigenous Solidarity Party, died at the age of 42 at the government hospital due to a heart problem.
A villager in Baokang County, Hubei Province, was ordered to hunt wild animals.
A villager in Baokang County, Hubei Province, was sentenced for hunting wild animals, and ordered him to compensate 15,420 yuan (RMB, the same below) for the restoration of environmental damage caused by ecological resources.
Due to the poverty of the defendant's family, the procuratorial organs used alternative labor to compensate for the cost of ecological restoration, and realized the organic unity of legal and social effects.
Wang Zhongliang, deputy attorney general of Baokang County Procuratorate, introduced on the 27th that through three months of alternative labor such as "compulsory mountain patrol", the defendant Zhou has established deep feelings with wild macaques, and is deeply responsible for previous animal hunting behavior.
On June 21 this year, a case filed by the Baokang County Procuratorate filed a criminal incidental civil public interest lawsuit in the field of ecological resources, which was heard in the county court and pronounced in court.
Defendant Zhou was sentenced to 3 years in prison, suspended for 4 years, and fined 3,000 yuan, while ordering him to compensate 15,420 yuan for ecological resource environmental damage repair costs.
After investigation, since the end of January 2014, Zhou has set up a power grid on the cliffs, hunting more than 20 wild animals, including antelopes, Xiaolin, hairy deer and so on.
It belongs to the national second-class endangered wild protection animals, and the small and hairy deer are listed in the "National Terrestrial Wildlife Protection List".
During the trial, Zhou confessed to his illegal facts and behavior, and was willing to bear incidental civil liability.
However, taking into account the poor economic situation of Zhou's family, under the coordination of the Baokang County Procuratorate, the local village committee, forest station and Zhou reached an agreement to compensate for ecological restoration costs of alternative labor: that is, Zhou Mou provided public welfare services to compensate for ecological restoration costs by carrying out macoon domestication care work, compulsory mountain patrol and forest protection for one year in the village macao monkey protection area, and providing public services to offset the cost of ecological restoration.
As for the prosecutor's proposal, the court expressed its approval, agreeing to Zhou's execution of the probation while actively fulfilling the obligation of "alternative labor to compensate for ecological restoration costs."
At present, Zhou has been working in the macaque reserve for 3 months, patrolling the mountains positively and performing well.
In recent years, Baokang County Procuratorate has organically integrated procuratorial functions and social governance practices in practice, scientifically used supervision methods such as procuratorial recommendations, investigation supervision, and litigation supervision to minimize the damage caused to the ecological environment caused by criminal acts through judicial means.
The United Nations awarded the "Defender of the Earth Award" for "Ant Forest"
In the warm applause and magnificent music, "Ant Forest" project leader Xu and user representative Shen Junliang went to the podium, from the hands of the host to receive the trophy of the 2019 United Nations "Defender of the Earth Award".
The 2019 "Defender of the Earth Award" award ceremony was held in New York on the 26th in the United States, and the "Ant Forest" project with a small mobile phone program to promote hundreds of millions of people to participate in environmental protection activities won the "Incentive and Action Award" award.
A week ago, the United Nations Environment Programme announced the winners at its headquarters in Nairobi, the capital of Kenya, but those who participated in the awards ceremony on the same day are still excited.
The Executive Director of the United Nations Environment Programme (UNEP), Ying Er Anoseng, said in an interview with Xinhua that "Ant Forest" is an exciting innovation, allowing hundreds of millions of people to take action to understand the environmental challenges facing humanity and what humans can do for the environment.
It uses technology to connect people and the environment, so that each individual can participate in the protection of the earth, which will have a huge impact.
"Ant Forest" was launched by China Ant Financial Services Group (referred to as Ant Financial Service) in August 2016 on the Alipay platform, users in the "ant forest" to record their daily life of green travel, online payment of utilities and other low-carbon actions to accumulate "green energy", in the mobile phone "planting trees".
Every time a user develops a virtual tree, the "ant forest" and public welfare partners will plant a real tree in the desertification area.
As of August this year, 500 million "ant forest" users have reduced carbon emissions by 7.92 million tons and planted 122 million trees in desertification areas.
In the "Defender of the Earth Award" awarded on the same day, Costa Rica was awarded the national environmental efforts, Costa Rican President Carlos Alvarado, who came to receive the award, praised the contribution of "Ant Forest" at the scene, "can inspire so many people to participate in green action, is impressive".
Jing Xiandong, chairman and chief executive officer of Ant Financial, said that the "Defender of the Earth Award" is an affirmation of the "Ant Forest" project.
Technology and open platforms make it possible for everyone to participate in a low-carbon life, and this honor belongs to all participants.
In the past three years, the "ant forest" has affected 500 million people, and the goal of "ant forest" in the next three years is to drive 1 billion people around the world to participate in low-carbon actions.
While combating desertification and protecting the environment, they are also exploring how to make farmers' income more derived from green mountains and waters.
In addition to providing employment opportunities by planting trees, it is also hoped to help farmers increase their income through agricultural product development projects and e-commerce platforms.
The public welfare and environmental protection model created by "Ant Forest" based on digital technology has also successfully gone to sea and has been referenced by other countries.
In June of this year, GCash, the largest "e-wallet" in the Philippines, launched the Philippine version of "Ant Forest" to encourage Filipino users to better protect the environment through low-carbon life.
According to reports, GCash will join hands with the Philippine Ministry of Environment and Natural Resources, environmental public welfare organizations, and plans to plant 365,000 trees in the Philippines within one year of the launch of the project.
The “Defender of the Earth Award” is the highest award in the field of environmental protection of the United Nations and is awarded once a year.
"Ant Forest" won the award, after China's Saihanba forest farm builder, China's Zhejiang Province "Thousand Village Demonstration, Wancun Remediation" project, China's green innovation projects from China for the third consecutive year won the "Incentive and Action Award" award.
The economic and trade frictions have affected the "report card" of the US economy.
In the second quarter of this year, the U.S. economic "report card" showed that due to the sharp decline in private sector investment and exports, the growth rate of U.S. gross domestic product (GDP) slowed significantly compared with the previous quarter.
Analysts pointed out that economic and trade frictions and the resulting uncertainty are the main reasons for the decline in private sector investment and exports in the second quarter.
According to the final revised data released by the US Department of Commerce on the 26th, US GDP increased by 2% year-on-year in the second quarter, which is the same as the previously released revised data, but significantly lower than 3.1% in the first quarter.
According to the data, consumption growth has become the main factor supporting the economic growth of the United States in the second quarter.
The personal consumption expenditure, which accounts for about 70% of the total of the U.S. economy, increased by 4.6% quarter-on-quarter, driving economic growth by 3.03 percentage points.
In addition, government consumption expenditure and investment boosted economic growth by 0.82 percentage points.
However, in the second quarter, private sector investment fell by 6.3% compared with the previous quarter, dragging down economic growth by 1.16 percentage points in the quarter; exports fell by 5.7% from the previous quarter, and net exports dragged down economic growth of 0.68 percentage points in the quarter.
Barry Knapp, managing partner of Ainside macroeconomic consulting company in the United States, said that private sector investment not only failed to maintain last year's growth momentum, but fell sharply, due to rising economic and trade frictions and risks of uncertainty to corporate confidence.
Knapp believes that under the influence of policy uncertainty, U.S. corporate capital spending is expected to continue to decline next year.
Analysts believe that although consumption growth has formed strong support for the U.S. economy in the second quarter, there are more and more signs that economic and trade frictions and the uncertainty they bring have affected consumer confidence and adversely affected the U.S. consumption prospects.
Richard Curtin, the head of the survey and an economics professor at the University of Michigan, recently said that in the latest survey, 38% of consumers spontaneously mentioned the negative impact of tariffs on the U.S. economy, which is the highest in a year and a half.
For the future trend of the U.S. economy, analysts generally believe that the U.S. economy will continue
However, some experts said that if the economic and trade frictions were alleviated, the performance of the U.S. industrial sector and financial markets would improve.
Kathleen Burch, a global economist at the Economist Intelligence Unit, expects that in the future, the U.S. economy will continue the gradual downward trend since the beginning of this year, and the growth rate will fall to a lower level than in the second quarter.
Mark Zandi, chief economist at Moody's Analytics, predicts that the U.S. economy will grow by 2.3% this year, assuming that economic and trade frictions will not continue to escalate, and will further slow down to 1.6% next year.
Ellen Hazen, investment manager at Patnan Investment Company, pointed out that the biggest concern of enterprises at present is the economic and trade disputes and the uncertainties they bring, if the economic and trade disputes can be resolved, the uncertainty will be greatly reduced, and the performance of the industrial sector will be much better than now.
Miller-Tabak Asset Management Stock Strategist Matt Merley said that economic and trade frictions are still the "primary problem" and the main reason for the sharp fluctuations in the U.S. capital market this year, and whether economic and trade frictions can be properly resolved will be the key to affecting the direction of the U.S. capital market for the rest of this year.
Ningxia first husband and wife joint parental ways 0 to 3-year-old children's parents can rest for 10 days a year
Safeguarding women's legitimate rights and interests is the embodiment of respecting and protecting human rights, and it is also an important symbol of the progress of social civilization.
On September 27, at the 15th meeting of the Standing Committee of the 12th National People's Congress of the Ningxia Hui Autonomous Region, the "Regulations on the Protection of Women's Rights and Interests in Ningxia Hui Autonomous Region" was passed with high votes.
This is Ningxia's first provincial-level local regulations to comprehensively and systematically safeguard women's legitimate rights and interests, which will be formally implemented from November 1, 2019.
It is understood that the "Regulations" adopted this time are revised on the basis of the "Ningxia Implementation of the "People's Rights and Interests of the People's Republic of China Law" in 2007, divided into 9 chapters and 65 articles, including general principles, political rights, cultural and educational rights and interests, labor and social security rights, property rights, personal rights, marriage and family rights, legal responsibilities, by-laws.
In the "Regulations", Ningxia encourages the exploration and implementation of joint parental leave, which is still the first in the country.
In April of this year, the Guiding Opinions promulgated by the General Office of the State Council on Promoting the Development of Care Services for Infants and Young Children Under 3 have a relevant description for the common childcare of husband and
In the process of revising the "Regulations", Ningxia innovatively proposed to "encourage the employer to give 10 days of joint parental leave each year for couples who have children in accordance with the provisions of laws and laws and regulations.
At the same time, the Ordinance highlights anti-sexual harassment and the protection of female minors.
In Article 43 of the Regulations, the latest legislative results in the composition of China's current civil code have been absorbed, and the constituent elements of sexual harassment, the subjects and mechanisms against sexual harassment have been refined.
Article 44 of the Ordinance prohibits the frequent sexual abuse of girls, and requires educational institutions to carry out relevant education, protection and prevention work, which has become a new benchmark for the protection of girls in local legislation.
With regard to women's right to information and treatment of common property, Article 35 of the Regulations clearly stipulates women's right to information on common property and the obligations of property registration institutions and related subjects, and provides solid institutional support for women's rights to protect their rights.
In addition, in response to the hot social issue of gender discrimination in employment, Article 26 of the Regulations not only prohibits direct discrimination, but also prohibits indirect discrimination, and absorbs the latest practical experience of joint interviews, enhances the punishment for gender discrimination violations, and more effectively protects women's legitimate rights and interests.
In recent years, Ningxia Women's Federation, together with the Public Inspection and Law Division, civil affairs and other departments have promoted and introduced social professional forces to participate in the mediation of disputes between marriages and families and against domestic violence, with remarkable results.
The "Regulations" summarize and improve this, and a number of laws encourage the mobilization of social forces and the accumulation of social resources to jointly safeguard women's rights and interests, and require people's governments at or above the county level to provide stable and institutional guarantees and support through the purchase of services.
Inner Mongolia Xing UNITA Yuan Longping academician workstations resistant to saline rice per acre of rice
The reporter learned from the administrative office of Xing UNITA in the Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region on the 27th that the good news was uploaded to the "Saline-resistant Rice On-site Measurement and Acceptance Assessment Council" held a few days ago by Xing UNITA Academician Yuan Longping.
Six experts from Heilongjiang Provincial Academy of Agricultural Sciences, Yangzhou University and Hunan Provincial Department of Agriculture and Rural Affairs conducted on-site sampling and harvesting of "Xixing Salt Series" rice.
After expert evaluation, in the pH of 8.8 to 9.6, the salinity content is in the land of 5‰ to 6‰, and the average yield of saline and alkaline rice reaches 508.8 kg per mu.
"Our next step is to innovate on the basis of this year's test, but also to reform, the salt-tolerant rice varieties are cultivated and optimized again, so that the quality is better and the yield is higher."
Lai Yongcai, leader of the expert group of measurement and production, vice president and researcher of Heilongjiang Provincial Academy of Agricultural Sciences, said: "Under the premise that the factors of production remain unchanged, I believe that we will continue to strengthen scientific and technological research, and salt-tolerant rice will continue to produce a miracle on the saline land."
Xing UNITA belongs to Daxing'an Ling South Lu concentrated special hardship area.
In October 2018, Academician Yuan Longping's working station was inaugurated in Xing UNITA.
Academician Yuan Longping led the expert team to accelerate the introduction and promotion of the newly cultivated "saline-resistant hybrid rice" varieties and advanced technologies, built a 960-acre saline-tolerant rice base in the right-wing Chinese flag of Korqin, adopted a side test demonstration, and promoted the technical route to help the local poor to increase production and increase income, get rid of poverty and get rich.
The on-site measurement and production of saline-tolerant rice not only injects hope for the improvement of low-yield fields of saline and alkali in Xing UNITA into high-yielding fields, but also provides a scientific basis for the cultivation of saline rice under the same conditions in China.
According to the Australian network, after a marathon debate and weeks of protests, on September 26 local time, Australia's new state passed the abortion legalization bill.
It is reported that the bill has triggered political debate in the past eight weeks, and there have been serious divisions within the Australian Liberal Party since independent MP Greenwich announced the introduction of the bill.
According to the report, after nearly 40 hours of discussion, the Australian Senate passed the abortion legalization bill on the evening of the 25th by a vote of 26 to 14, making it the third-longest bill considered by the NSW Senate.
On the morning of the 26th, after a final vote in the NSW House of Representatives, abortion in NSW was legalized.
The bill allows a woman to terminate a pregnancy at 22 weeks of pregnancy and, if two doctors agree, also allows a woman to have an abortion later in pregnancy.
On the evening of the 25th, the Senate passed an amendment, and doctors can seek advice from the multidisciplinary team of the Hospital Advisory Committee before performing an abortion for a woman after 22 weeks of pregnancy.
In addition, the amendment passed by the Senate also includes that doctors are required to provide appropriate care for infants who survive after terminating their pregnancies.
Previously, NSW Premier Berrigiquelyn had faced public criticism from conservatives on the bill, and Berrigiklian had repeatedly intervened in order to secure more debate time for the bill, but she did not attend the final vote.
"I need to take the time to manage the whole state," Beregixian defended his absentee vote, saying: "I need to take the time to manage the whole NSW."
It is reported that Australian Liberal MP Davis was the strongest opponent of the abortion bill, which threatened to withdraw from the NSW government, saying that the bill triggered a "government crisis".
However, Davis made concessions.
â€œAmendments to the bill to legalize abortion in the House of Representatives on the morning of the 26th actually provide more guarantees for women and doctors,â€ Davis said.
At the same time, Australia’s NSW National Party leader Barilaro said he was proud to be part of the government that legalizes abortion.
â€œWhat we achieved last night is historic for the new state, which legalizes abortion, which is no longer a crime and does not treat women as criminals.â€
Sany Group's major projects are located in Zhuzhou.
With a total investment of 15 billion yuan, it focuses on the development of petroleum intelligent equipment and smart steel industry.
Today, the Zhuzhou Municipal People's Government held a project signing ceremony with Sanyi Group.
Sanyi Group invested 15 billion yuan to develop industrial projects such as smart steel industry, oil intelligent equipment and regional research and development center (headquarters base), construction machinery used car market in Zhuzhou, with an annual comprehensive output value of more than 200 billion yuan.
With a total investment of 10 billion yuan, Sanyi smart steel industry project is located in Hetang District, which will focus on building the largest steel and product trading center in the province and even in the middle, and it is also an intelligent manufacturing and processing center for metal structural parts of Sanyi Group; with a total investment of 5 billion yuan of petroleum intelligent equipment and regional R&D center (headquarters base) project, the project will focus on the construction of petroleum intelligent equipment production base and build a regional R&D center and headquarters base.
At the same time, Sanyi Group will also build a used car market for construction machinery in Zhuzhou High-tech Zone, and carry out practical cooperation in intelligent manufacturing and other fields.
Zhuzhou attaches great importance to cooperation with Trinity Group.
The city listed the cooperation project as this year's city's investment "No. 1 project", the municipal party committee secretary Mao Tengfei, Mayor Yang Weiguo took the lead, the establishment of a special coordination group, efficient docking, high-level promotion, the whole for the development of Sany Group settled in Zhuzhou to provide high-quality and efficient services, from the intention to contact the formal signing of the cooperation agreement, less than 100 days.
Liu Kun, Minister of Finance: 67 central enterprises and financial institutions have transferred 860.1 billion yuan to enrich the social security fund.
Finance Minister Liu Kun said on the 27th that as of now, 67 central enterprises and central financial institutions have completed the transfer of some state-owned capital to enrich the social security fund, with a total transfer of state-owned capital of about 860.1 billion yuan.
Liu Kun made the above-mentioned statement at the task deployment meeting jointly convened by the Ministry of Finance, the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Security and the SASAC on the same day.
"The transfer of some state-owned capital to enrich the social security fund is an important measure to reform and improve the basic old-age insurance system, is the development results of state-owned enterprises for the sharing of the whole people and the basic pension insurance system is fully reflected, is based on the current, taking into account the long-term policy measures."
In 2017, the State Council issued the "Implimentation Plan for the Transfer of Some State-owned Capital Fulfilling the Social Security Fund", requiring the selection of some central enterprises and some provinces to carry out pilot projects.
According to Liu Kun, positive results have been achieved in the preliminary work.
At the central level, three batches of 67 central enterprises and central financial institutions have been transferred, and the total state-owned capital has been about 860.1 billion yuan.
Among them, the transfer of central financial institutions by the Ministry of Finance to perform the duties of investors has been basically completed.
The transfer of central enterprises already has a certain scale.
At the local level, the preliminary transfer work of enterprises has been carried out one after another.
As of the end of 2018, the pilot work of Zhejiang and Yunnan provinces was basically completed, transferring 15.8 billion yuan and 18.5 billion yuan of state-owned capital respectively.
In addition to the pilot provinces, other provinces have also successively carried out preliminary preparations for the transfer, laying the foundation for the next step in the implementation of the transfer.
According to the Ministry of Finance, the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Security, the SASAC, the State Administration of Taxation, and the Securities Regulatory Commission recently jointly issued a notice, the central and local governments transferred part of the state-owned capital to enrich the work of the Social Security Fund in 2019 and was basically completed by the end of 2020.
The meeting held on the same day made a specific deployment for the comprehensive implementation of the transfer work.
The meeting stressed the need to complete the transfer work pragmatically and efficiently.
According to the schedule, the transfer work should be basically completed by the end of 2020.
The working time is tight, and the task is heavy.”
Liu Kun said that all regions and departments should be carefully organized and carefully arranged to ensure the completion of the transfer work as required; solidly promote the work, accurately grasp the content of the transfer policy; strengthen communication and coordination, and solve difficult problems in a timely manner.
From the starting point of "Enriching the Social Security Fund's money bag", the destination is to provide strong support for pension security.
However, the author believes that this is not a simple equity "physical displacement", but opened the "mathematical addition".
On September 20, the Ministry of Finance, the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Security, the SASAC, the State Administration of Taxation, and the Securities Regulatory Commission jointly issued the "Notice on the Comprehensive Promotion and Transfer of Some State-owned Capital to Enrich the Work of the Social Security Fund", clarifying the timetable for the transfer of state-owned capital to the Social Security Fund, that is, the central and local transfer of some state-owned capital to enrich the work of the Social Security Fund in 2019.
After the publication of the document, the Ministry of Finance and other departments have also been implemented quickly.
On September 25, the Ministry of Finance transferred all 10% of the shares held by the Industrial and Commercial Bank and the Agricultural Bank to the Social Security Fund, and the total value of the two equity transfers exceeded 115 billion yuan.
According to the regulations, the Social Security Foundation, as a financial investor, enjoys the right to income, disposal and the right to know that it has entered into state-owned equity.
In the announcement, the ICBC and the Agricultural Bank said that this change in rights and interests will not lead to changes in the controlling shareholders and actual controllers of the Bank.
In this regard, the author believes that the transfer of similar state-owned enterprises is not a simple change in equity ownership, but can stimulate a series of effects of "addition operations".
The first step of some state-owned transfers to social security "additional results" can naturally reflect that state-owned enterprises are owned by the whole people, and the development results are shared by the whole people.
After years of reform and development, state-owned enterprises, especially central enterprises, are mostly in important industries and fields in China's economy, and their overall profitability is strong and relatively stable.
Among them, leading enterprises continue to become better and stronger.
On July 10, the executive meeting of the State Council decided to comprehensively promote the transfer of some state-owned capital to enrich the work of the Social Security Fund this year.
The Ministry of Finance immediately said that it will work with relevant departments, in accordance with the deployment of the executive meeting of the State Council, to comprehensively promote and transfer some state-owned capital to enrich the social security fund, which fully reflects the intergenerational fairness of the basic old-age insurance system and the development results of state-owned enterprises.
The second step of "addition results" is to enhance the sustainability of China's social security funds and further consolidate the foundation of the pension social security system.
With the aging of the population, China's social security funds are under pressure, and most of the state-owned capital that has been transferred as the main body has continuous profitability and dividend ability, which can not only effectively supplement the social security fund, but also provide the source of living water for the social security fund.
It is estimated that each transfer of 3.8 percentage points of state-owned capital, you can support the enterprise's basic old-age insurance contribution ratio reduced by 1 percentage point.
The third step of the transfer "adding results" is to add stabilizers to the capital market.
The way to obtain income from the transfer undertaker is to "pay dividends mainly, supplemented by operation".
As a financial investor of state-owned capital, the social security fund does obtain equity dividends.
However, as a value investor in the capital market, the social security fund has a strong capacity for capital operation.
For listed assets in state-owned capital, the participation of social security funds in shareholding will further optimize the governance structure of listed companies, which is conducive to improving the level of operation of enterprises and have a positive impact on listed companies and the capital market.
At the same time, as an investment vane and an increase in shareholding weight, the social security fund is conducive to further enhancing its influence in the market and playing the role of a "stabilizer" in the market.
In addition, it is also conducive to giving full play to the "value discovery" function of institutional investors, and guiding investors to rational investment and value investment.
Karl Hartmann was admitted to the Leipzig Conservatory at the age of 18, and studied at Webern.
After the Nazis came to power, Hartmann resisted in the form of non-publishing works in Germany, and later stopped writing.
In 1933, he created Miserae and dedicated the work to "my sleeping friends."
In 1935, the symphonic work premiered in Prague, but was harassed by Nazi bureaucrats.
After that, Hartman was determined not to play any of his own works under Nazi rule.
Hartmann's Funeral Concerto is a violin and string concerto at a time when the manuscript of the piece was stolen out of Germany and premiered in Switzerland.
Listen to the funeral concertos played by the Bern Chamber Orchestra at the Beethoven Music Festival in 2018.
U.S. U.S. Senate approves Scalia as labor minister
Xinhua News Agency, Washington, September 26 (Reporter Sun Ding Deng Xianlai) The U.S. Senate voted on the 26th to approve President Trump's nomination of Eugene Scalia as Secretary of Labor.
There were 53 votes in favour and 44 against, and no Democrats voted in favour of Scalia.
Republicans believe Scalia’s résumé makes him well-suited as secretary of labor.
But in the eyes of Democrats, Scalia has long stood in opposition to workers and unions during her career as a lawyer.
Scalia will replace Alexander Acosta.
According to U.S. billionaire Geoffrey Epstein, who was accused of "leniency" over alleged sexual abuse and trafficking of teenage girls, then-Labour Secretary-General Akosta announced his resignation in July this year under intense pressure from public opinion.
Scalia, a 56-year-old partner at a well-known U.S. law firm, is fathered by the late U.S. Supreme Court Justice Antonin Scalia.
The Department of Labor is the cabinet-level department of the U.S. federal government, responsible for labor-related affairs and so on.
The White House also issued a statement on the same day, saying that Trump has nominated Acting Director of the Federal Emergency Management Agency, Peter Geiner, to officially lead the agency.
According to the procedure, Gaina's nomination must also be approved by the Senate.
The U.S. Department of Emergency Management is part of the U.S. Department of Homeland Security and is responsible for coordinating federal resources to deal with natural disasters, terrorist attacks and other emergencies in the United States.
Since the debut of the 35th anniversary of the National Day parade, every time a large military parade is organized, there will be a "Big Mac" phalanx of strategic missile forces.
"This National Day military parade, is from the 'mution' into the 'army', the rocket army for the first time Chang'an Street."
Wang Bo, the head of the command group of the rocket army equipment team, said.
The experienced missile forces fully carried forward the spirit of being particularly able to suffer, especially able to fight, and especially able to contribute, with intensive training and scientific group training, and the whole process of military training reflected the three characteristics, showing a good image of strategic military services, and paying more attention to strict style.
In this military parade training, both generals and soldiers, are strict standard requirements, forging a hard style that is vigorous and forbidden.
They also pay attention to carrying forward the spirit of craftsmen, grasping every detail to practice technology, practicing perseverance, practicing style, forming the characteristics of "military posture, fast movement, bright answer", etc., and continue to use strict style to create phalanxes of powerful missiles, and pay more attention to scientific and technological innovation.
As a high-tech strategic military service, the rocket army is an excellent tradition and advantage when talking about science and technology and heavy innovation.
On the basis of learning from the past experience, they have broken the mindset, broken through traditional methods, used advanced means such as satellite positioning, laser ranging, high-definition imaging, real-time speed measurement, etc., to improve the level of training and quality benefits, and to ensure that the combination of people and cars is not bad, and the action of the team is not bad.
The troops under the acceptance of the rocket army adhere to the same standards and higher requirements of the parade ground and the launch site, hold each threshold, pay close attention to each detail, let the inspected troops withstand quenching tempering, and truly make the National Day parade field become a training ground and examination field to enhance the combat effectiveness of the troops.
Iran confirmed the development of advanced centrifuges to further suspend the implementation of the Iranian nuclear agreement
According to the "Central News Agency" reported that the United Nations International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) said on the 26th that Iran's use of advanced centrifuges to make enriched uranium has once again violated the Iranian nuclear agreement.
According to reports, Iran is gradually violating the restrictions of the Iranian nuclear agreement in response to US President Trump's withdrawal from the Iranian nuclear agreement in May 2018, the resumption and strengthening of sanctions against Iran.
Iran had suspended two other commitments in July to keep its stockpile of enriched uranium below 300 kilograms and to enrich no more than 3.67 percent of uranium, with further moves now.
According to the nuclear deal, Iran can only set up about 5,000 first-generation IR-1 centrifuges in Natanz to accumulate enriched uranium, in addition, Iran is only allowed to use a small number of more advanced models for research, but does not produce enriched uranium.
If Iran successfully develops more advanced centrifuges, it will be able to produce enriched uranium several times faster, which could be used to make nuclear bombs.
According to the report, the International Atomic Energy Agency reported: "On September 25, the agency has confirmed that Iran's advanced centrifuges with models 2 and 3 ... are accumulating or are ready to accumulate enriched uranium."
"They're busily working on [Natanz-enriched uranium] facilities," the U.N. International Atomic Energy Agency said in a response to the report.
The Vietnam-South Korea Investor and Entrepreneurs Association was officially unveiled.
Chen Hailing, chairman of the Vietnam-ROK Investor and Entrepreneurship Association, said that VKBIA will work together to serve as a bridge to strengthen Vietnam-ROK relations.
The two countries aim to increase two-way trade to $100 billion by 2020.
Mr. Chen Hailing believes that the birth of the association has become an important step towards achieving the above goals.
He hoped that the Party of Vietnam, the government and relevant functional institutions of the ROK would provide assistance for the future operation of the association.
Vietnam's Deputy Ambassador to the Republic of Korea Chen Changshui said that VKBIA will create a good platform for Vietnamese and ROK entrepreneurs to exchange and share experiences and ideas, aiming to expand the space for investment and cooperation and mutual assistance to make more effective contributions to Vietnam's economic development and integration into the international economy, and promote the vigorous development of Vietnam-ROK trade relations.
At the unveiling ceremony, VKBIA representatives signed a cooperation agreement with representatives of the Vietnam Agricultural and Agribusiness Association.
VKBIA coincides with the commemoration of the 10th anniversary of the establishment of a strategic cooperative partnership between Vietnam and the ROK, and is in the context of strengthening practical cooperation between the two countries in the fields of diplomacy, defense and security, and promoting trade and investment cooperation, aiming to achieve the goal of two-way trade of 100 billion US dollars by 2020.
Italy's education minister has proposed a sugar tax to protect people's health.
Lorenzo Fioramonti, the education minister of Italy's new government and a member of the five-star movement, recently submitted a movement to the parliament, recommending that the Italian government implement a new tax policy on drinks, snacks and tickets with high sugar content.
According to reports, according to the bill proposed by the Minister of Education Fiora Monti, the Italian government will impose a snack tax on food products such as sugary drinks and snacks; at the same time, it imposes a severe environmental tax on airline tickets, imposes 1 euro on domestic flights, and imposes 1.5 euros on international classes.
Fiora Monti said that through this series of seemingly small taxation measures, the Italian government is expected to receive 3 billion euros in taxes.
Funds derived from this tax will be used in the areas of education, health and environmental protection.
In response, Italian Prime Minister Conte said that he thought it was a feasible solution; Salvini, a member of the Italian parliament, a member of the European Parliament and the leader of the League party, tweeted that he asked everyone to hide desserts, biscuits, bread and confectioneries as soon as the new government began to impose a snack tax.
According to the report, the snack tax generally refers to a special tax on sugary drinks and high-calorie foods.
Exacting this tax helps bring benefits to public health.
On the evening of September 25, local time, the Chinese Embassy in Canada held a reception in Ottawa to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
OTTAWA, Sept. 26 (Xinhua) -- China's new Chinese Ambassador to Canada Cong Peiwu held a reception to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China in Ottawa on the evening of September 25.
In his speech, Cong Peiwu said that in the 70 years since the founding of New China, under the strong leadership of the Communist Party of China and with the joint efforts of the people of the whole country, the cause of socialism with Chinese characteristics has made remarkable achievements, which has not only profoundly changed China's appearance and benefited its own people, but also produced far-reaching world significance.
Based on its own national conditions, China has opened up a path of socialism with Chinese characteristics, expanded the ways for developing countries to move towards modernization, and contributed China's wisdom and China's solutions to solve human problems.
The participants stop to watch the themed photo exhibition on the 70th anniversary of New China held at the same time in the venue.
China has created a rare miracle in the history of human development in the world and made important contributions to promoting world peace and development.
China adheres to pursuing an independent foreign policy of peace, has always advocated the basic norms of international relations with the five principles of peaceful coexistence as the core, and is a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development, and a defender of the international order.
China's development has provided new opportunities for the development of all countries in the world, including Canada, to benefit the people of all countries.
Cong Peiwu stressed that the development history of China-Canada relations in the past 50 years shows that only by adhering to the principles of equality and mutual respect can bilateral relations move forward on the right track.
On the contrary, the relationship between the two countries will be frustrated, and the interests of the two countries will be damaged.
At present, China-Canada relations have encountered serious difficulties, and its responsibilities are not with China.
â€œYou still have to ring the bell.â€
It is hoped that as soon as possible, the Canadian side will come up with ways to properly resolve outstanding issues in bilateral relations and create conditions for bilateral relations to return
Canadian government officials, U.S. senators, friendly people from all walks of life, diplomatic envoys in Canada, as well as representatives of overseas Chinese, Chinese-funded institutions and international students more than 700 people attended the reception.
Diplomats such as Chen Mingjian of the Chinese Embassy in Canada attended the reception.
At the reception, a themed photo exhibition on the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China was held, and promotional videos such as "China 2019" and "Beautiful China" were played.
Sino-Canadian artists and embassy diplomats have performed distinctive literary and artistic programs.
This is also the first time that Cong Peiwu, as China's 16th ambassador to Canada, appeared in a public event.
Cong arrived in Canada on 22 September and the following day in Ottawa submitted a copy of his country ' s letter to the Chief Protocol Officer of Canada and Director of Protocol of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Wheeler.
Born in May 1967, Cong Peiwu graduated from the Diplomatic Academy.
At the beginning of this century, he was based at the Chinese Embassy in Canada.
Prior to Canada, he served as Director of the North American Oceania Department of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of China, and had previously served as Minister Counsellor and Ambassador of the Chinese Embassy in the United Kingdom.
