The Chinese Embassy in Indonesia and the Chinese Mission to ASEAN held a reception for the 70th anniversary of the National Day.
On the evening of the 26th, the Chinese Embassy in Indonesia and the Chinese Mission to ASEAN held a reception in Jakarta to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
Indonesia's Minister of Trade Lukita, Minister of Land and Spatial Planning Sophie, Deputy Secretary-General of ASEAN Kang Fu and other guests attended the reception.
Friends from all walks of life in Indonesia, representatives of various countries in Indonesia, ASEAN missions and international organizations in Indonesia, representatives of overseas Chinese, Chinese-funded institutions and international students, and more than 1,000 winners of children's painting on the theme of "I and China" participated in the reception.
China's Ambassador to Indonesia Xiao Qian and Ambassador to ASEAN Huang Xilian warmly welcomed the arrival of guests.
On behalf of the Chinese Embassy in Indonesia and on behalf of the ASEAN Mission, Xiao Qian said that in 1949, the birth of New China ushered in a new era in China's history.
China has moved from closure and backwardness to opening up and progress, from lack of clothing and food to a well-off society, and from poverty to prosperity and prosperity, the Chinese nation has ushered in a historic leap from standing up and getting rich to getting stronger.
Xiao Qian said that in recent years, China-Indonesia relations have made great progress, political mutual trust between the two countries has been continuously strengthened, practical cooperation has been continuously promoted, exchanges in various fields have been comprehensively expanded, and the China-Indonesia comprehensive strategic partnership has been stable and far-reaching.
China-ASEAN relations have been continuously improved and upgraded, and we have always adhered to mutual respect, understanding, trust and support, so as to vigorously promote regional peace, stability and prosperity.
Xiao Qian said that the fundamental development and change of New China in the past 70 years is that the Chinese people, under the leadership of the Communist Party of China, have created and developed the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics.
This road conforms to the trend of the times, conforms to China's national conditions, profoundly changes the fate of the Chinese people and the Chinese nation, and also makes major contributions to the peaceful development of the world and the region, which is a path for a powerful country that has gone through, walked right and walked well.
"Celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China themed exhibition" attracted guests to stop and watch.
Xiao Qian expressed that China, Indonesia and ASEAN will always work together to jointly promote the construction of a new type of international relations, promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind, and make new and greater contributions to bilaterally, for the region and for the world.
Together, we watched a wonderful video reviewing the glorious achievements of 70 years of New China and reflecting China-Indonesia, China-ASEAN relations.
Divided into "China's brilliant development achievements", "China-Indonesia relations are stable and far-reaching", "China-ASEAN relations to improve the quality and upgrading" of the three parts of the video won warm applause.
At the reception, "Celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China" was also arranged, attracting guests to stop and watch.
Baidu's first self-driving taxi team starts trial operation
Yesterday, Baidu announced in Changsha that the trial operation of self-driving taxi team Robotaxi was officially opened.
The first batch of 45 Apollo and FAW red flag jointly developed by the "Red Flag EV" Robotaxi fleet has begun trial operation in the Changsha part of the open test section.
From now on, ordinary Changsha citizens will be able to apply to become seed users and have the opportunity to experiment.
An experienced passenger said that he was sitting in the back of the vehicle, clicking on the screen in front of the passenger's seat, and opened the vehicle's self-driving journey at one click.
In the car, for the safety of passengers and the current policies and regulations, the test-operated vehicles are equipped with a safety officer in the driver's seat to maximize the safety of passengers.
In the process of driving, the vehicle can be intelligently changed according to road conditions, and it can also judge the driving conditions of the surrounding vehicles, and make an automatic avoidance of close overtaking and other situations.
Throughout the experience, the passenger area screen shows the road conditions of pedestrians, cars, and even some traditional blind areas on the road in real time.
Even if the vehicle is blocked, you can also see the traffic light changes in front and the waiting time and other information in advance, and all the traffic conditions can be seen at a glance.
Unmanned driving has heard on TV before that I think it is far away from us, but today I found that it is in our lives, and it feels amazing.
We look forward to it to truly enter people's lives in the future.
In June 2019, Apollo obtained 45 manned test licenses issued by Changsha Municipal Government.
At present, Changsha's self-driving test open roads pass through Changsha Artificial Intelligence Science and Technology City, Meixi Lake, Yanghu Lake, Dawangshan, High-tech Zone and other areas, with a total length of 135 kilometers, and a demonstration area of 70 square kilometers, which is currently the longest mileage of China's roads, with the largest, covering the most complex scenes and the most advanced intelligent driving demonstration areas with the most advanced road coordination infrastructure.
It is expected that by the end of 2019, Apollo Robotaxi’s fleet’s test-operated roads in Changsha will cover about 50 kilometers, and the first half of 2020 plans to cover 135 kilometers of roads currently open in Changsha.
