China's development is an opportunity for the world, not a threat and a challenge.
White paper: China's development is an opportunity for the world, not a threat and a challenge.
The white paper pointed out that China's development is an opportunity for the world, not a threat and a challenge.
According to the white paper, with the rapid increase of China's comprehensive national strength and international influence, some people in the world are worried that China will take the road of "national strength must dominate", and some people put forward the so-called "China threat theory".
This has both cognitive misinterpretation, deep-rooted prejudices, psychological imbalances brought about by the loss of strength, and deliberate misrepresentation to safeguard their own vested interests.
To realize the prosperity and strength of the country, the revitalization of the nation and the happiness of the people is not only the dream of the Chinese people, but also the common dream of the people of all countries.
"China's development is an opportunity for the world, not a threat and a challenge."
The white paper pointed out that China is the main stabilizer and power source of the world's economic growth, China is the largest contributor to the world's economic growth, China's scientific and technological innovation has injected new momentum into the world's economic growth, and the role of China's economic stabilizer and power source in the future has become more prominent.
At present, the momentum of world economic growth is insufficient, and a stable Chinese economy is becoming more and more important to the world.
China's economy is shifting from high-speed growth to high-quality development, new-type industrialization, informatization, urbanization, and agricultural modernization have been accelerated, the economic structure has been deeply adjusted, industrial optimization has been continuously upgraded, and new economic growth points have emerged.
According to a study by the McKinsey Global Institute, by 2040, the integration of China and the rest of the world's economies is expected to create economic value of $22 trillion to $37 trillion, which is equivalent to 15% to 26% of the total global economy, and strengthening cooperation between the world's other economies and China will create huge economic value.
The white paper stressed that China's economy and the world economy have undergone structural changes and are deeply integrated.
China's more stable economic operation, higher quality of growth, and promising growth prospects are long-term benefits to the development of the world economy.
It is neither feasible nor harmful to see China's economic development as a "threat" and a "challenge", trying to push China out of the global industrial chain, supply chain, and value chain, so as to "decouple" China from the world economy.
The white paper pointed out that all-round opening-up creates more opportunities for all countries to share the "Chinese dividend".
China unswervingly adheres to a mutually beneficial and win-win opening-up strategy to achieve greater and higher-level opening-up. China has the world's most-potential consumer market, China is the most attractive investment destination, and larger-scale "going out" has benefited more countries.
"Openness should be two-way, mutually beneficial, and not one-way, one-sided and one-sided."
Mutually beneficial two-way can last in the long run.”
According to the white paper, China is committed to continuously expanding imports, easing market access, improving the business environment, and strengthening intellectual property protection, and other countries should also expand opening-up, take corresponding measures, and strive to improve their business environment.
Only when all parties meet each other can we create an open, inclusive, inclusive, balanced and win-win development environment, and jointly make the "cake" of development bigger and bigger, forming a mutually beneficial and win-win community of interests.
According to the white paper, China provides more public goods to the international community.
This includes promoting high-quality joint construction of the "Belt and Road", building a platform for multilateral dialogue and cooperation, actively participating in international and regional affairs, and actively carrying out foreign assistance.
"China's development has benefited from the international community, and it has never forgotten to give back to the international community and provide more and better public goods for the international community."
In a written interview with Xinhua News Agency, the general manager of the Russian Export Center Andrei Slepniov said that Russia is willing to strengthen cooperation with China in the field of economy and trade, further optimize the export structure, and promote the diversification of Russia's exports to China.
Slepniov pointed out that in Russia's exports to China, forestry, machinery manufacturing and chemical industries occupy a considerable proportion, at the same time, the export of agricultural products is also very important, including grease products, meat products and dairy products, as well as cereals, fish and seafood.
In recent years, Russia's exports of non-raw materials and non-energy products to China have also shown a good and stable development trend.
Referring to Russia's optimization of the export structure to China, Slepniov said that Russia has set the task of expanding exports of high-tech products to meet the import demand for high-tech products from all countries and regions, including China.
In the future, Russia will improve financial and non-financial support measures and promote further growth in the number of high-tech enterprises.
Slepniov said that Russia is willing to export construction technology and high-tech building materials to China and develop cooperation with China in the fields of drugs and aviation manufacturing.
Russia and China also have great potential for cooperation in the field of urban environmental development.
He stressed that Russia's products in many fields, compared with similar products in the West, "has advantages in terms of quality, price is also competitive."
Referring to the two countries' goal of achieving US$200 billion in bilateral trade by 2024, Slepnioff said that areas such as agriculture, machinery manufacturing, chemical industry and forestry will play an important role in achieving this goal.
The Russian side intends to promote the diversification of supply in these fields and promote the export of deep processed products.
He stressed that Russia intends to promote its exporters to enter the global value-added chain, of which China is one of the development directions.
Russian manufacturers in the fields of agriculture, metallurgy, oil and gas and chemicals are fully capable of participating in this process.
At present, the two countries need to continue to deepen the cooperation between enterprises, "the establishment of more Russian-Chinese joint ventures to jointly develop exports to third countries."
Slepniov said that the Russian export center is taking a variety of measures and services to support the export of Russian products to China through the Russian Export Credit and Investment Insurance Agency and the Russian Export-Import Bank.
At the same time, the Russian Export Center will continue to deepen cooperation with relevant Chinese departments, promote more convenient access to the Chinese market for Russian goods, and develop new types of exports to China.
There has been a significant increase in the growth of financial institutions around the world using RMB payments.
According to the latest “Rimbin Tracking Special Issue” released in London on the 26th, from July 2017 to July 2019, there is an obvious increase in the trend of financial institutions using RMB payments around the world.
At SWIFT's 2019 annual meeting in London, according to the "People's Renminbi Tracking Special Issue" released by the "Insight into the RMB from a London perspective", the number of financial institutions using RMB payments worldwide increased by 11.31% in July 2017, and the number increased from 1989 to 2,214.
Among them, the largest increase in the number of financial institutions using RMB payments in Africa and the Middle East increased from 143 in July 2017 to 173 in July 2019, an increase of 20.98%.
According to the report, as of August 2019, the RMB's share in global payment currencies was 2.22%.
At the same time, London plays a leading role in RMB offshore foreign exchange trading.
According to the report data, in July 2019, London's share of global RMB offshore foreign exchange transactions was 33.79%, ranking first in the world.
According to the report, London ranks first in global foreign exchange trading.
In July 2019, London's share of global foreign exchange transactions was 40.14%, compared with 12.93% in the United States and 7.67% in France.
The Ministry of Foreign Affairs Responds to Taiwan's so-called "diplomatic breakthrough": secretly self-inflicted personality
In response to Taiwan's personnel entering the United Nations Headquarters to participate in a meeting on religious issues, Chinese Foreign Ministry spokesman Geng Shuang responded at a regular press conference on the 27th that this small action is very dishonorable and generous.
According to Taiwanese media reports, the personnel of Taipei's New York office recently entered the United Nations headquarters to participate in a meeting on religious issues held in the United States, calling it a "diplomatic breakthrough".
The meeting you mentioned is a side event held by the United States on behalf of the United Nations, and it is not a meeting of the United Nations at all.
Geng Shuang said that Taiwan personnel in a sneaky way into the United Nations, self-inflicted personality, but also rendering that this is the so-called "diplomatic breakthrough", this kind of small action is very dishonorable, laughing and generous.
He pointed out that the United Nations side has repeatedly reiterated that it adheres to the Taiwan issue in accordance with General Assembly Resolution 2758, and the majority of United Nations Member States also adhere to the one-China principle.
Hohhot accelerates the upgrading of the dairy industry structure-Xinhua.com
Xinhua News Agency, Hohhot, September 27 (Reporter An Lumeng) The reporter learned from the Hohhot Municipal Government of Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region that Hohhot City has accelerated the upgrading of the dairy industry structure, Yili, Mengniu ranks among the top ten global dairy enterprises, accelerates the implementation of a number of projects such as Yili Health Food Industrial Park and Mengniu China Dairy Industrial Park, and makes every effort to build a "upgraded version of Chinese milk".
Dairy is Hohhot's traditional advantageous industry, relying on unique resource endowments, industrial bases and policy support, Hohhot's dairy industry has expanded rapidly, and the rate of large-scale breeding has been continuously improved.
In 2018, the city's large-scale dairy farming rate reached more than 98%, nearly 85% of farmers entered the industrialization chain, and the total sales revenue of Yili and Mengniu were close to 150 billion yuan.
In order to further expand and strengthen the dairy industry, Hohhot City has issued a number of opinions on "creating an upgraded version of China's milk" and a three-year action plan to promote the upgrading of the dairy industry (2018-2020), focusing on the goal of realizing the goal of dairy manufacturing 4.0, and implemented the "five major upgrades" plan for the construction of high-quality milk source bases, the interests of agricultural enterprises, the cultivation of hundreds of billions of leading enterprises, the cultivation of characteristic small and medium-sized enterprises and the international innovation of the dairy industry.
Feng Yuzhen, mayor of Hohhot City, said that the local government will accelerate the implementation of the two major investment projects of Yili Health Food Industrial Park and Mengniu China Dairy Industrial Park, and simultaneously build projects such as the national dairy technology innovation center to continuously enhance the core competitiveness of the national dairy industry.
On September 27, the median exchange rate of the Vietnamese dong against the US dollar increased by 5 dong.
In the case of exchange rate fluctuations of +/- 3%, the upper limit of the exchange rate of the US dollar against the Vietnamese dong is 23,854 dong and the lower limit is 22,465 dong.
The bank's RMB bid and ask prices were 3,211 VND and 3,295 VND, respectively, down 1 VND from the previous trading day.
Techcombank set the bid and ask prices for the U.S. dollar at 23,131 VND and 23,271 VND, respectively, down 2 VND from the previous trading day.
The bank's RMB bid and ask prices were 3,193 and 3,326 dong, respectively, down 1 and 2 dong respectively from the previous trading day.
"China's good story" database launched to show the world the real three-dimensional and comprehensive China
With the purpose of "telling China's story well, spreading China's voice well" as the purpose of foreign propaganda work innovative, basic platform - "China's good story" database was officially launched today, showing the world the real, three-dimensional and comprehensive China.
"China's good story" database (www.chinastory.cn) is sponsored by Xinhua News Agency and hosted by Xinhua News Agency China Search.
This is the scene of the on-line press conference of the database of "Beautiful and the United States-Community - 'Good Story of China'" taken on September 27.
On the same day, with the purpose of "telling China's story well and spreading China's voice well" as an innovative and basic platform, the database of "China's good stories", was officially launched to show the world a true, three-dimensional and comprehensive China.
Open the database of "China's good story", and a long-term water-and-in-the-ink fish map is slowly unfolding, opening up a treasure trove of Chinese stories through time and space for a long time.
The database contains more than 60,000 wonderful stories, from the traditional stories of â€œfuturely reporting to the countryâ€ and â€�œfoolishly moving mountainsâ€ , to the story of â€œI’ll be selfless,â€ â€œI won’t forget my original heart,â€ tens of thousands of good Chinese stories have become vivid carriers of “Chinese spirit”, â€œChinese wisdomâ€ and â€œChinese powerâ€ .
The story library brings together the "1+4" five types of themed stories.
General Secretary Xi Jinping is the "first interpreter of China's story", the "learning" section takes Xi Jinping's story, Xi Jinping's story, Xi Jinping's story and the story of Xi Jinping's favorite characters as the main line, which provides a rich and convenient online platform for readers to learn Xi Jinping's art of storytelling and to understand the truth of governing the country.
The reporter learned from today's "U.S. and the United States - "China's good story" database online conference held in Beijing, "China's good story" database opened a Chinese and English website and mobile phone client.
The content of the website is comprehensive, full of functions, design and fashion, and the whole media shows wonderful stories.
The mobile phone client highlights the artificial intelligence voice function, adapts to the trend of mobile communication, and provides users with the "good story of China" player that they carry with them.
In order to facilitate the use of queries, the database gives full play to the advantages of intelligent search technology for Chinese search, and provides rich search functions in the form of time search, map search, character search, label search, etc., which is convenient and fast, and easy to find and easy to use.
"China's good story" database has also set up an open content platform, which has opened a "story number" for more than ten first resident units such as the SASAC.
Demonstrations ousted by the oust of the Egyptian mountains and rains, and the authorities showed a strong crackdown.
Twitter hashtags and social media are advocating that Egyptians take to the streets today to peacefully call on President Sisi to step down.
However, the authorities have indicated that they intend to use force to suppress it.
Since then-Military chief Sisi seized power in a military coup in 2013, the expression of dissent has almost disappeared in Egypt, and any forms of protests have been put into extreme danger.
Cairo’s Egyptian Center for Economic and Social Rights said more than 1,900 people had been arrested since a rare ousting of protests over the weekend calling for Sisi to step down.
Accusations of vanity surrounding Sisi and his family’s profligate pursuit of vanity have led thousands of people to take to the streets since the 20th.
Egypt's Interior Ministry firmly said yesterday that any attempt to undermine the country's stability will be decisively attacked and will not be soft.
Cairo's city centre has long been heavily guarded, with riot police, security agency vehicles and plainclothes police seen everywhere on the streets around Tahrir Square, Egypt's revolutionary tipping point in 2011.
Al Jazeera reported that security forces detained a number of important scholars and sages on the 25th, including a professor of political science at Cairo University and a well-known columnist.
He tweeted on the 24th: "I have no doubt that continuing the absolute domination of Sisi will cause disaster."
“It is in Egypt’s interest for him to step down immediately.”
Prior to Nafa's arrest, Hosni, who had served as a spokesman for Egypt's former military chief of the military, was taken into custody.
Anna was arrested last year after trying to run against Sisi for the presidency.
The President of the Constitutional Party, Davud, was also taken into custody.
Analysts and politicians believe that at a time when the economic woes of the poor and the middle class are intensifying, sweeping away dissent reflects the government’s instability and fragility.
Ayman Nour, the leader of the opposition and once running for the presidency, said: "The crackdown highlights the regime's indifference to the Egyptian people and how afraid it is."
“Because the economy has been thrown into a mess by him, combined with widespread political repression, Sisi is trying to send a clear message to key generals and politicians who may replace him.”
Knoll pointed out that in the context of the continuous deterioration of the socio-economic situation, the government's repressive approach will only increase people's anger.
Now that the fear barrier has been broken, he expects more people to take to the streets.
Ali, a businessman and actor currently in exile in Spain who had been a construction contractor for the Egyptian military, began uploading a series of videos earlier this month, claiming to benefit from government corruption, detonating a wave of small-scale demonstrations in different cities over the weekend.
Ali said that his company's Amrack general contracting does not have to go through the statutory bidding process to get lucrative contracts, emphasizing the corruption of the military and Sisi's relatives, including first lady Intissar Amer al-Sisi.
He repented of his participation.
Ali claimed that he helped Sesigay's magnificent palaces and luxury hotels, in stark contrast to the abject poverty of the current Egyptians, and that the other party has not yet paid.
On Twitter, hashtags such as “Come forward and you’re not alone,” “Sessi you’re finished,” “Sisid rolls,” and “ next Friday” have attracted tens of thousands of tweets and pushbacks, calling on people to take to the streets in a peaceful way to demand Sisi’s ouster.
Amarwick, a Hollywood Egyptian, has nearly 7 million followers on Twitter.
He tweeted yesterday in Arabic: "Sisi is destined to be finished ... he's done, and those who support him are going to make a big mistake now."
The Hong Kong government has launched a free special training plan to help employees who have recently been affected by the economy.
On the 27th, the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region announced the introduction of a free special training program for employees who have recently been affected by the economic situation, and qualified trainees can receive a training allowance of HK$4,000 per month after completing the course.
There are very few boutiques in Hong Kong's Tsim Sha Tsui Harbour City.
Affected by the recent social disputes in Hong Kong, the number of tourists visiting Hong Kong has dropped sharply recently, in addition to the tourism industry, hotels, catering, retail and other industries have been affected.
The Secretary for Labour and Welfare of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region (HKSAR Government), Luo Citang and the Secretary for Commerce and Economic Development, Qiu Tenghua, met with the media on special training programmes and measures to support the tourism industry.
Luo Zhiguang described that the challenges faced by Hong Kong's economy are imminent, and it should not wait until the situation is calm to start work.
Therefore, the Hong Kong SAR government has launched this free training program called "Special ? love and value".
According to reports, from June 1st, those who are unemployed or are required by their employers to take unpaid holidays will have the opportunity to participate in the plan as long as they meet the relevant requirements.
The most important part of the curriculum is the training of "vocational skills", covering 19 industries, including tourism, retail and catering, etc. There will also be some new "innovative technology" courses, as well as cross-industry "universal skills" courses.
Yu Pengchun, chairman of the Employee Retraining Bureau, said that tuition fees for all courses are free, and it is expected that the plan can support about 10,000 people in need.
Participating students who complete each full-time or part-time course and have an attendance rate of 80% can receive a special allowance, with a monthly allowance limit of HK$4,000 per participant.
According to reports, the training course lasts 2 to 3 months and is provided by about 50 training institutions, and members of the public can read daily from October 3 to March 31 next year, and each person can report up to 4 courses.
In addition, the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government also announced a series of measures to support the tourism industry to help the industry overcome difficulties.
These measures include easing allocations to the tourism council, subsidizing 6,000 tour guides to renew their reading courses, and exempting travel agents from annual fees.
Are you tired and tired of exercise?
According to the Russian satellite network, a study of athletes shows that after high-intensity exercise, the brain will also show signs of fatigue.
This study, led by Mathias Perciglion, an expert at Pietier-Salpetril Hospital in France, shows that there is no obvious connection between mental and physical labor: both require cognitive control of activity.
â€œYou need to control the autonomy process that forces yourself to stop when your muscles and joints are in pain.â€
This study was initiated by the French National Institute of Sport (INSEP).
The school’s experts are responsible for guiding athletes to prepare for the Olympics.
Some athletes have begun to suffer from overtraining syndrome, that is, there is an irrepressible feeling of fatigue after high-load exercise, the body is unable to recover, and their performance has declined.
INSEP raises the question of whether some of the causes of this condition are nerve fatigue, which is caused by excessive mental exertion.
The study was published in the journal Current Biology.
A few days ago, the Ministry of Culture and Tourism and the China Art Museum specially planned to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
Xu Beihong's "Ben Ma", Qi Baishi's "The Year of Peace", Li Keqing's "Wanshan Red Forest", "Tajik Bride", Luo Neutral "Father", Liu Wenxi's "grandson four generations" more than 480 pieces of high-quality works, bringing together more than 20 important art museums in the country, including almost all the classic works.
"Great History Magnificent Paintings - Celebrating the 70th Anniversary of the Founding of the People's Republic of China Art Exhibition" rich and multi-dimensional display of the great history and brilliant achievements of the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China, showing the Chinese people's tenacious and unremitting fighting spirit and self-improvement great spirit.
The exhibition is divided into one prologue and four chapters.
The exhibition has a huge scale of masterpieces, more than 480 works on display, covering Chinese paintings, oil paintings, engravings, sculptures, watercolours, annual paintings, promotional paintings and many other art types, based on the Chinese Art Museum collection of classic works, bringing together more than 20 important academic institutions in China and the classic collection of art museums.
In addition, more than 130 new works on realistic themes just completed by the Ministry of Culture and Tourism organized and implemented by the Ministry of Culture and Tourism have also been concentrated for the first time.
In order to present this exhibition, the China Art Museum for the first time called all the exhibition space of the museum, in addition to the three floors of the exhibition hall is all used, the outdoor courtyard space has also been built into a sculpture exhibition area, and through the exhibition design to form an internal and external corresponding exhibition pattern.
It is reported that this exhibition will be on display until November 2.
According to the unified arrangement of Beijing's activities to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China, the China Art Museum will be suspended from September 28 to October 1.
September 27 is "World Tourism Day", this year's theme is "Tourism and work: building a better future for everyone", the Tourism Bureau arranges a series of activities, including the reception of lucky tourists and traditional pallet competitions, with residents and tourists to celebrate.
On the same day, the special "World Tourism Day" celebration dinner to promote exchanges with the tourism industry, the Director of the Department of Social and Cultural Affairs Tan Junrong and others to participate in this global tourism event, and actively promote the sustainable development of Macao's tourism industry.
On the same day, the director of the Tourism Bureau, Wen Qihua and the deputy director Xu Yaoming, and other leaders and relevant directors came to Macao International Airport on the same day to send souvenirs to the lucky passengers of "World Tourism Day".
Mr. Wipoosiri, a traveler from Thailand who has became a lucky traveler this year, said that about four to five times a year, Macao is a tourist destination suitable for large and small travel, you can enjoy Macao's cuisine on weekend holidays and visit the city of Macau.
Macao tourism mascot "Macau" robot is also present to welcome tourists, and the passenger inquiry office of the Tourism Bureau also arranges to provide souvenirs to the passengers throughout the day.
On the afternoon of the same day, the traditional pallet competition was held, gathering nearly 180 participants, representing more than 29 hotels and restaurants in Macao, etc. This year, on behalf of the 20th anniversary of the establishment of the Macao Special Administrative Region, the contestants lined up in a digital "20" photo before departure, adding joy to the event.
There are also participants who wear special costumes with the return theme.
Each contestant held a tray carrying a bottle of "Macao beer" through the streets of "Macao's historical city" to safely send the beer safely to the place in front of the terminal pavilion at the fastest speed, the process was tense and exciting, attracting a large number of tourists to stop and take pictures along the way, and even cheered the participants, showing Macao's tourism charm.
The men's group championship was won by Warren Obejas Cabada in the center of Sand City, Macao; the women's group championship is Ye Xiaoqin of Jiajing Group; the most special costume winners are Cui Zhihong of Jiajing Group's Ou Huanming and Jinlong Hotel.
On the evening of the same day, the Tourism Bureau invited representatives of relevant departments, representatives of the industry and the media and hundreds of other guests to attend the World Tourism Day celebration dinner.
At the dinner, Tan Junrong said at the dinner that Macao's tourism development has returned for 20 years, but at present, in the face of changes in external environmental factors, the industry is encouraged to require innovative thinking, on the basis of the success that has been achieved, to move forward, to adjust the strategy and conceive of new tourism products and promotion models, to expand the market, and to encourage the industry to continue to support the vigorous and sustainable development of Macao's tourism industry.
At the same time, with the theme of "Celebrating the 20th anniversary of the establishment of the Macao Special Administrative Region", the dinner also arranged for Macao singers to sing the return song of the local original congratulatory song "Lian into one family", as well as six large-scale tourism enterprises presented a number of performances with the theme of return, showing Macao's diversified tourism and leisure elements and the versatile side of tourism practitioners.
Since 1980, the World Tourism Organization has designated September 27 as World Tourism Day with the aim of promoting international awareness of the importance of tourism, especially its social, cultural, political and economic values.
The central bank carries out 30 billion yuan reverse repurchase operation
BEIJING, Sept. 27 (Xinhua) -- The People's Bank of China (PBOC) carried out 30 billion yuan reverse repurchase operations in the form of interest rate bidding on September 27.
Due to the expiration of 40 billion yuan of reverse repurchase on the same day, the People's Bank of China's reverse repurchase operation achieved a net return of 10 billion yuan.
The central bank issued an announcement saying that 30 billion yuan of reverse repurchase operation was carried out on the same day, with a period of 14 days, and the winning interest rate was 2.7%.
This is the 7th consecutive working day for the central bank to carry out 14-day period reverse repurchase operations.
According to the Shanghai Interbank Offered Rate (Shibor) released on the 27th, the overnight rate was 1.313%, down 32.4 basis points from the previous trading day; the 7-day rate was 2.59%, up 1.3 basis points from the previous trading day; the 14-day interest rate was 2.95%, down 1.7 basis points from the previous trading day; the one-year rate was 3.048%, the same as the previous trading day.
Let Chinese citizens "go out" with more peace of mind - Cui Aimin, Director of the Consular Department of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs
No matter where you go, the motherland is behind you.
On the 25th, the first consular protection public welfare short film of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs went online, and this sentence at the end of the short film aroused the resonance of the majority of netizens.
Cui Aimin, director of the Consular Department of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, said in an interview with Xinhua News Agency that the short film aims to further let the people feel the feelings and temperature of "diplomacy for the people", so that Chinese citizens can feel that no matter where they are in any corner of the world, Chinese diplomats will reach out for their help, help, strength and hope.
There are no small things in overseas safety, one branch and one leaf.
Cui Aimin said that in the past 70 years, the number of Chinese citizens "going out" has increased dramatically, from "less than one million per year" before the reform and opening up to more than 100 million people per year; at the same time, the safety of Chinese citizens traveling abroad is more secure, and consular protection and assistance work objects have also expanded from overseas Chinese to various groups such as overseas Chinese, tourists, international students, and migrant workers.
According to statistics, since the 18th National Congress of the Communist Party of China, we have carried out more than 10 major actions to evacuate or transfer overseas Chinese citizens, and safely evacuated more than 40,000 Chinese citizens from dangerous and volatile areas.
There are about 500,000 cases of various types of requests for help, involving nearly 1 million Chinese citizens.
In dangerous times, the motherland can take you home; I want to come to a "travel to go", and now it is no longer a dream.
As of the end of August this year, China had concluded mutual visa exemption agreements with 14 countries covering ordinary passport holders.
In addition, more and more countries are unilaterally giving Chinese citizens the convenience of entry such as visa-free or visa-on-arrival.
Thailand, Egypt and other 42 countries and regions have unilaterally granted visas to Chinese citizens with ordinary passports, and 15 countries and regions such as Indonesia have unilaterally allowed Chinese citizens with ordinary passports to enter the country visa-free.
In addition to arrangements such as visa-free and visa-on-arrival, it has become more and more convenient for Chinese citizens to apply for visas and simplified procedures.
As of the end of August, China has reached agreements or arrangements with 41 countries to simplify visa procedures.
These include the United States, Canada, Israel, Argentina for each other's tourism, business personnel issued a 10-year valid multiple visa, the United Kingdom for each other's tourism, business, family visiters issued two-year multi-year visa arrangements and so on.
The United Kingdom and Belgium have jointly launched a "visa one-stop" service, and France, Italy and Singapore have reduced visa processing time to 48 hours, 36 hours and 24 hours respectively.
For business people who often go abroad, APEC business travel cards that have repeatedly entered and passed through customs clearance are a good choice.
According to Cui Aimin, holding the travel card is equivalent to obtaining five-year multiple visas for 16 economies around the Asia-Pacific region, which is of great significance to "going out" for business personnel, especially private enterprises.
At present, China's effective card ownership ranks first among APEC economies.
The Ministry of Foreign Affairs will actively negotiate bilateral visa reciprocity agreements, promote more countries to take visa facilitation measures for Chinese citizens, so that the results of diplomatic work will be more transformed into measures to benefit the people and people, and continuously improve the "gold content" of Chinese passports.
National Day is approaching.
Yesterday's morning, Cai Qi, secretary of the municipal party committee, led the team to check the supply of safe production and holiday markets during the National Day.
He stressed that it is necessary to improve the political position, strengthen the bottom line thinking, do all kinds of work in a solid and detailed manner, ensure the safe operation of the city and market supply, welcome the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China, and let the public have a happy and peaceful festival.
The deputy secretary of the municipal party committee and the mayor Chen Jining checked together.
The power supply area of the power supply service center in the Tian'anmen area is nearly 7 square kilometers, and an intelligent inspection system has been built to carry out real-time monitoring and analysis of the data to realize the intelligent operation and maintenance, evaluation and security of the equipment.
Cai Qi and Chen Jining carefully inspected the operation of power supply equipment and safe production, asked about the important details of the power supply guarantee work, and walked into the dispatching command hall, combined with a large screen to listen to the report on the safe power supply and gas supply work during the festival.
Cai Qi expressed condolences to the front-line staff, emphasizing that it is necessary to establish a bottom-line thinking, do a good job of firefighting and other work, go to the scene, pay attention to the end, and strengthen the investigation and monitoring of safety hazards and equipment operation at all points one by one to ensure the absolute safety of power supply and gas supply.
In Wangfujing department store, all kinds of goods are dazzling, full of festive atmosphere.
On the second floor of the ground floor, the peace bureau on the second floor, the walls of blue tile bricks and old shops such as chronological photography halls, large theaters, food stores, and old book bureaus are full of strong Beijing flavors everywhere.
Cai Qi and Chen Jining watched while walking, listened to Wangfujing Department Store with the transformation and upgrading of Pedestrian Street to enhance commercial operations and market supply reports, and learned more about the holiday guarantee situation.
Walk into the "Red Star Grain and oil shop" and "Great North Photo Museum" to understand the sales situation of Beijing's specialty goods, and ask tourists along the way about the experience and experience.
In Zhang Binggui's confectionery cabinet, Zhang Chao, Beijing's labor model, Zhang Binggui's son Zhang Chao, inherited the "one catch", "a clear" life, Cai Qi encouraged him to vigorously carry forward the spirit of labor models.
Cai Qijing said, strengthen market monitoring, to ensure that the holiday supply is sufficient and stable, strict food safety; shopping malls and other crowded places to do a good job of fire safety and other work.
The city's leaders Cui Shuqiang, Wang Hong and Zhang Jiaming participated in the inspection.
Jiangxi: The "line leader" guards the safety of the operation of the passenger train line.
The reporter learned from the Jiangxi Provincial Highway Administration that as of now, there are 1334 passenger routes in 11 districts and cities in Jiangxi and 6 direct management counties in Jiangxi.
The person in charge of Jiangxi Provincial Highway Administration introduced that due to the safety management of some passenger transportation enterprises in the form, the main responsibility of enterprise safety cannot be implemented, and illegal acts such as excessive speeding of passenger vehicles and fatigue driving by drivers occur, and the safety situation of road passenger transportation is more severe.
In order to further compact the main responsibility of the safety production of road passenger transport enterprises and ensure the safety of passenger travel, Jiangxi began to pilot the "line length system" in 2017, and began to gradually promote it in the province in 2018.
At present, 92 road passenger transport enterprises in Jiangxi have implemented the â€œlong line systemâ€ and selected 1,334 â€œlong lineâ€ management lines, covering 4,824 operating buses.
According to reports, the "long line" is generally appointed by the road transport passenger transport enterprises designated dedicated personnel, specifically responsible for the management of the relevant line of the people, cars, lines and other work, to ensure that the head of the line on the line, vehicles, drivers, operating environment, etc. to carry out comprehensive control, to ensure the safety of the operation of the line.
In order to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China and the 20th anniversary of the establishment of the Macao Special Administrative Region, the Municipal Council will hold a special food safety public tour from October to December, led by food safety educators to visit the "Twenty-year Photo Exhibition of Mainland Food and Agricultural Products for Australia" and "Food Information Station" to deepen the public's understanding of the safety supervision and stable supply of food from the Mainland, as well as measures to ensure food safety in Macao.
Co-sponsored by the General Administration of Customs and the Municipal Administration of the Macao Special Administrative Region, "Together Together - Safeguarding the Safety of Mainland Food and Agricultural Products for Australia's Twenty Years of Work Documentary Photo Exhibition" is now being held at the food information station on the first floor of the Youhan hawker building, attracting many local citizens to visit.
In order to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China and the 20th anniversary of the establishment of the Macao Special Administrative Region, the Municipal Council will visit the photo exhibition and the food information station on the first floor of the Youhan hawker building from October to December at 3:30 p.m. (except for public holidays) on the first floor of the Youhan hawker building, led by the food safety education personnel to visit the photo exhibition and the food information station.
The time of each food safety tour is about 30 minutes, and the public who are interested in participating can register with the food information station on the first floor of the Youhan hawker building 15 minutes before the beginning of the day's activities, and the cost is free, and the quota is limited.
If you have any questions, you can call 2833 8181 during office hours.
Fujian Provincial Tax Repository Bank Convenient Comprehensive Tax Payment Platform Officially Launched-Zhongxin.com
Fujian Provincial Tax Bank Convenient Comprehensive Tax Payment Platform was officially launched.
Fuzhou, September 27 (Ye Qiuyun) Fujian Provincial Tax Repository and Convenient Comprehensive Tax Payment Platform was officially launched in Fuzhou City, Fujian Province on September 27.
The reporter learned that on October 26, 2018, the Fujian Provincial Taxation Bureau of the Fuzhou Central Branch of the People's Bank of China and China UnionPay Co., Ltd. jointly signed a memorandum of understanding on tripartite cooperation to create the Fujian provincial tax bank convenience comprehensive tax payment platform in the first place in the country.
After nearly a year of construction, the platform has been successfully launched.
Wang Dehui, director of the treasury department of the Fuzhou Central Branch of the People's Bank of China, introduced that the platform adheres to the construction concept of security, versatility, convenience, compliance and leadership, connecting taxes, governments, banks, non-bank payment institutions and social service providers at the front end, providing online and offline tax payment channels such as mobile APP, WeChat public number, tax hall, bank branch, and inclusive financial service points.
It is reported that the platform brings together a number of Huimin convenience projects, of which urban and rural residents' medical insurance payment projects have been officially launched.
The project has opened 14 online and offline channels, which can provide services to more than 30 million urban and rural residents in Fujian Province, covering 76% of Fujian Province's resident population.
Online payment of medical insurance premiums can be paid by means of "Min Tax Pass", "Cloud Flash Payment", as well as the APP of various banks, WeChat public accounts, etc.; offline, you can pay medical insurance premiums in various ways such as scanning codes, swiving cards, swiping cards, etc. in various tax halls and rural inclusive financial services points in Fujian Province.
The deputy governor of the Fuzhou Central Branch of the People's Bank of China said that the successful launch of the platform, while ensuring the direct payment of government revenue into the warehouse and the real-time interaction of data information, can provide the public with safe, efficient, multi-channel and multi-modal convenience tax payment services for the public.
At present, more than 16,000 inclusive financial service points in the province, more than 9,000 have been opened for medical insurance payment functions, so that rural residents "out of the village" can safely check and pay for medical insurance premiums, so that the public has an increasingly strong sense of "sense", "happiness".
According to statistics, in the 20 days since the early trial operation of the platform's urban and rural residents' medical insurance payment projects, there have been 840,000 service users, of which 750,000 have been paid online, and nearly 20,000 have been paid for by inclusive financial service points.
In addition, Lin Guojie, deputy director of the Fujian Provincial Taxation Bureau of the State Administration of Taxation, revealed at the event that the platform was the first in the country to apply blockchain electronic payment certificate technology.
From the beginning of the next month, after completing the payment, the payer can also download the electronic payment certificate stamped directly through the mobile phone.
Based on blockchain technology, the Fujian tax information network is being built, and the "highway" to facilitate private tax payment will be further broadened.
The United States will increase the deployment of air defense systems and forces in Saudi Arabia.
The U.S. Department of Defense announced on the 26th that due to the previous attack on Saudi oil facilities, the United States will deploy an additional "Patriot" air defense system, four sets of Sentinel radar systems and about 200 U.S. troops in Saudi Arabia.
The Pentagon said in a statement on the same day that this deployment will enhance the air defense and anti-missile capabilities of important military targets and civilian infrastructure in Saudi Arabia, and enhance the U.S. military presence in the region.
U.S. Secretary of Defense Esper also approved the inclusion of two Patriot air defense systems and a set of THAAD anti-missile systems in preparation for the deployment sequence.
Some U.S. defense media questioned the effectiveness of the deployment, saying that the main interception targets of the "Patriots" and THAAD systems were not low-altitude targets such as drones and cruise missiles that the United States claimed.
Speaking at the general debate of the United Nations General Assembly on the 25th, Iranian President Hassan Rouhani said that while all countries can enjoy their rights fairly, Iran can help maintain the "security of the Persian Gulf" and ensure the smooth and safe passage of oil ships through the Strait of Hormuz.
At the same time, he stressed that only the withdrawal of U.S. troops from the region can achieve regional security.
On the 14th of this month, a number of drones attacked two oil facilities of the Saudi national oil company and caused a fire.
The U.S. blamed Iran for the attack and imposed new sanctions on Iran.
The chairman of Cellis's increase plan was completed last year's call for employees to increase their holdings by up to 43%.
On the evening of September 25th, Selise (603716.SH) announced that Wen Wei, the actual controller and chairman of the company, has increased the company's shares by 1.0542 million shares, accounting for 0.5139% of the company's total share capital (including stamp duty, commission, interest and other transaction fees), and completed the increase plan.
It is reported that before the implementation of this increase plan, Wen Wei directly held 8.58 million shares, accounting for 4.18% of the company's total share capital, controlling shareholder Tianjin Ruimei Science and Instrument Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Tianjin Ruimei") held 82.1835 million shares of the company, accounting for 40.06% of the company's total share capital, Wenwei held 66.06% of Tianjin Ruimei, is the actual controller of the company.
It is worth noting that this is not the first time that Celis has made a positive move.
Since September last year, in just one year, Seris has successively launched measures such as increased executive holdings, chairman-in-the-way investment initiatives, repurchased shares, and equity incentives.
On September 18 last year, Seris announced that the company Liu Wenhao and seven other executives who planned to increase their holdings have accumulated 394,300 shares of the company (accounting for 0.1922% of the company's total share capital), with a total increase of 70.229 million yuan, and the increase plan has been completed.
Shortly thereafter, Wen Wei, the chairman and the actual controller, proposed that employees increase their holdings of the company's stock plan, and promised to compensate Wen Wei if there were any losses.
From October 19 to October 31, 2018, the total limit of the company's shares will not exceed 150 million yuan, and the company's shares should be held continuously for more than 12 months after the increase, which should not be reduced, and the employee is employed in compensation.
The reporter combed and found that during the above-mentioned initiative, the employee's share price was 14.02 yuan, the highest was 16.44 yuan, and on September 25, the closing price of 20.02 yuan, the maximum floating price of the employee's increase reached 42.80%, the lowest reached 21.78%.
On January 21 this year, through the repurchase of the company's joint-stock program again, the announcement said that the total amount of funds to be used to repurchase shares is not less than 160 million yuan, not more than 280 million yuan.
On August 8 this year, the company issued an announcement of the "Seris 2019 Restricted Stock Incentive Plan (Draft)", and set high performance unlocking conditions.
According to the announcement, the equity incentive is based on operating income in 2018, and the growth rate of the four fiscal years from 2019 to 2022 is not less than 30%, 70%, 120% and 185% respectively.
Judging from the performance performance of Celise in the first half of the year, the company maintained high growth and exceeded this year's 30% performance growth to unlock conditions.
In the first half of the year, the operating income was 842 million yuan, an increase of 46.50% year-on-year; the net profit attributable to shareholders of listed companies was 56.2324 million yuan, an increase of 16.46% year-on-year.
Since the mid-term report of 2018, during the five consecutive reporting periods, the year-on-year growth rate of revenue has exceeded 38%, and the highest growth rate has reached 59%.
In 2018, the company established a dual-core-driven collaborative development strategy based on medical inspection intensive operation services (IVD services), medical consumable intensive operation services (SPD services) and regional inspection centers, and iteratively upgraded on the basis of consolidating the advantages of the original IVD business and promoting SPD business.
The relevant people told reporters that at present, in order to comply with the general trend of medical reform and achieve rapid expansion, the three major businesses of Seris are steadily advancing.
In the SPD business field, in January this year, Selis announced the signing of the "Medical Consumables Intensive Operation Platform Construction and Daily Operation Management Service Cooperation Agreement" with Lingwu People's Hospital and Lingwu City Chinese Hospital, with a contract period of three years.
"In fact, Seris is vigorously expanding SPD's business, providing medical institutions with centralized procurement, warehousing management, distribution and settlement and other refined operational services to obtain long-term income."
According to the above-mentioned persons.
On September 17th, according to the Zhejiang government procurement network Zhejiang government procurement service information platform announcement shows that Selis won the bid for a "medical consumables (including reagents) hospital logistics extension service project" of Shaw Hospital affiliated with Zhejiang University School of Medicine.
Pharmaceutical industry analysts pointed out that this winning bid is very rich, Shaw Hospital is China's first public hospital through the international hospital review (JCI), the smooth implementation of the project in the future, for the hospital is also an important development opportunity.
According to its analysis, Seris has basically completed the regional coverage of the country's provinces through regional expansion, national strategic cooperation and channel mergers and acquisitions.
At present, winning the bid for Shaw Hospital in the next city in Zhejiang, it should continue to replicate this model in different hospitals to enhance the company's competitiveness in the East China market.
In addition, this year, Selis is also deployed in emerging fields such as industrial hemp and blockchain technology.
Beijing's 78,000 volunteers serve National Day transportation.
In order to ensure the smooth progress of the celebration of the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, more than 78,000 transportation and civilization volunteers in Beijing will be officially posted from the 28th, providing voluntary services at all points in Beijing until October 8.
Previously, the leading group of Beijing's celebration of the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China set up a volunteer headquarters, and in the early stage, for universities, communities, enterprises, all walks of life, recruited and trained more than 160,000 high-quality volunteers, in the area of volunteer services involving the celebration of the conference, festive activities, large-scale achievement exhibitions, National Day parks and urban operation and security.
Among them, there are more than 78,000 traffic civilization volunteers.
From September 28th to October 8th, 78,266 citizens of the capital's transportation civilization carried out traffic diversion and 308 subway stations at 1,700 traffic intersections in Beijing, including more than 300 major transportation hubs for traffic guidance and traffic guidance.
Two months after being detained by Iran, Britain's "Stanner Empire" tanker was finally released, and on the morning of the 27th, he departed for international waters from the Iranian port of Abbas.
In the middle of last month, the British overseas territory of Gibraltar authorities had just released an Iranian tanker that had been detained for more than a month.
According to the Islamic Republic of Iran News Agency, at 9 a.m. local time on the 27th, the British "Stanner Empire" tanker departed from the port of Bandar Abbas and went to the international waters of the Persian Gulf.
Iran's Ports and Shipping Group in Hormuzgan province confirmed that the ship's commander and crew had made a formal and written commitment and that they had made no claims despite the ship's seizure.
Stena Bulk, the owner of the Swedish tanker the Steiner Empire, also said that the ship was sailing from the port of Barbas.
In addition, Refinitiv's vessel tracking data also found that the tanker began to move on the 27th and left the port of Abbas.
The British-flagged Stena Impero tanker was seized by Iran in July.
A spokesman for the company said the tanker was preparing to leave Port Abbas.
Two weeks after Britain seized an Iranian oil tanker off the coast of Gibraltar, Iran’s Revolutionary Guards detained the tanker, Stena Impero, through the Strait of Hormuz.
The ship was released in August.
Earlier this week, an Iranian government spokesman said that all the legal procedures required for the release of the Steiner Empire had been completed.
However, the Iranian side said that the investigation is still ongoing.
A number of Iranian media also released a video of the tanker sailing.
On July 19, Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guards Navy detained a British oil tanker "Stanna Empire" in Iranian waters in the Strait of Hormuz, and then escorted it to the port of Bandar Abbas.
Iran's detained oil tanker, Grace I, has left Gibraltar's waters.
In addition, on July 4, the British overseas territory of Gibraltar authorities seized the "Grace 1" tanker loaded with Iranian crude oil in the Strait of Gibraltar on the grounds of allegedly transporting oil to Syria in violation of EU sanctions.
More than a month later, more than a month later, on August 15, the Gibraltar authorities announced the release of Grace 1.
